    <node id="Nephthis">
      <data key="d0">Nephthis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nephthis is the sister of Osiris, associated with the barren edges of the desert.&lt;SEP&gt;Nephthis is the sister of Isis, Osiris, Typho, and Aroeris, and the wife of Typho, involved in mythological intrigue and pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Nephthis is the sister of Isis, Osiris, Typho, and Aroeris, also known as Nike, involved in mythological and love stories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06e492003a084ec018b849a310a4e995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7dc5cd694c8e04568651d4ad21b8623</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
