    <node id="Nike">
      <data key="d0">Nike</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nike is also named among the siblings of Osiris, representing victory or perhaps the deity associated.&lt;SEP&gt;Nike is an alternate name for Nephthis, the sister of Isis, Osiris, Typho, and Aroeris, associated with love and mythology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06e492003a084ec018b849a310a4e995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7dc5cd694c8e04568651d4ad21b8623</data>
