    <node id="Aac">
      <data key="d0">Aac</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Aac is a character in Maya mythology, the brother of Chaacmol, who murdered him out of jealousy.&lt;SEP&gt;Aac is a character associated with jealousy and familial relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Aac is a brother who murdered Chaacmol by stabbing him with a spear out of jealousy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-23ba6980ac19f47019ce87374bfbf5be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d60c6202de29d519891205dac45f966a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea61287f7c7aac52c315ee2cca003fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
