      <data key="d0">Warka</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Warka is an ancient city where inscriptions on tablets or bricks demonstrate similar writing techniques as the Maya used.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-23ba6980ac19f47019ce87374bfbf5be</data>
