    <node id="Idols">
      <data key="d0">Idols</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Idols are small representations of gods, often buried to prevent desecration among Maya artifacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Idols are objects or representations worshiped by some cultures, but the author doubts their existence in this context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65e48b610f2a391366b1dc455dacc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002cf134516b6f6702e5dfec7413096b</data>
