    <node id="Maya Language">
      <data key="d0">Maya Language</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maya language is an ancient tongue, among the oldest spoken by humans, with words and expressions surviving through time.&lt;SEP&gt;Maya language is the language attributed to the Maya civilization, in which words like “Hem” and “Maya” have specific meanings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maya language is an ancient language whose inscriptions have been deciphered and are studied to understand Maya civilization and culture.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maya language is an ancient language with a rich etymology, used historically by the Maya civilization and possibly recognized in Chaldea in remote ages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a65e48b610f2a391366b1dc455dacc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965b5b39cb58a29f56a43495ef18b6ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea61287f7c7aac52c315ee2cca003fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
