    <node id="Brahma">
      <data key="d0">Brahma</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Brahma is the creator god in Indian mythology, associated with Maya in the creation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Brahma is depicted as a vigorous man with four heads, playing a small drum, and is part of Hindu mythology related to music.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d60c6202de29d519891205dac45f966a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f440a8129c9633e91b0a40eef56e62b1</data>
