    <node id="Red Hand">
      <data key="d0">Red Hand</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The red hand is a symbol found in many ancient American and Indian temples, often dipped in red paint, possibly used as a cultural or religious symbol.&lt;SEP&gt;The red hand used by some Aborigines of America is a symbol historically associated with various religious and cultural practices, including marking vows and property.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d60c6202de29d519891205dac45f966a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0</data>
