    <node id="Online Distributed Proofreading Team">
      <data key="d0">Online Distributed Proofreading Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Online Distributed Proofreading Team is an organization dedicated to the production, proofreading, and distribution of digital texts. Its primary responsibility involves converting scanned images of books into accurate digital versions, ensuring that the text is properly proofread and edited to maintain fidelity to the original content. The team collaborates in processing digitized texts, making them accessible and usable for a broad audience. 

Specifically, the Online Distributed Proofreading Team works with digitized images provided by sources such as The Internet Archive and American Libraries, from which they produce digital files. Their efforts encompass proofreading, editing, and preparing these texts for dissemination. The team is credited with producing and distributing various publications, including specific titles like the "Child's Health Primer," and plays an integral role in the compilation, editorial review, and publishing processes of digital texts.

Overall, the Online Distributed Proofreading Team functions as a collaborative effort to ensure that digitized literary and educational materials are accurately processed and widely distributed, thereby supporting the digitization initiatives of major libraries and archival institutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Online Distributed Proofreading Team is responsible for producing and distributing the digitized version of the story.&lt;SEP&gt;The Online Distributed Proofreading Team contributed to processing the text, likely involved in digitizing or proofreading.&lt;SEP&gt;The Online Distributed Proofreading Team is responsible for producing the publication from images.&lt;SEP&gt;The Online Distributed Proofreading Team is responsible for producing the digital version of the book from images provided by The Internet Archive.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-53318967e1e0c7a354ac926405083d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37436bbfc5c51f8d3f5eadaa7be7704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14b5f22393f8a2efe13082af4bcd332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e35b84d5e9534312cd2edd202ad1eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c7457182fd8c984b4b4d5b338a0a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ab7ad03b323561e72dda983ec2d3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71a4a564b49b7f7ab5fc34553849e9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4861f1f36dbc583ebdad31a4a80a0aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c92bbb1fd6ed4d39b3fbf9331923c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c680d4e3c6d389236c61c1ca4a429d6</data>
