    <node id="Chichen-Itza">
      <data key="d0">Chichen-Itza</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Chichen-Itza is a renowned ancient Mayan city and archaeological site located in Yucatan, Mexico, celebrated for its exceptional architectural monuments, sculptures, murals, and ruins that reflect the高度 of Mayan civilization. The site encompasses a variety of structures, including pyramids, palaces, mausoleums, and temples, many of which are decorated with bas-reliefs, engraved slabs, frescoes, and mural paintings. These artworks often depict religious, mythological, and historical themes, offering insights into Mayan beliefs and practices.

Among its most significant features is the monument associated with Chaacmol, an important deity, which includes a funeral chamber and other structures adorned with sculptures and engravings. Notably, Chichen-Itza hosts sculptures that depict cosmic symbols, such as the floating image of the cosmic egg or Hiramyagarbha, emphasizing its religious and astronomical significance. The site also includes a palace with murals illustrating Mayan religious rituals and practices, as well as murals and sculptures depicting the culture’s mythology and religious iconography.

Furthermore, Chichen-Itza has yielded discoveries such as statues and mural paintings that deepen understanding of Mayan art and history. Its architectural and artistic elements demonstrate the high civilization level of its inhabitants and serve as a valuable cultural historical record. Overall, Chichen-Itza remains one of the most important archaeological sites of the Mayan civilization, offering a comprehensive view of their religious beliefs, artistic achievements, and societal organization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b991502e22e90fb761c5591cdca0b88e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d60c6202de29d519891205dac45f966a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ffcfc6ec928be11797840c2e48ac2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65c2b617b2b75df32a484e145b034fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cf3140092a745267effea6e9a53aa65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7d407dd88d4f39cbd7f09e60b40325&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f47d3b712e0953b518a70453701f3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea61287f7c7aac52c315ee2cca003fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b549627ac943f03650e7d7278845faf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5b2f7d138338b628491cb8bacb7fe79</data>
