    <node id="Marble">
      <data key="d0">Marble</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Marble is a limestone-based stone used for sculptured ornaments on monuments in Uaxmal.&lt;SEP&gt;Marble is used as a material to compare her features, indicating stone with a pale and bloodless appearance.&lt;SEP&gt;Marble is a type of limestone with various colors, historically used in statuary and gravestones.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-53318967e1e0c7a354ac926405083d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba43616fff0b8112616e172e23cfa8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a09a3405b807f7a33064172d2e463326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7</data>
