      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Senotes are large natural wells or circular holes with vertical walls, containing water or vapor, and are associated with gases and strange phenomena.&lt;SEP&gt;Senotes are natural wells or sinkholes in the Yucatan region, formed by caves and karst features.</data>
