      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The caves mentioned are extensive, honeycombed formations throughout the country, some beautiful with stalactites and stalagmites, containing water springs and streams.&lt;SEP&gt;Caves are extensive honeycombed natural formations throughout Yucatan, facilitating gas escape and earthquake immunity.</data>
