    <node id="Canaan">
      <data key="d0">Canaan</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Canaan is an ancient region, suggested to have a Maya origin meaning "to be tired" or "abundance."&lt;SEP&gt;Canaan is the land historically associated with the Israelites' acquisition, comparable to how the English regard their island.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-37549c49b71d3d70c292402a64c108aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03c71c290709c5f72698f04e1bf6628a</data>
