      <data key="d0">Phoenicia</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Phoenicia is an ancient region known for its fertility, with a city Tyre potentially having Maya-derived name.&lt;SEP&gt;Phoenicia is proposed in some hypotheses as a possible origin of the ancestors of the American Indians.</data>
