    <node id="Phosphorus">
      <data key="d0">Phosphorus</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Phosphorus is a chemical element found naturally in minerals and essential for biological life.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphorus is mentioned as glowing in the water wake, creating turbulent illumination.</data>
