    <node id="Mediterranean Sea">
      <data key="d0">Mediterranean Sea</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mediterranean Sea is a large sea connected to the Atlantic Ocean, surrounded by Europe, Asia, and Africa, historically significant for trade and civilization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mediterranean Sea borders Morocco to the north.</data>
