      <data key="d0">Mizraim</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Mizraim is the biblical name for Egypt, possibly derived from words related to clearing or uprooting trees, and connected with water and inundation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mizraim is a name given to Egypt in the Scriptures, possibly derived from words describing water and the abyss.</data>
