      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Hapimu is a name given by Western invaders to Egypt, possibly meaning the abyss of water.&lt;SEP&gt;Hapimu is a name given to Egypt by Western invaders, associated with waters and the etymology meaning 'abyss of water.'</data>
