    <node id="Thebes">
      <data key="d0">Thebes</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Thebes is an ancient city in Egypt where Rameses the Great recorded the vanquishing of the Khati on his palace walls.&lt;SEP&gt;Thebes was the capital of upper Egypt during the XVIII dynast, called NO or NA-AMUN, the mansion of Amun.&lt;SEP&gt;Thebes is an ancient city in Greece, referenced in context of historical and cultural imagery.&lt;SEP&gt;Thebes is an ancient city referenced as a context of historical or mythological significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Thebes was an ancient Egyptian city where frescoes depicting harps and musicians have been discovered in tombs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95fcd0021c644a0db5d36e039f705056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a944ace9f08bbbd03f30787f1ce4bc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864e2ae03ae6a965282d1c5c276b0b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a6fd5e17721f4573f70b6578a7f23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409162d6c592b356035008418a8c62af</data>
