    </node>
    <node id="Gen. Grant">
      <data key="d0">Gen. Grant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Grant visited Ram Singh, Maharajah of Jeypoor, an event documented in historical accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;A Union general leading the Army of the Tennessee during the Battle of Pittsburg Landing.&lt;SEP&gt;General Grant was a military leader who arrived during the battle, helped to stop a general stampede, and contributed to the eventual battlefield stabilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Grant was a Union general, targeted for destruction by Johnston and Beauregard, and later became the commander-in-chief in 1864.&lt;SEP&gt;General Ulysses S. Grant is a commander who led Union forces and summarized battle results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
