      <data key="d0">Himalayas</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Himalaya mountain range is a geographical feature mentioned as a crossing point into Afghanistan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Himalayas are the mountain range seen from Elsie's home, influencing her childhood environment and worldview.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb6a025623f47200c8c812a059793950</data>
