    <node id="Kuki-Khel">
      <data key="d0">Kuki-Khel</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kuki-Khel is a tribe discussed in relation to Afghan and Maya cultural overlaps, with "Khel" meaning tribe or clan.&lt;SEP&gt;Kuki-Khel is a tribal group, name signifies tribe of the feather, associated with the prefix Khel meaning clan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
