      <data key="d0">Akakhel</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Akakhel is a tribe, name signifies the tribe of the reservoir or pond.&lt;SEP&gt;The Akakhel is a tribe, part of the Afghan-Maya cultural context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
