      <data key="d0">Khambhur Khel</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Khambhur Khel is a tribe, name means the tribe of the pleasant, related to the Maya word for pleasant.&lt;SEP&gt;The Khambhur Khel is another tribe mentioned in the context of Afghan and Maya cultural ties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
