    <node id="Kaan">
      <data key="d0">Kaan</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Kaan means "a tie" or "a rope" in the Maya language, representing the concept of clan or group identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Kaan is a Maya vocable meaning tie or rope, symbolizing a conceptual connection or clan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
