    <node id="Garden">
      <data key="d0">Garden</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The garden is Moo's home setting, centrally located in the scene.&lt;SEP&gt;The garden is an abandoned, desolate space with burnt weeds, overgrown ruins of a European house, and bordered with green bottle-ends.&lt;SEP&gt;The Garden is a poetic reference, possibly symbolizing a place of significance or transition.&lt;SEP&gt;The garden is a location where some characters observe movement outside and speculate on intruders.&lt;SEP&gt;A simple square grassy garden surrounded by a hedge of tamarisk, filled with seasonal flowers.&lt;SEP&gt;A picturesque garden filled with asters, marigolds, carnations, hydrangeas, and fuchsias, enjoyed by visitors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feaab40fd1e6e5870b9322a9a5d595b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3b55e49144523635ef63eec5d81eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9bbc68e971d8dbaaccac8129cd9f19d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbd76b6f2049550600c7b5f2e214524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5836d0924804112ead175776cdcd9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c397e03eded0bedcfd22c948ef8967</data>
