      <data key="d0">Garden of Eden</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The scene's depiction of the garden, tempter, fruit, woman, and serpent recalls the myth of the Garden of Eden.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606697</data>
