    <node id="Prince of Davanas">
      <data key="d0">Prince of Davanas</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A wise magician prince from Hindostan named Maya established himself there, associated with ancient civilizations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="American Maya">
      <data key="d0">American Maya</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maya from America, distinguished from Asian origins, strongly relate to indigenous civilization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Etymology">
      <data key="d0">Etymology</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The origin of the name Maya is traced through language and mythological associations in Hindostan, Greece, and America.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Maia">
      <data key="d0">Maia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Maia is a goddess, daughter of Atlantis, associated with the Maya and an ancestor of divine and natural concepts.&lt;SEP&gt;Maia, a goddess in Greece, identified as the mother of gods, linked mythologically to the name Maya.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Atlantis">
      <data key="d0">Atlantis</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Atlantis is referenced as the mythical origin place of the Maya, associated with the goddess Maia.&lt;SEP&gt;Atlantis is a legendary island mentioned in Greek mythology, considered the origin or ancestral homeland of Maia and possibly other civilizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Atlantis is associated with Maia, the daughter of Atlantis, blending mythological traditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f47d3b712e0953b518a70453701f3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Porosity">
      <data key="d0">Porosity</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The porous soil ("sieve") of MAYAB symbolizes water absorption and is linked genetically to the Maya inhabitants.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Invasion">
      <data key="d0">Invasion</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The historical invasion of Egypt by people from MAYAB is implied through symbolism and hieroglyphs.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasion refers to historical military or cultural incursions into territories, exemplified by the actions of early English ancestors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-255e055413333e0db5092afb8deec482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d6d693b5da179ac238c1380743ccaf6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608160</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Deification">
      <data key="d0">Deification</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mayas deified and honored their eminent persons and incorporated these practices into their religious customs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf5cee73398d032581450496a09223dd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606698</data>
