      <data key="d0">Colonel Don Felipe Diaz</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Colonel Don Felipe Diaz was the commander of troops at the eastern frontier, responsible for scouts and warning of enemy presence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f65c2b617b2b75df32a484e145b034fe</data>
