    <node id="Mastodon">
      <data key="d0">Mastodon</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The mastodon is a symbol of deity worship by the Can family, represented in their temples and monuments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mastodon is a prehistoric creature depicted in the mural paintings at Chaacmol's funeral chamber, symbolizing ancient fauna and worship.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f65c2b617b2b75df32a484e145b034fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002cf134516b6f6702e5dfec7413096b</data>
