    <node id="Manava-Dharma-Sastra">
      <data key="d0">Manava-Dharma-Sastra</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Manava-Dharma-Sastra is an ancient sacred book of Hindostan that describes the four mountains, emblematic of the land's geography.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606704</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ramayana">
      <data key="d0">Ramayana</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ramayana is an epic that mentions the land of the Mayas, their mines, and territories, linking mythology to history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ramayana is an epic poem that describes wars, territories, and myths involving Maya, Rama, and other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ramayana is a sacred Hindu epic that mentions four mountains representing the country of Hindostan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea61287f7c7aac52c315ee2cca003fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606704</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Chaldea">
      <data key="d0">Chaldea</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Chaldea was an ancient civilization associated with a creation myth involving a ruling woman and monstrous animals, mentioned in the context of world creation stories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606704</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Arba-Lisun">
      <data key="d0">Arba-Lisun</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Arba-Lisun refers to the land of the four tongues, a name for Chaldea, emphasizing the division into four regions or aspects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606704</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
