      <data key="d0">Kiprat-arbat</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Kiprat-arbat signifies the four races or peoples, illustrating a concept of division into four groups or races in ancient history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4953aba767e12ab2c6cc0f2d20adf220</data>
