    <node id="Landa">
      <data key="d0">Landa</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Landa was a historian who documented the origins and meaning of names and regions related to the ancient Mayan peoples.&lt;SEP&gt;Landa is an historical figure who documented the worship of Kinich-Kakmo in Izamal up to the Spanish conquest.&lt;SEP&gt;Landa is an author who wrote about the customs of Yucatan, with references to the Maya and their traditions.</data>
