    <node id="Dis">
      <data key="d0">Dis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dis is a deity related to Erech, representing the lord of darkness or death, sometimes called upon as a patron god of the dead.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d7d407dd88d4f39cbd7f09e60b40325</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764606708</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tix">
      <data key="d0">Tix</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tix refers to a Maya name for a cavity formed in the earth, associated with a city called Niffer or Calneh.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d7d407dd88d4f39cbd7f09e60b40325</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
