    <node id="Bil">
      <data key="d0">Bil</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bil (or Enu) means Lord, and in Maya, it signifies the way, the origin, the procreator, and is associated with Niblu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d7d407dd88d4f39cbd7f09e60b40325</data>
