    <node id="Greece">
      <data key="d0">Greece</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Greece is a region where Maya divine concepts like Maia were worshiped.&lt;SEP&gt;Greece is a place where some gods originating from MAYAB are also believed to have been worshiped, illustrating cross-cultural religious influences.&lt;SEP&gt;Country where church bells are typically hung in belfries separate from the church.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f83c27282913cff5172f6cf0dfa303eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864e2ae03ae6a965282d1c5c276b0b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90fd9a36fae91000a3e050e11afb101c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4839098cd46c452a68e1941bee57dab0</data>
