    <node id="Ake">
      <data key="d0">Ake</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Ake is an Egyptian deity represented as a child with a finger to his mouth, and the name also means a reed; in Yucatan, the meaning of the word is lost.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f83c27282913cff5172f6cf0dfa303eb</data>
