    <node id="Macaw">
      <data key="d0">Macaw</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The macaw is the totem of Moo, symbolized in engraved slabs, later interpreted as part of their iconography.&lt;SEP&gt;The Macaw provides an exposition categorizing structures, including honeycomb, based on understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;The Macaw discusses structures and the honeycomb, showing understanding of biological classification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b549627ac943f03650e7d7278845faf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47</data>
