    <node id="Organic Matter">
      <data key="d0">Organic Matter</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Remains found in the urn, identified as having been subjected to high heat, containing the presumed heart and viscera.&lt;SEP&gt;0.56 percent of the composition of steep water.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic impurities from biological sources present in natural water, affecting its suitability for photographic use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b549627ac943f03650e7d7278845faf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71c96945a0d89c1259991afe2250873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6b814913c15e808c9006084323530a</data>
