      <data key="d3">chunk-a65e48b610f2a391366b1dc455dacc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cf3140092a745267effea6e9a53aa65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d98dca421f9ad7bdbf89c28e679535b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a861d56558288f1ebda11fb012fb783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41f4557b5a58dc496c18ce0c8f8f2c88</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maya language has survived wars, political and religious changes, and still exists among descendants.&lt;SEP&gt;Language influences thought and perception of morality, with the perversion of language affecting moral understanding.</data>
