      <data key="d3">chunk-fa1a6047d3b960e8aa1f1e7a19add07e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7b901adf8679c3923b1589b8a4a5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bed6738b6d7b4e2dc22c8db0e48f9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f5df96639b73ae94749ba10e9d2c87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79465f6fd525b49edfa758554ce7718c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4958bc3b034dd7b59c1c0df2fab2b8d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d80edbff78a673a3b603b37c60a64a</data>
      <data key="d2">Souls are to return to earth after a period of three thousand years.&lt;SEP&gt;Described as beautiful, full of flowers, forests, fields, birds, and natural phenomena, as perceived by Angeline.&lt;SEP&gt;Earth is portrayed as a beautiful planet rich in natural beauty, capable of inspiring admiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Earth is described as a ground holding wealth such as gold, and associated with agricultural fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;The ground and earth are described as realms containing wealth and resources.</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764610611</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
