      <data key="d2">The Great Pyramid served as a monument and a sacred site, with sculptures depicting warriors and noblemen.&lt;SEP&gt;Ancient pertains to the distant past, often associated with historical and cultural accomplishments.</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
