      <data key="d0">Metallic Colors</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b991502e22e90fb761c5591cdca0b88e</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Le Plongeon still preserves metallic colors like cinnabar from Chaacmol's mausoleum.</data>
