      <data key="d2">Animals such as fishes, snakes, and tigers were worshiped by lower classes in Maya culture.&lt;SEP&gt;A metaphorical description of Jewish women, emphasizing their superficial beauty without cultivated minds.</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
