    <node id="Old Testament">
      <data key="d0">Old Testament</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-37549c49b71d3d70c292402a64c108aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf4b36f5828cc09fb907dbf61daf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a032a23ccb5ee9bb45879a8d6dba2c2d</data>
      <data key="d2">The Book of Daniel contains stories involving divine messages and interpretations, including the writing on the wall.&lt;SEP&gt;The Old Testament is referenced as a superstitious biblical text that she has outgrown, representing traditional religious beliefs challenged by her.&lt;SEP&gt;The Old Testament is a collection of ancient writings portraying the history and religion of the Jewish people.</data>
