      <data key="d2">The wounded animal with visible blood symbolizes vulnerability and recalls the myth of Eden.&lt;SEP&gt;The scene is a lively social gathering involving Mrs. Forrester, Rudolph, and others in a scenic outdoor setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The scene depicts a rural, mountainous landscape with changing scenery, vehicles, and local workers.</data>
