      <data key="d2">A legendary prince and magician from Hindostan, associated with the origins stories of Maya.&lt;SEP&gt;The woman is described as modest, morally courageous, intelligent, and devoted to service, with a high sense of duty and religious faith.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual described in the text is a person whose actions are influenced by alcohol, tobacco, and knowledge about nerves and health.&lt;SEP&gt;The text references an unnamed individual subjected to punishment, who eventually reveals a hiding-place and is chained, indicating a person involved in a punitive or possibly criminal context.</data>
