      <data key="d2">The Chaldees had an elaborate polytheistic religion with possible esoteric knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;The spiritual belief system that she upheld, emphasizing divine truth and human soul.&lt;SEP&gt;Religion is emphasized as an important aspect of Kentucky's early settlers and their society.</data>
