      <data key="d2">Tix refers to a cavity and is etymologically linked to cities called Niffer and Calneh.&lt;SEP&gt;The city is the urban area affected by the fire and subsequent events described.&lt;SEP&gt;The City is a place where the ways and morals concerning faithfulness and propriety are considered, influencing perceptions of virtue.&lt;SEP&gt;The city is depicted as large and mysterious at night, with avenues and street scenes.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers generally to urban environment characterized by excitement, noise, and chaos.</data>
