    <node id="Tasmania">
      <data key="d0">Tasmania</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tasmania is where two of Mr. Inglis’s sons settled, and where Elsie Inglis attended school.&lt;SEP&gt;The place where Elsie spent part of her school years, as referenced by her niece.&lt;SEP&gt;Tasmania is the place associated with two girls who were coming to the school.&lt;SEP&gt;Tasmania is the place from which Elsie and her family returned during her schoolgirl years.&lt;SEP&gt;Tasmania is a place from which Elsie’s nieces came when she stayed with their family.</data>
