    <node id="Time">
      <data key="d0">Time</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Time is referenced through the "crimson glow of the sunset on the hills of Time," symbolizing the passing of life and historical memory.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to the passage of historical periods and the narrator’s musings on the value and nature of different ages.&lt;SEP&gt;Time refers to the period of day, specifically the time past noon in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific time mentioned is half-past six, indicating the schedule of the prayer-meeting.</data>
