      <data key="d2">John Inglis was a Christian gentleman known for his uprightness and high principles, whose death deeply affected his family.&lt;SEP&gt;A dedicated medical professional and nurse who served during wartime, showing exceptional courage, independence, and commitment to her duty, including performing major surgeries and caring for patients regardless of her own illness.</data>
