    <node id="Her">
      <data key="d0">Her</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Her refers to a female figure who is deeply empathetic, suffering, and dedicated to aiding her Serbian brethren, embodying spiritual and emotional resilience.&lt;SEP&gt;Possessive pronoun referring to the woman, indicating her role in acts of bartering and sale.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to a mythological or poetic female figure who is associated with the Moon and its influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Her is a bird that unfolds feathers and interacts affectionately with her mate.&lt;SEP&gt;She is a young lady from Hester Street, associated with the brother, and is characterized by kindness and understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;A woman characterized by her healthy skin, expressive face, and vanity, daughter of Canada City's principal banker, with a certain childlike imperiousness and attractiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to a female individual present in the narrative, involved in personal interactions and emotional responses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c858db77dc3126e37cd384f8634ecffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b3715e8f3a5074ee835c66b56835395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf1f7f24935168c94381fb8b884628f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e60239d7bab05fbce9d289bd08db986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62d9981c359a23239322d1ef69f6eabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6cab761408cb58a952d84a4e27dce81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff2030ce7e35257099d54aca8256ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ae32cc554dc390c60bd5c873778659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfdf9595877dab30524e561a06dbcca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d396656b7a9adc61cd46a6601bf39f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f28d427b11836c753976864f6f1ca0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-291c8a0f74d4df3d7cf1b446e90edd31</data>
