    <node id="Oliver Cromwell">
      <data key="d0">Oliver Cromwell</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Oliver Cromwell was a historic military and political leader known for his role in English history, symbolized here as an inspiration for the female figure's spirit of determination.&lt;SEP&gt;Oliver Cromwell was a historical figure whose literary remains are described as strange, uncertain, and representing a mix of sincerity, solemnity, and religious sentimentality from the nineteenth century.&lt;SEP&gt;Oliver Cromwell was a historical figure, with references to different stages of his life including childhood, youth, and old age, and is associated with historical legacy.</data>
