    <node id="Scottish Womens Hospital">
      <data key="d0">Scottish Womens Hospital</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scottish Women’s Hospitals was an organization where Elsie Inglis gained surgical experience and contributed during wartime.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scottish Women’s Hospital was a wartime organization that provided medical aid and was involved in Serbian relief efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scottish Women’s Hospital is described as having admitted a boy and being involved in wartime medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c858db77dc3126e37cd384f8634ecffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdf24e1910d1ceb68fb8c77bc4b2ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b38719c302bfd7a79cb6bf09c381277c</data>
