    <node id="War Office">
      <data key="d0">War Office</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The War Office is the governmental department from which Dr. Inglis intervened to secure dental care for a family member, demonstrating her advocacy and connection to military-related administrative processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The War Office is the governmental body overseeing military and auxiliary services, initially resistant to women’s involvement in service.&lt;SEP&gt;The War Office is a government department mentioned as being uncooperative regarding wartime medical aid.&lt;SEP&gt;The War Office was a government department responsible for military affairs, which interacted with Dr. Inglis regarding her wartime units.&lt;SEP&gt;The War Office is a government military department that received Dr. Elsie's final messages and directives related to wartime activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c858db77dc3126e37cd384f8634ecffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4be564c5fa39fff8a20f1369b2fa02d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ce4cb100ab0508dd550c088c47bb07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b543d0d7b10d0b065afab9c7665867c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbc46a780201b0aee22ebb94b7217e12</data>
