    <node id="Scottish Womens Hospitals">
      <data key="d0">Scottish Womens Hospitals</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scottish Women’s Hospitals was a pioneering medical organization established to provide healthcare and surgical services during wartime, particularly during World War I. Founded and notably led by Dr. Elsie Inglis, the organization aimed to promote women’s roles in medical aid and support efforts across various nations, including Serbia and Russia. The organization was supported by suffrage groups and was instrumental in advancing women's participation in medical work amidst wartime challenges.

Under Dr. Inglis's leadership, the Scottish Women’s Hospitals saw significant achievements, including the acquisition of surgical skills by Inglis herself and the provision of vital medical aid on the frontlines. The organization was staffed by women, such as Dr. Inglis and others like Mrs. Petrie, and was known for its international contributions during the war. Its initiatives involved setting up hospitals and delivering much-needed medical and surgical support in conflict zones, which contributed substantially to wartime medical efforts.

While most descriptions emphasize Dr. Elsie Inglis's central role, one record notes that the organization was led by Mrs. Petrie at some point. Additional success and recognition for the Scottish Women’s Hospitals were partly attributed to the efforts of figures like Sir William MacEwan, who contributed to its achievements in the medical profession. Overall, the Scottish Women’s Hospitals epitomized a significant stride in women’s involvement in wartime medical services, marked by dedication, international work, and the advancement of women's roles in medicine.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a9fec82f84d40eb54a3c1a3965739403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32f709c5563ea114d4fd6bb560a0d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4be564c5fa39fff8a20f1369b2fa02d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88f6b3f825b0114b7c33343abfedda35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1105db92c26143035157a3a806604b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbc46a780201b0aee22ebb94b7217e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f3981fcd4c2dbb0ee85b59b7739f90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37436bbfc5c51f8d3f5eadaa7be7704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b38719c302bfd7a79cb6bf09c381277c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa2387fc90852af29634d0f93b3c46b</data>
