    <node id="Elsie Maud Inglis">
      <data key="d0">Elsie Maud Inglis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Elsie Maud Inglis was a girl born in 1864, who showed a strong personality from infancy, and was the daughter of Mrs. Inglis.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsie Maud Inglis was a prominent medical woman and organizer of Scottish Women’s Hospitals, actively involved in wartime medical efforts and advocacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsie Maud Inglis wrote a letter describing her experiences during the event and travels.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsie Maud Inglis was a person involved in the hospital activities at Reni, contributing to hospital management and morale.</data>
