      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Sona was an Indian nurse in the Inglis family, recognized for her faith, long service, and Christian life.&lt;SEP&gt;Sona was a trusted ayah who helped during the journey from India to England and cared for the children.&lt;SEP&gt;Sona is a person who cares for Elsie during travel in India, involved in her early journeying experiences.</data>
