      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lucknow is a city in India where Sona, the nurse, supported and was a pillar of the Indian Christian Church.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucknow is a city in India where the missionaries, including Mrs. Inglis's family, were based and where Sona was in charge of the missionaries.</data>
