      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Punjab is a region in India where Inglis was recommended for active employment by Sir Frederick Currie.&lt;SEP&gt;The Punjab was a newly acquired province of India where David Inglis was posted as a magistrate.&lt;SEP&gt;The Punjab is a region in India where Inglis participated in settling the area and fought through the Mutiny.</data>
