      <data key="d2">The Indian Mutiny was a significant conflict during which David Inglis participated in military and civil suppression efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mutiny was a significant uprising in India that affected Mrs. Inglis’s family and the course of their lives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mutiny was a major uprising in India that affected the Inglis family’s life and military engagement.</data>
