    <node id="Russia">
      <data key="d0">Russia</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Elsie sent a cheque to her niece while on her way to Russia, indicating her travels in that country.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsie traveled to Russia as part of her journeys.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is the country from which wartime personnel and soldiers originate, central to the wartime narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia was the only major European power that did not publicly support the Confederate cause during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Russia is a country where the events in the story take place, involving characters in various activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Country where bells are often hung in separate structures or branches of oak trees near churches.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-229b0d933abdd5cd0fec83a0fe5e865e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce0ef9057b54adcabf7cff5d8d40d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32f709c5563ea114d4fd6bb560a0d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabf392a8dc10b75e57591c9eaef5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4839098cd46c452a68e1941bee57dab0</data>
