      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">British military forces stationed around Salonika, expected to arrive and assist during the conflict and evacuation efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;British troops are military forces that participated in the advance on the village of St. Denis in 1837.&lt;SEP&gt;The British troops are military forces engaged in the attack on the village, led by Colonel Gore.&lt;SEP&gt;British troops are military forces that appeared on the morning of the 25th and engaged in fighting with rebels.</data>
