    <node id="Glasgow">
      <data key="d0">Glasgow</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Glasgow is the city where Elsie Inglis studied medicine, took examinations, and resided at the Y.W.C.A. Hostel during her studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Glasgow is a city with a large out-patient department and the Glasgow Royal hospital.&lt;SEP&gt;Glasgow is a city mentioned as the location and date of a political discussion occurring in May 1892.&lt;SEP&gt;Glasgow is a city in Scotland where Dr. Elsie initially developed her faith and religious understanding through her father and church attendance.&lt;SEP&gt;Glasgow is a city where Sir George Beatson is based and where wartime medical activities are discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;Glasgow is a port city where the ship was brought for repairs and refurbishment before departure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bfdfb54a79e5b06ab1a40209cf48d325&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b636798106b589dda0e7e202d80b072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-795bd02c45b0e38f40d224f9f9752778&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4be564c5fa39fff8a20f1369b2fa02d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7229deb809f43a17e844ef4f20769c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f3cb4d420a1cee0ebcac4aa18485c89</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
