      <data key="d2">The Infirmary in Glasgow was a central site of opposition to mixed classes for women students.&lt;SEP&gt;The infirmary in Edinburgh is a medical facility where the narrator hopes to get into or build a hospital.&lt;SEP&gt;The Infirmary is a medical facility where Elsie volunteers with Dr. D.</data>
