    <node id="Liberal Party">
      <data key="d0">Liberal Party</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Liberal Party is a political organization associated with Dr. Inglis's political stance and her advocacy for women’s independence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Liberal Party is a political group mentioned in context of women's suffrage and political debates.&lt;SEP&gt;The Liberal Party was the ruling political party in Britain after 1906, supporting democratic and progressive reforms including women's suffrage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Liberal party in Germany is led by a Jew, representing a significant political influence within the country.</data>
