    <node id="St. Giles'">
      <data key="d0">St. Giles'</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">St. Giles' is a site where Elsie Inglis attended a service with the Edinburgh Town Council, marking a significant event.&lt;SEP&gt;St. Giles’ is a central location of her healing mission where she attended daily services.&lt;SEP&gt;St. Giles' is a church where Elsie Inglis was laid to rest, and where her memorial services were held.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e3fc5bb98f8d283a62db5e74bbfa9071&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b818ac8f082f95c6bdf7a8460dd50f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-615fd00e3494a05f5434700852bd4911</data>
