    <node id="Red Cross">
      <data key="d0">Red Cross</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Red Cross is involved in wartime medical aid and is associated with the efforts of women such as Dr. Inglis.&lt;SEP&gt;International humanitarian organization acknowledging She’s work.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Cross is an international humanitarian organization with which Elsie Inglis was actively involved.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e3fc5bb98f8d283a62db5e74bbfa9071&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b3715e8f3a5074ee835c66b56835395</data>
