      <data key="d2">Medical professionals who diagnose and treat patients; involved in discussions about women's health and medical rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctors were called to treat the injured brothers after the fire.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctors are present in the camp, responsible for health and medical needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0440f793586398094204255524bc8f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b75c5f4f7c0385a783e34fd555b4a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-983c8bccfafaa4eb3ef49034ee60c8ce</data>
