      <data key="d0">Zürich</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">City in Switzerland where the unit arrived and was greeted by the British Consul-General and others of the British Colony.&lt;SEP&gt;Zürich was the city in Switzerland where Serbian prisoners were taken from Austria-Hungary, marking the end of their captivity during World War I.&lt;SEP&gt;Zürich is the city where Sterne’s sermons were published.</data>
