    <node id="Refugees">
      <data key="d0">Refugees</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Refugees are civilians fleeing the conflict zones, contributing to the chaos and panic described during the retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;Refugees are people displaced by war, seen on carts with belongings, children, and pigs.&lt;SEP&gt;Refugees fleeing from Sioux attacks sought safety in St. Paul and were transported by boats from the Minnesota River.</data>
