      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A weekly humorous magazine that Mr. Inglis references, indicating his reading material and social interests.&lt;SEP&gt;Punch is a magazine or publication from which a German-speaking man shows a copy to Elsie.</data>
