    <node id="Government">
      <data key="d0">Government</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Government is a body responsible for governing within a state's legal and political framework and is challenged by unresolved questions and social movements.&lt;SEP&gt;Government is portrayed as a strong institution capable of maintaining order, highly revered by the narrator's father.&lt;SEP&gt;Ganymede holds a post under the Government, witnessing mismanagement and advocating for reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;The government is the governing body responsible for managing state affairs, including signing bonds and overseeing public policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The government was involved in treaties, supplying land, and managing Indian affairs during this period.&lt;SEP&gt;The Government is involved in a conflict, having been attacked near a certain location by Arab individuals, resulting in injuries and fatalities among soldiers and horses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-88f6b3f825b0114b7c33343abfedda35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe66985061e17bec49f1898419196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aa27a6c64d7fb72f336a10c4ff50667&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f60868fc120dda4e8b845c8a6db7921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13efecfdb402b12d9a005785fb5d0e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a152136647fcdc06015572bf449dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6</data>
