    <node id="The Boat">
      <data key="d0">The Boat</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The boat described is a military transport vessel, shabby upon boarding, recently cleaned and painted, used for transporting military personnel.&lt;SEP&gt;The boat is a sampan used for travel on the river, capable of slipping on the tide and carrying people.&lt;SEP&gt;The boat is a wooden vessel used for escape across the river, carrying Rudolph, Chantel, and the woman.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boat is a vessel used for transportation on the river, involved in the scene's action, with characters aboard and witnessing events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boat is a vessel navigating a river, involved in a confrontation with attackers, and is commanded by Captain Kneebone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boat is a vessel in which Rudolph and others are traveling, involved in a chase or escape scenario at sea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a7229deb809f43a17e844ef4f20769c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f76d58d4ab3a913092d955df41ac90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfccb23dd43d27cfb79137b943a1e1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd506e2b4ab4403262e3cf611653609b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd990ec3d60f1ee71ebfb13a84ee7393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611184</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Captain">
      <data key="d0">Captain</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Captain" refers primarily to a maritime officer who is the commanding leader of a vessel. In this capacity, the captain is responsible for overseeing the safe navigation and operation of the ship, conducting safety drills, and ensuring the proper conduct of the voyage. Historically, the captain is often considered a competent leader, knowledgeable about the dangers at sea, and has authority over the crew, often giving orders to hold positions during potential threats or attacks. For instance, a captain who previously served on the Anchor Line to Bombay exemplifies the experienced maritime leadership expected of such an individual. 

Beyond its literal naval context, "Captain" also appears as a character in anecdotal or symbolic narratives. These portrayals include a courageous and patriotic figure, sometimes depicted with a helmet, leading groups or engaging in scenes associated with military or heroic themes. Such characters may be involved in humorous, chaotic, or illustrative scenes, such as shouting warnings or leading a group amidst disorder. For example, within anecdotes involving a French veteran, the captain symbolizes military valor and patriotic spirit. Additionally, references to the captain involve scenes of chaos or danger, like issuing commands during an attack or warning about threats such as "Pung-dongs," highlighting the authoritative role and the sense of leadership amid turmoil.

Furthermore, the concept of the captain extends into metaphorical or thematic realms, involving plans or stories centered around the captain's fortune or leadership qualities. This emphasizes the symbolic significance of the captain as a figure of authority, guidance, and sometimes intrigue within various narratives or contexts. Thus, "Captain" encompasses both the tangible role of a maritime leader duty-bound to safety and command, as well as a symbolic or fictional character embodying courage, patriotism, and authority in diverse stories and representations.&lt;SEP&gt;A naval officer associated with Captain Lambert and the ship Norwich.&lt;SEP&gt;The Captain mentioned parting ways with the narrator during the journey.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a7229deb809f43a17e844ef4f20769c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b543d0d7b10d0b065afab9c7665867c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3dcaffe826a353c7b1a0eff516a2419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d03004a9213b673458ba0acafe4309f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202e89533c336da3f2eea8f8ae060d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1876f424b05897dac23b01553cb7070&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38509fbb14988b3d2417deb93ee40233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11085dd4a232b0b70f5a0f46b8ace7e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8a70ed68b8ad9957789f681884b2ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18229600ff7ed73bcb62cc6a9e74017</data>
