    <node id="Camp">
      <data key="d0">Camp</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The camp is described as a site where a mock battle occurred and where military training is conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;The camp is a large, tented military or expeditionary encampment, with a structured arrangement and various activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The camp is a temporary settlement during the journey, where various activities occur.&lt;SEP&gt;A military or expeditionary camp where the travelers encamped after marching about eighteen miles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30bc679e676a49c813bf82844d9cb331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a704560f9aa2b54ceb8b9a6fd26a53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-983c8bccfafaa4eb3ef49034ee60c8ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1030072f07138e17f0700081a9158b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d587eba2d4e09716d8ff298c1f8fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96b49b26c3ab3e73c7183507f22ac2e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f</data>
