    <node id="Serbian Division">
      <data key="d0">Serbian Division</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Serbian Division, also known as the Jugoslav Division, was composed of volunteers from Serbs, Croats, and Slovenes of Austria-Hungary, fighting for Southern Slav independence and unity under the national dynasty of Kara George.&lt;SEP&gt;The Serbian Division is a military unit that is being moved to the front to reinforce Russian troops during the war.&lt;SEP&gt;A military unit engaged in fighting on the Russian front, which Dr. Inglis served and helped evacuate from Russia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac8e880f6373e1f89db9eba246a0199e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f2e8f5cc7c639af947fe43f6cdc962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa2387fc90852af29634d0f93b3c46b</data>
