    <node id="British Army">
      <data key="d0">British Army</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The British Army is part of the Allied forces involved in wartime efforts, with which Dr. Inglis intended to collaborate.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Army is referenced indirectly, hinting at their unfamiliarity with certain battlefield conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Army, including soldiers in India and Egypt, could benefit from using the solar-powered apparatus to procure good water and cook food rapidly in the field.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac8e880f6373e1f89db9eba246a0199e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee9c14e4874d5edaebe46bb34bc7c78</data>
