      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Alexander Inglis, great-grandfather of Elsie Inglis, emigrated to Carolina around 1780, leaving Scottish estate behind.&lt;SEP&gt;Alexander Inglis was a restless and adventurous individual who lived a long ago and was father to four children, known for his duel-related death and his contributions to his family and society.</data>
