      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mary Deas was married to Alexander Inglis, mother of his children, and associated with the family history.&lt;SEP&gt;Mary Deas was the wife of Alexander Inglis, supported her station in life with fortitude, and was a descendant of Sir David Dundas and Robert the Bruce.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d37436bbfc5c51f8d3f5eadaa7be7704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c9efbd12b4170d1e884f967c9273e05</data>
