      <data key="d2">The Treaty of Bassein was a significant political event involving territorial cessions overseen by David Inglis in India.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty of Bassein in 1803 was an agreement that involved the transfer of territory in India, executed with judgment and moderation by David Inglis.</data>
