      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Walthamstow was where David Inglis’s children were born after returning to England in 1812.&lt;SEP&gt;Walthamstow is a location Samuel Pepys planned to visit the next day.&lt;SEP&gt;Walthamstow is the place Samuel Pepys plans to visit, traveling there in the morning.</data>
