    <node id="Philadelphia">
      <data key="d0">Philadelphia</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Philadelphia is a prominent city that appears across various contexts and narratives. It is the residence of the narrator alongside Mr. Kirkbride, indicating its significance as a personal or familiar setting. The city serves as a key location for technical and educational activities, as evidenced by its use of example engines and calculations, suggesting a role in demonstrating or testing engineering concepts.

Furthermore, Philadelphia is noteworthy for its natural history, being a site where a rare fruiting Ginkgo tree has been recorded, possibly due to unusual natural variation or rare environmental conditions. Geographically, it is situated near Torresdale and approximately four miles south of Keppler's, situating it within a specific regional context.

In the realm of investigation and law enforcement, Philadelphia is the focal point for detective Gallegher, who is actively involved in criminal investigations such as the Burrbank case and rumors concerning Hade. His work as an office boy and community participant further emphasizes the city's role as a hub of both civic and investigative activity. The city also features in media and legal contexts, being associated with newspapers and arrest plans.

Additionally, Philadelphia is involved in the narrative of travel and exploration, as Gallegher visits or passes through the city during his long night ride, marking it as a key location in his journey. Overall, Philadelphia emerges as a multifaceted city significant in personal, scientific, natural, investigative, and geographic contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ff5fd31602189a7d4e036b27dcf956b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8c3f67ad6c5ab11a1aa1c43bc0fc53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855ee3c61d64dd76f89504f38e2a403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4861f1f36dbc583ebdad31a4a80a0aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e16494586d22295a6c919157d0e2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9701c89d5a5f839dbe13d1fa16e90400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6133dbc706b714aa574e1c7d296379a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
