      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Elisha Cook is a family member who lived nearby and was involved in child-rearing and household activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Elisha Cook was the grandson of Moses Stickney, related to the protagonist of the story, and connected to the Cook family through marriage.&lt;SEP&gt;Elisha Cook was a historical figure and father of Electa Cook, mentioned in the early family history of Angeline Hall's biography.&lt;SEP&gt;Elisha Cook was a person who died in 1841, leaving behind the Stickney girls.&lt;SEP&gt;Elisha Cook was an ancestor from New England whom family members remembered, associated with skating in boyhood.</data>
