    <node id="Moses">
      <data key="d0">Moses</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Moses is an old negress who helped many slaves escape North, reportedly stirring mobs when necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;Moses is an old negress who helped many slaves escape North and resisted the law.&lt;SEP&gt;Biblical figure who ascended the mountain to die there, symbolizing the mystery surrounding heroic figures.</data>
