    <node id="Boston">
      <data key="d0">Boston</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Boston is described as the intellectual and moral centre of the country and the location of reform efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Boston is the city where the Music Hall meetings took place and where the political events described occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Boston is the city where the story was published by Roberts Brothers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b7cbaacbda1b565d7c16cf842522b6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc55b5be1d859abaa2b489bc942a9fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b</data>
