    <node id="Lydia">
      <data key="d0">Lydia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lydia, also referred to as Miss C-, is a professor of Rhetoric characterized by high intellect and self-reliance, noted in a character sketch.&lt;SEP&gt;Lydia is characterized by self-reliance rooted in rational self-esteem, possesses confidence born of nature, and exhibits a style of artful composition with a Calvinistic influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Lydia is a person whose thoughts flit like fireflies, representing a lively, fleeting imagination, often associated with wonder and scrutiny.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0ddae83cf32cd2eddf4f6f5e5f7b1de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6fb0865838afaee45bf2ac6a0e7d392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc551f9bef83bf4d019c7da7b576d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc0c02df8cb82b091fb73a066662a32</data>
