    <node id="Ruth">
      <data key="d0">Ruth</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ruth is primarily identified as the sister of Angeline, playing a significant role in various personal and familial contexts. She is depicted as an inseparable childhood companion of Angeline and shares ambitions related to education and work, highlighting a close and supportive sibling relationship. Ruth is also described as someone who has engaged in teaching in nearby districts and has been involved in post-engagement events, indicating her active participation in societal and family affairs.

In addition to her familial and educational roles, Ruth has appeared in personal correspondence and narratives. She is portrayed as a recipient and sender of letters, often involving discussions of family matters, personal needs, and emotional states. Descriptions emphasize her loneliness, emotional needs, and her care during illness, including instances where she took care of family members during health crises, notably saving a relative for ten more years of usefulness.

Ruth's life includes experiences of travel and study; she returned home after one college term, later resumed her studies, and overcame health issues to graduate after recovery. She has traveled with narrators and stayed in places like McGrawville, further illustrating her active and journeying lifestyle.

Furthermore, Ruth was planned to move to Michigan with her sister and her husband's family, indicating family mobility and future aspirations. In familial events, she is involved in post-engagement activities, and she has been part of family gatherings and the care of children, reflecting a nurturing role within her family network. She also acted as a nurse during Angeline Hall's early motherhood, showcasing her caregiving qualities.

Overall, Ruth embodies a multifaceted individual: a dedicated sister, an engaged community member, a student who overcame health challenges, and a caring figure within her family and social circles, with her life narratives intertwining education, family loyalty, health, and personal growth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ff5fd31602189a7d4e036b27dcf956b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-761dc75dfaa658aca91981a9ec83d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cdaa7c773b77f31c7a3cbf9cdb813d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7b901adf8679c3923b1589b8a4a5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d00c65bf79fd492a5b18e73d5714807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ae8a29bf4f3c8add60aa8ad2364f52c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75cbd757758ebd60747dadb03eddfded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bed6738b6d7b4e2dc22c8db0e48f9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9153b876a7591a7e83884937254c80d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccd32b7ed6773eeb16d88857c35f0af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc551f9bef83bf4d019c7da7b576d80</data>
