      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The Confederates were a military group during the American Civil War who might have charged upon the narrator's group, risking slaughter.&lt;SEP&gt;Confederates were the supporters of the Confederacy, opposing the Union during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Confederates refer to the Southern states' forces engaged in the Civil War battle.</data>
