    <node id="Angeline">
      <data key="d0">Angeline</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Angeline is a multifaceted individual whose character and life story are richly detailed across various descriptions. She is portrayed as the central figure of a narrative, originating from a primitive civilization where she endured early hardships and experienced personal growth. Demonstrating early intelligence and development, Angeline began her education at the age of three and displayed a keen ambition and diligence in her studies, particularly in natural philosophy. 

She has a close familial relationship with her sister Charlotte, with whom she lived and from whom she received support in her education. Angeline is characterized as a hardworking girl who actively engaged in domestic chores such as baking and housework while attending school. Her dedication and character earned her the nickname "Lady Angeline." Further emphasizing her industrious nature, she supported her sister Ruth’s education and harbored ambitions to succeed in good business and reform efforts.

Angeline exhibits a desire for self-reliance and possesses qualities rooted in scientific inspiration and spiritual reflection. She prefers a natural, unornamented style influenced by her intellectual pursuits. Her imaginative and contemplative nature allows her to perceive beauty and sublimity vividly, highlighting her poetic sensibility. She values religious cultivation andursive writing, engaging in correspondence with Mr. Hall about her health, feelings, and life plans.

Her health improved over time, and she became a subject of romantic interest for Mr. Hall, with whom she was being courted for marriage. Angeline’s maternal side is also emphasized; she takes pride in her husband, cares deeply for him, and motivates him toward religious engagement. Additionally, she was the wife of Asaph Hall, known for her industriousness, domestic economy, and active support for her husband's astronomical work. Overall, Angeline embodies a blend of intellectual curiosity, spiritual sensitivity, domestic strength, and supportive partnership, making her a prominent and multi-dimensional figure in her respective narrative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-761dc75dfaa658aca91981a9ec83d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ddae83cf32cd2eddf4f6f5e5f7b1de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d00c65bf79fd492a5b18e73d5714807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9edfe0fb8fa0058acfbbae0026363f1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae53fd856d28203afb9cca734e561df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4216b02c90231e98e23a232e47e699b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6fb0865838afaee45bf2ac6a0e7d392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc551f9bef83bf4d019c7da7b576d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f</data>
