      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Halls are a family residing in Washington, D.C., who moved to a house in Georgetown during the Civil War era and lived there for three years.&lt;SEP&gt;Halls is a family described as owning a house on Gay Street and raising children in Georgetown.</data>
