    <node id="John Pierpont">
      <data key="d0">John Pierpont</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">John Pierpont was a Unitarian minister and poet, associated with New York Central College and noted for his influence and support.&lt;SEP&gt;John Pierpont was a preacher and poet, admired by Angeline Stickney and associated with the college.&lt;SEP&gt;John Pierpont was a poet and preacher who had a social connection with the narrator’s family and was revered as a noble man of the Civil War times.&lt;SEP&gt;John Pierpont was a respected figure who became attached to Mrs. Hall, involved in social events, and dined at her house.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15ba2e01ff70de4541cc6b1d7ee24441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c37387ba8758c27d10bbea3fdf809b</data>
