      <data key="d2">Secretary Stanton was the U.S. Secretary of War who accompanied Lincoln on the visit to the Naval Observatory.&lt;SEP&gt;Secretary Stanton was responsible for arresting and imprisoning individuals accused of doubtful loyalty, including the subject of the text, at Fort Lafayette.</data>
