      <data key="d2">Gravitation is described as the divine order, harmony, and the impelling force that imparts power and unity to all worlds and beings.&lt;SEP&gt;Gravitation symbolizes divine order, harmony, and the unifying force that imparts power to all and gathers all into proper relations.</data>
