    <node id="Concord School of Philosophy">
      <data key="d0">Concord School of Philosophy</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">She took a keen interest in the Concord School of Philosophy, seeking knowledge and spiritual regeneration.&lt;SEP&gt;The school was an educational institution where she studied for seeking a new faith and understanding beyond traditional religion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a93cf4b36f5828cc09fb907dbf61daf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9153b876a7591a7e83884937254c80d3</data>
