    <node id="The Civil War">
      <data key="d0">The Civil War</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Civil War was a significant historical conflict affecting Washington, during which Mrs. Hall actively participated in charitable efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Civil War was a significant conflict during which the St. Paul Weekly Journal opposed the prosecution of the war.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Civil War was a conflict between the Union and Confederacy over issues including states' rights and slavery.&lt;SEP&gt;A conflict involving significant military and political struggle for the reunification of the United States.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a93cf4b36f5828cc09fb907dbf61daf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9cb7dc890f79266a4c27289acbd4e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764609966</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Civil War">
      <data key="d0">Civil War</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Civil War was a major and historic conflict that profoundly impacted American history and society. It involved widespread battles, military movements, political struggles, and was characterized by significant threats to the nation, including threats to Washington, D.C. The war saw the participation of various military units and officers, such as Captain Shelly, who organized a military company and served as a soldier. It was also a pivotal period for individuals across different fields; for example, the young astronomer Asaph Hall was affected by the war, which influenced his life and career. 

In addition to its political and military significance, the Civil War had cultural and societal implications. It prompted the falsification of telegraph news by outlets like the Pioneer, reflecting the tumult and misinformation of the era. The conflict also involved volunteers like Mr. Moore and Frank Moore, who interrupted their civilian pursuits—such as working for newspapers—to serve in the military. Moreover, the war's impact extended to specific regions, such as Minnesota, which contributed forces to the Union side. Overall, the Civil War was a complex and multifaceted event encompassing military engagements, political upheaval, societal shifts, and individual stories intertwined within this pivotal chapter of American history.&lt;SEP&gt;The early American rebellion against tea imports is mentioned in context of the dawn of the Revolution, reflecting a patriotic backdrop.&lt;SEP&gt;The late civil war between the Union and the Confederacy, described as the inevitable result of two civilizations under one government.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc55b5be1d859abaa2b489bc942a9fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccd32b7ed6773eeb16d88857c35f0af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f5587c120cd6b77ca7604ffa3373d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4b788ffe5def54bf8b99b261eaf932&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49b770a2f437d2a1478f52b0f2747ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a4789d4f1f7c874d43ac8b35b4ece9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14003429c48b9d2d45e7222249b39d12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9cb7dc890f79266a4c27289acbd4e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c437983d26451567a1e6bf0d1cd6f13e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
