    <node id="Washington">
      <data key="d0">Washington</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Washington is referenced as a place where the author’s wife resided and where abolitionist activities were noted.&lt;SEP&gt;Washington is the city where Asaph Hall was appointed an aid at the Naval Observatory during the Civil War, and where many notable events and battles occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Washington is a place mentioned as the location of the events and residence.&lt;SEP&gt;Washington is the city where the narrator is at the time of writing the letter.&lt;SEP&gt;Washington is the capital city of the United States, known for its historical celebrations and government institutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Washington was the place where a biography of Washington was scurrilously written by a young printer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18fc234e4ccd21f6ffe31638a97054a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb39f6855ba70b44490f834cf645715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15ba2e01ff70de4541cc6b1d7ee24441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be8b49c919bf06f613da48187833e98b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
