      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Harvard Observatory">
      <data key="d0">Harvard Observatory</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Harvard Observatory is where Asaph Hall proceeded to work as an assistant after his stay in Ohio.&lt;SEP&gt;The Harvard Observatory is the institution where Asaph Hall worked, conducting astronomical observations and computations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Harvard Observatory was where Asaph Hall worked before his service in Washington, and where he had a salary of six hundred dollars annually.&lt;SEP&gt;Research institution where Prof. Hall visited and learned about spectra and stars.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d00c65bf79fd492a5b18e73d5714807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4216b02c90231e98e23a232e47e699b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385599a16e6adec90c4a4bae922a43d</data>
