    <node id="Battle of Bull Run">
      <data key="d0">Battle of Bull Run</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Bull Run was a major Civil War battle that occurred shortly after Asaph Hall's arrival in Washington, influencing his observations and experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Captain Acker was wounded in the first battle of Bull Run and was later wounded again at the second day's battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c37387ba8758c27d10bbea3fdf809b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-259cd15d2a822dcb52e2f16a8974a319</data>
