      <data key="d2">Small-pox is a disease that broke out in the city and affected Mrs. Hall, Mr. Hall, and their family members.&lt;SEP&gt;Small-pox was a prevalent disease during the Civil War, affecting the population in Washington where Asaph Hall and others resided.</data>
