      <data key="d2">Georgetown is the neighborhood where Percival’s accident occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgetown is the area in Washington where Asaph Hall's residence was located during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgetown is a place where Mrs. Hall sought out wild flowers and connected with nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgetown is a city of historical significance as the hometown of the Hall family and once home of Francis Scott Key.</data>
