      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Maryland is the U.S. state where the publisher Baltimore Nunn &amp; Company is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Maryland is a state noted for its sunsets and as the setting where Angeline Hall and her family experienced familial warmth.&lt;SEP&gt;Maryland is the state from which Mrs. Hall's childhood flowers and memories originate.&lt;SEP&gt;Maryland yields marble and slate, with quarries in Harford County.&lt;SEP&gt;Maryland has slate supplies from Harford County.&lt;SEP&gt;Maryland is the location where Judge Burgoyne and the narrator are going for shooting.</data>
