    <node id="Samie">
      <data key="d0">Samie</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Samie is a person mentioned in a family context, described as growing taller and smarter.&lt;SEP&gt;Samie is a person noted to have an earache and to be growing taller.&lt;SEP&gt;Child or family member of C. A. S. HALL, mentioned in the context of writing letters and garden work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385599a16e6adec90c4a4bae922a43d</data>
