    <node id="Angelo">
      <data key="d0">Angelo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Angelo is the third child of the Hall family, born on September 16, 1868.&lt;SEP&gt;Angelo is described as a cheerful boy, fond of a saw-man tool.&lt;SEP&gt;Child or family member of C. A. S. HALL, engaged in picking peas and going to his Uncle Lyman’s for milk.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c65610bff2058547e45414d7690ba36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385599a16e6adec90c4a4bae922a43d</data>
