      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Constant is a person planning work, mentioned in family correspondence.&lt;SEP&gt;Constant is a family member of the writer, mentioned in relation to home living.&lt;SEP&gt;Constant is mentioned as a family member, likely a relative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75cbd757758ebd60747dadb03eddfded</data>
