      <data key="d2">Glass is a material made by melting potash with fire, used to help the old see, provide light, and create telescopes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glass is a reflective object used for viewing oneself or other objects, often associated with reflection and perception.&lt;SEP&gt;Glass vessels are transparent containers made from silica, used historically for storing liquids like wine.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18fc234e4ccd21f6ffe31638a97054a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2131d24a8dbb5fbb7841a0c8eb97f9f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1cbc70bf76a9f17da10b1c67a4da593</data>
