    <node id="Sugar">
      <data key="d0">Sugar</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sugar is produced from the tree and is an important sweetening agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Sugars are carbohydrates without nitrogen, involved in providing energy and heat.&lt;SEP&gt;Sugar is a sweet substance produced from the conversion of starch in grains during sprouting and used in fermentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Sugar is a food substance that can produce fat in the body and is derived from sources like sugar-cane, maple-trees, and beets.&lt;SEP&gt;Sugar is a simple carbohydrate that the body uses for energy, derived from starches broken down through digestion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18fc234e4ccd21f6ffe31638a97054a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fb1afd3f1137ef2464bcbf8e6ca0880&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764612171</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Furniture">
      <data key="d0">Furniture</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Furniture is made from wood obtained from the tree, indicating its utility.&lt;SEP&gt;Items including bureau, bedstead, chairs, desk, and bedclothes discussed for sale or transfer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18fc234e4ccd21f6ffe31638a97054a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
