    <node id="Birds">
      <data key="d0">Birds</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Birds are depicted as beautiful, singing or murmuring, symbolizing nature's loveliness.&lt;SEP&gt;General term for various birds mentioned, symbolizing nature and emotion.&lt;SEP&gt;Birds are animals depicted within the branches of holm oaks, symbolizing life and activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Birds flutter and are described as sleepless and wretched, contributing to the oppressive atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;The birds are depicted as part of the forest scene, reacting to the weather and environment.</data>
