      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Stars are mentioned as visible in the night sky, symbolizing calmness and beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Stars are depicted as dripping with blood, symbolizing cosmic or supernatural phenomena or curses.&lt;SEP&gt;Stars refer to the luminous celestial bodies that illuminate the night sky above the setting described.&lt;SEP&gt;Stars are visible in the night sky during the siege, providing light and indicating time.&lt;SEP&gt;Stars are celestial bodies illuminating the sky, sparkling with winter radiance.</data>
