    <node id="Master">
      <data key="d0">Master</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to a spiritual or religious leader whom the woman anointed, symbolizing respect and spiritual reverence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Master is a character who is asked about engaging in combat, indicating a figure of authority or expertise.&lt;SEP&gt;Master is a character who plays the fiddle and directs the activities, giving instructions and approving the progress.&lt;SEP&gt;The Master is a figure overseeing the comets, crossing out No. 73 from the list, issuing orders to find a runaway meteor, and giving lessons to comets.</data>
