      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The family includes Mrs. Hall, her children Angelo, Percival, and other family members, forming the core of the family narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The family includes Sir Tristram, Georgiana, Salome, Sheba, and other related characters involved in domestic, financial, and social matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The family discussed includes the narrator, his wife, his father, Uncle Thomas, Uncle Wight, and other relatives involved in estate and health matters.&lt;SEP&gt;A family known for migrating with children and luggage, experiencing a misadventure involving a driver who refreshed himself at public-houses.</data>
