      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The head is well-shaped, adorned by thin curls of fine, dark hair, and shows hardly a trace of white at the time of death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9153b876a7591a7e83884937254c80d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d909fd9c6be9d88c390751dd33c4cecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2beb62a30fe2b1c57e576db27e8e584f</data>
