    <node id="Hair">
      <data key="d0">Hair</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The hair is dark, fine, and arranged in thin curls.&lt;SEP&gt;Corinna's flowing hair is a feature emphasizing her beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Her hair is to be arranged anew as part of a symbolic or restorative act of order.&lt;SEP&gt;Hair is a body part that grows and is maintained through nourishment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9153b876a7591a7e83884937254c80d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a88a2ba3aaa4f2f07b382ccde92f86d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba43616fff0b8112616e172e23cfa8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6cab761408cb58a952d84a4e27dce81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ae32cc554dc390c60bd5c873778659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339a04378219e12fdd299ea57c43f944</data>
