      <data key="d2">She suffered a serious illness lasting six months or more after her sister's and Nellie Woodward’s death.&lt;SEP&gt;Sickness is an event that signifies declining health, which is worsened by the use of alcohol and tobacco.&lt;SEP&gt;Sickness is a physical condition experienced by individuals, often indicating danger or poison in the body.</data>
