      <data key="d2">Moses Stickney was a crack shot and Revolutionary War veteran, known for his marksmanship and long life, providing war stories from the Revolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Moses Stickney is the ancestor of Angeline Hall, associated with the family genealogy and the farm on which she visited.</data>
