      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Joseph Downs is Angeline's cousin who loaned her fifty dollars to complete her college course.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph Downs is a figure remembered kindly by Angeline, who considered him like a brother.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc551f9bef83bf4d019c7da7b576d80</data>
