      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The aunt of Angeline and her family and the mother of Joseph Downs, whom Angeline memorializes.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt is referenced as being present in a room with other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The aunt has 'base, ugly humours,' contributing to family trouble and conflict.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3037df50481adaea6024d7ae1774bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed7144a6153903011bff75ac1d5f586</data>
