    <node id="Storm">
      <data key="d0">Storm</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A storm on Lake Erie caused a delay, influencing the travel plans of Angeline and Asaph.&lt;SEP&gt;Storm is depicted as a great gale that causes concern and is central to the story of a girl swimming in the dark.&lt;SEP&gt;The storm is a gale that influences the story's events, associated with danger at sea.&lt;SEP&gt;A storm is approaching from the ocean, threatening the safety of the boat and indicating the weather's unpredictability.&lt;SEP&gt;The storm is a violent weather event described with rain and wind, occurring in the middle of the night and associated with the Lizard area.&lt;SEP&gt;A storm characterized by rain, wind, fog, and an angry sea that affected Cornwall.&lt;SEP&gt;A storm arose suddenly, leading to the sinking of the ship and the loss of all on board except the pilot.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-839ff46f67f18fe6822ebc6d38b389d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40a925861c89aa50e0fdf703fdaf56f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f749ef842a6b7afcee9121c9350e439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32469f057cd19090b7cd1fecfc96b839&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfcfaae8c46b24eac1b42d9fe626fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515ede8184a7b2fd3887b2b0ba59654d</data>
