    <node id="Home">
      <data key="d0">Home</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Symbolically described as a place of unity, strength, and spiritual attraction created by a central figure.&lt;SEP&gt;The home is a dark, oppressive indoor space with a dirty window and a floor covered in dust and ashes, setting a tense atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;Home refers to the narrator's residence, which is being cleaned and appreciated.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb39f6855ba70b44490f834cf645715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e24a8d13114f74ad6389fc6ea6b12f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d8118154ac2504a29e5978404009a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-696f4ed37bc2689c89ed042ecf2ec6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcea781bcee54c12362d64f503a3692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed7144a6153903011bff75ac1d5f586</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764615174</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Spiritual Attraction">
      <data key="d0">Spiritual Attraction</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to the compelling influence of the individual who made the home harmonious and filled with love.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607661</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ideal Home">
      <data key="d0">Ideal Home</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The person who created the ideal home, characterized by unobtrusive kindness and spiritual presence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607661</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unselfishness">
      <data key="d0">Unselfishness</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A fundamental trait exemplified by the individual, contributing to her influence within the family and community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607661</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Charity">
      <data key="d0">Charity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A key attribute of the individual, showing compassionate understanding and loving kindness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607661</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unselfishness and Charity">
      <data key="d0">Unselfishness and Charity</data>
      <data key="d1">concepts</data>
      <data key="d2">Core virtues that defined the individual's life and impact.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Eyes">
      <data key="d0">Eyes</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Symbolizes purity, clarity, and spiritual insight, as described in the tribute.&lt;SEP&gt;Eyes are described in the context of divine swearing, indicating the importance of eyesight as a symbol of truthfulness.&lt;SEP&gt;The eyes are sensory organs that need nourishment to function properly.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0dd004d7bb30cbae402f5f620fd614a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339a04378219e12fdd299ea57c43f944</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764612160</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Smile">
      <data key="d0">Smile</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">An emblem of her gentle nature and divine presence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2131d24a8dbb5fbb7841a0c8eb97f9f7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Perception">
      <data key="d0">Perception</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The acknowledgment that her life was spiritual and grounded in goodness and truth.&lt;SEP&gt;Perception is the process of perceiving or understanding external stimuli or internal thoughts, exemplified through the act of looking in a glass or mirror to assess oneself or others.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2131d24a8dbb5fbb7841a0c8eb97f9f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfc1025b8597e65b15cde8ed542d9bd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608156</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Faults">
      <data key="d0">Faults</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The negative traits that she was tolerant of, exemplifying her compassion.&lt;SEP&gt;Her ability to forgive and understand faults rather than criticize.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Divine">
      <data key="d0">Divine</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Her perception of the divine in others, recognizing divine traits even in faults.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0dd004d7bb30cbae402f5f620fd614a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Respect">
      <data key="d0">Respect</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Her reverence for the divine and moral goodness in others was reflected in her attitude.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-983c8bccfafaa4eb3ef49034ee60c8ce</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Gentleness">
      <data key="d0">Gentleness</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Her tender nature, helping her connect with and aid those disliked or shunned by others.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607662</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tenderness">
      <data key="d0">Tenderness</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A trait of her character, symbolizing her soft, compassionate nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Poor">
      <data key="d0">Poor</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The disadvantaged individuals whom she helped without condescension.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Despised">
      <data key="d0">Despised</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Those marginalized or disliked, whom she received with unconditional love and kindness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conscience">
      <data key="d0">Conscience</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Personified as an inner moral guide she honored in herself and others.&lt;SEP&gt;Conscience is an internal moral sense guiding human behavior and decision-making, emphasized as an essential human possession.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d33ad6077f3960deb15ae14cd3cb1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764615468</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Social Order">
      <data key="d0">Social Order</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The false societal limits which she disregarded, preferring to honor individuals based on their intrinsic qualities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Externals">
      <data key="d0">Externals</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to superficial social distinctions she avoided emphasizing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8442dd0527e82eb09ee5eeff266010ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
