    </node>
    <node id="Morgan's Riflemen">
      <data key="d0">Morgan's Riflemen</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Morgan's Riflemen were a unit of skilled marksmen in Washington’s army, noted for their bravery and shooting accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mary Hastings">
      <data key="d0">Mary Hastings</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mary Hastings was the wife of Moses Stickney and mother of four noble sons and four daughters, descended from English earl lineage according to tradition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Daniel Gilman">
      <data key="d0">Daniel Gilman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Daniel Gilman was a young man who courted and married Electa Cook, causing family disapproval.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607663</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mount Monadnock">
      <data key="d0">Mount Monadnock</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Mount Monadnock is a prominent mountain visible from the high ridge near Jaffrey.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607664</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Henry">
      <data key="d0">Henry</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Henry is mentioned as a figure in the context of American independence, possibly referring to Old Hickory (Andrew Jackson), associated with victory at New Orleans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764607664</data>
