      <data key="d0">The Black River</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black River is a local waterway near where Theophilus Stickney and his family lived, noted for its productive soil and regional significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd5ecb41e87808c4d5b933250c73c2b</data>
