    </node>
    <node id="Salt">
      <data key="d0">Salt</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-761dc75dfaa658aca91981a9ec83d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb927db7ea2bc4669beaaff8354b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a504f361c734f54d3814cb24dcdf2588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb3f38fdfb7168489cd1fb4adcb2515</data>
      <data key="d2">Grandfather Cook traveled to Syracuse to obtain salt for the family.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is needed in the diet to enhance flavor and support bodily functions, sought out by animals and humans.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is a substance mentioned as part of the story, symbolizing warmth or comfort.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is used superstitiously in Africa and elsewhere as a safeguard against evil and for protection during night passes.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is present on the ground, congealed in shining heaps, and associated with fertility of the soil.</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614618</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Education">
      <data key="d0">Education</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-761dc75dfaa658aca91981a9ec83d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3573c74971fb594d0887556481e6476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9481c4e9169907102e1a6a63fadb365</data>
      <data key="d2">Angeline began attending district school at age three and became an accomplished young girl.&lt;SEP&gt;Education involves instruction and training meant to cultivate virtues like thoroughness, care in work, and moral understanding.</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608139</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
