      <data key="d2">She exulted in the beauty of Maryland sunsets, sharing moments of joy with her sons.&lt;SEP&gt;The sunset is a long flood of light that Rudolph notices, symbolizing the scene's atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;The sunset is described as a natural spectacle observed from the cliffs, carrying a mysterious charm that every sunset possesses, akin to human faces.</data>
