    </node>
    <node id="Governmental Structures">
      <data key="d0">Governmental Structures</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Includes the reformed method of elections, boroughs, prisons, charities, clergy, and militia-balloting, representing aspects of England's political and social organization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e94b824e125ccc07ef22224a84ba470f</data>
