    <node id="Socrates">
      <data key="d0">Socrates</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Socrates is an ancient Greek philosopher referenced in the context of a comic scene involving a burlesque depiction.&lt;SEP&gt;Socrates was an ancient Greek philosopher whose image or narrative has been subject to mockery or burlesque, affecting perceptions of reverence.&lt;SEP&gt;Socrates was a classical Greek philosopher whose mortality was established, serving as a reference point in philosophical reasoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66a11e3fdc0678e4dcf84b4d05935cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ad7b1efc102b531e61eabc7cf14aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82c94a2560089b784f3c586805c58cc2</data>
