    <node id="Apology">
      <data key="d0">Apology</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Apology is a philosophical narrative by Socrates, regarded as consecrated by the gratitude of ages.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Apology_ is a famous dialogue by Plato depicting Socrates' defense, revered as a significant philosophical text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66a11e3fdc0678e4dcf84b4d05935cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ad7b1efc102b531e61eabc7cf14aea</data>
