      <data key="d2">Euphorion is an individual who discusses principles related to property, originality, and intellectual inheritance.&lt;SEP&gt;Euphorion is depicted as an accomplished theorist who engages with philosophical and scientific ideas, sometimes borrowing others' ideas anonymously.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication discussing literary history, including Lessing and Sterne.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal that discussed literary figures including Sterne and Lessing.</data>
