      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The _Apology_ is a philosophical dialogue by Socrates, regarded as a sacred narrative by the ages.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Apology_ is a philosophical dialogue by Plato that depicts Socrates' defense and is regarded as a revered work emphasizing respect and moral virtue.</data>
