      <data key="d2">Sir Gavial Mantrap is a character involved in a scandal related to his conduct with the Eocene Mines, situated in a context of social disgrace.&lt;SEP&gt;Sir Gavial Mantrap is a character whose moral qualities are discussed in relation to societal perceptions and pity.</data>
