    <node id="Chinese">
      <data key="d0">Chinese</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Chinese relates to China, its language, and its culture, mentioned in the context of learning and poetry.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chinese are described in detail as part of the scene, with faces, children, and laborers.&lt;SEP&gt;Region where finger impression signatures are used in courts and by government officials.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chinese are an ancient civilization with a long history of musical instrument development and cultural traditions related to music.&lt;SEP&gt;Chinese refers to the Chinese civilization and its musical instruments.</data>
