    <node id="Jew">
      <data key="d0">Jew</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jews are a people distinguished by their religion, ideas, and history, notably their struggle against Rome and their scriptural tradition.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jews are a group characterized by distinctive cultural, religious, and historical traits, often facing persecution and social marginalization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jew is depicted as a member of the scattered people, possessing qualities such as healthiness, beauty of physique, practical ability, and aptitude in science and art, with significant political and social influence.&lt;SEP&gt;A Jew is a member of the Hebrew nation, possessing a shared heritage, history, and religious tradition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a032a23ccb5ee9bb45879a8d6dba2c2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa5e1a83155f3287dd6529a44afe4517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6ec6b33bad7d855f63b027ce155c41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf1500eca47c9a930e310cc4b31eb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57f75296e95e08ee42b21dc84299286f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
