    <node id="Magicodumbras">
      <data key="d0">Magicodumbras</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Magicodumbras are fictional or mystical entities discussed in the context of the scheme that Merman believes will revolutionize history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Magicodumbras is a subject of controversy for Merman, representing an esoteric or speculative idea which he advocates and that influences his reputation.&lt;SEP&gt;Magicodumbras refers to a subject or system of study that Merman criticizes or discusses, known to be complex and significant in context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Magicodumbras are mysterious entities or concepts in Merman's theories, associated with obscure and questionable knowledge.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51fbf078c5fa58ff6dbd05d3e173932f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15731bb06f5468be78ed2b36a5ef8f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5219425f0dd684e1c14ee102afdc4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0caba7a3455a33871464a9439e236182</data>
