    <node id="Walrus">
      <data key="d0">Walrus</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Walrus is used metaphorically to describe Merman, highlighting qualities of robust perseverance and potential for aggression when threatened.&lt;SEP&gt;Walrus is a marine mammal that provides fat meat which is a major part of the Esquimaux diet.&lt;SEP&gt;Walrus is an Arctic marine mammal that is part of the diet for some explorers and hunters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51fbf078c5fa58ff6dbd05d3e173932f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40e9d9d6bed631bcdf0022bea513804</data>
