    <node id="Erudition">
      <data key="d0">Erudition</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Erudition refers to extensive knowledge or learning, emphasized as a key aspect in Merman's detailed scholarly efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Erudition refers to extensive scholarly knowledge, contrasted with intuitive insight in the context of prophets.&lt;SEP&gt;Erudition refers to learned knowledge and the process of acquiring deep scholarly understanding.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b65963d298578e7408d7e8e5ece65af6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5219425f0dd684e1c14ee102afdc4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f42ca0e751524db1f61362471e59be14</data>
