    <node id="Mixtus">
      <data key="d0">Mixtus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mixtus is a personality described as a wealthy commercial man, known for his kindness, social reform ideals, religious and philanthropic interests, and a complex character torn between love of wealth and love of ideas and social reform.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixtus is a man who has transitioned from provincial religious and philanthropic pursuits to wealthy social life in London, where he is involved in business and married to Scintilla.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixtus is a man who has become wealthy through business, married to Scintilla, and resides in London with a mansion and social ambitions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixtus is a wealthy individual with diverse interests, knowledgeable in history, religion, social issues, and commerce, who exhibits fluctuating views and a complex personality.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixtus is an unspecified entity whose full nature is not known, and it is discussed in relation to moral and philosophical themes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2712735f75439e629f6b370c94182bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a861d56558288f1ebda11fb012fb783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608133</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Scintilla">
      <data key="d0">Scintilla</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Scintilla is a lively woman married to Mixtus, characterized by her prettiness, liveliness, and admiration of music, with little understanding of religious or philosophical doctrines.&lt;SEP&gt;Scintilla is associated with fashionable society, hosting gatherings where social and cultural topics are discussed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036</data>
