      <data key="d0">Religious Nonconformists</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Nonconformists are religious groups outside the established church, regarded as unfashionable and somewhat absurd by Scintilla.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Episcopacy">
      <data key="d0">Episcopacy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Episcopacy relates to the church governance system, which Scintilla does not insist upon in her religious views.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Anglicanism">
      <data key="d0">Anglicanism</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Anglicanism is the church tradition about which Scintilla is indifferent, not insisting on its practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Church Rates">
      <data key="d0">Church Rates</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Church rates refer to local taxes for churches, which Scintilla does not support or oppose strongly.&lt;SEP&gt;Church rates are local taxes that Scintilla does not consider necessary.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Art">
      <data key="d0">Art</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Art and music, which Scintilla values highly, considering people who believe in doctrines as generally lacking good taste.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Badinage">
      <data key="d0">Badinage</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Badinage is witty or playful conversation, which Scintilla believes many people lacking in taste do not understand.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Religious, Social, Philosophical Doctrines">
      <data key="d0">Religious, Social, Philosophical Doctrines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Doctrines of these types are regarded by Scintilla as mostly ridiculous and pretentious.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conventicle">
      <data key="d0">Conventicle</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A conventicle is a secret or unlawful religious meeting, which Scintilla does not distinguish from religious groups she considers unfashionable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9cbb983a5992ca5627430872d4cdac4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608134</data>
