      <data key="d0">European Twin of the Indian Potentate</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to a European ruler characterized by lewd and debauched conduct, similar to the Indian potentate discussed by Macaulay.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d98dca421f9ad7bdbf89c28e679535b6</data>
