    <node id="Mine">
      <data key="d0">Mine</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mine represents the universal or collective sense of ownership and obligation, often used metaphorically for collective ideas or laws.&lt;SEP&gt;The mine is an underground extraction site where the characters navigate through tunnels and chambers.&lt;SEP&gt;The mine is the site of prospecting and mining activities, connected to the spring and the gold discovery.</data>
