    <node id="Wordsworth">
      <data key="d0">Wordsworth</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wordsworth was a famous English Romantic poet known for his reflective poetry and connection with nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Wordsworth was a prominent English Romantic poet known for his reflective poetry and love of nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Wordsworth is a poet referenced in the story, symbolizing the literary heritage admired by the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;William Wordsworth is a Romantic poet who wrote "Leech-gatherer on the lonely moor," representing a figure of patience and rural life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-87a982ac1d3e226f09d7de61a10ed706&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14dbef413cc17a6b6cd1e7d1b659eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb2935b8030ab293e3b353c463c7bc94</data>
