    <node id="Christ">
      <data key="d0">Christ</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Christ is the central figure of Christianity, acknowledged as the Saviour of mankind, with the historical and religious significance discussed in the context of religious history.&lt;SEP&gt;Christ refers to Jesus of Nazareth, regarded as the Messiah in Christianity, whose teachings and death are central to Christian faith.&lt;SEP&gt;Christ, the figure central to Christianity, had a Jewish heart and lineage, emphasizing the historical Jewish roots of Christian origins.&lt;SEP&gt;Christ is a central figure in Christianity, believed to have come concerning the flesh from the lineage of the Fathers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d6d693b5da179ac238c1380743ccaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6ec6b33bad7d855f63b027ce155c41b</data>
