      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Paul was an apostle who acknowledged his Jewish heritage and the importance of the laws and promises given to Israelites.&lt;SEP&gt;Paul's refers to a place in the story where the narrator parting from the uncle Wight took place.</data>
