    <node id="Pepin">
      <data key="d0">Pepin</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pepin is an example or symbol representing youthful enthusiasm and the desire to mirror the universe through reflection.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is a diligent writer and thinker, characterized by industriousness and a tendency toward self-reliance in intellectual pursuits, despite a potential inclination towards arrogance and superficial knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is a writer and intellectual who contemplates the effects of continual writing and the nature of his own literary ambitions and achievements.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is an individual whose written work is subject to public critique; he possesses private amiability but may insult others' capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfc1025b8597e65b15cde8ed542d9bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56385ec11929562aa21bb4172c7d269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ead820aa22844313f5dfed6efdc81ce</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608147</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Roman Empire">
      <data key="d0">Roman Empire</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Roman Empire is depicted as a historical period of grandeur, decadence, and cultural flourishing that Pepin envisions portraying in his proposed panoramic romance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Roman Empire was a dominant civilization that established institutions such as prisons for slaves and influenced architecture, culture, and governance throughout ancient Europe and the Mediterranean.&lt;SEP&gt;Boxing remained popular during the period of the Roman Empire.&lt;SEP&gt;The Roman Empire is referenced in relation to the reception and social standing of the author, indicating context of Roman societal values.&lt;SEP&gt;Historical civilization that established Salee as a Roman city, the farthest on the Atlantic coast.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83b39f09bb068668fc5d13770de07db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf5cee73398d032581450496a09223dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02e1fb091464c03ab00842920bc21f1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614550</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
