      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Rienzi is a literary work that Pepin references as an example of historical fiction; he contrasts his envisioned work with such existing works.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab</data>
