      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Trost is a friend of the narrator, skeptical about the future of machines and their independence from human control, often provides philosophical insights on technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Trost is a character engaged in a discussion about the future of machines, consciousness, and evolution, demonstrating a mixture of scientific curiosity and skepticism.</data>
