      <data key="d0">Street-Boys</data>
      <data key="d1">people</data>
      <data key="d2">Street-boys are young observers who provide frank opinions about physical appearances and contribute to the narrator's self-awareness.&lt;SEP&gt;Street-boys are individuals who travel by excursion train and express frank opinions, representing common or informal perspectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40bfbdb08a61a50c35265b9530477730&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2131d24a8dbb5fbb7841a0c8eb97f9f7</data>
