    <node id="The Narrator">
      <data key="d0">The Narrator</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The narrator is a person who contemplates self-knowledge, self-presentation, societal perceptions, and personal shortcomings.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator employs a reflective tone, comparing themselves to a carp and contemplating the evolution of machines and consciousness.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator is the first-person speaker observing and describing the internal emotional state and actions of various characters in the story, reflecting on their own feelings and experiences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40bfbdb08a61a50c35265b9530477730&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f5df96639b73ae94749ba10e9d2c87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30bc679e676a49c813bf82844d9cb331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d045712dd6297ccc766194a43dd1e1c5</data>
