    <node id="Laniger">
      <data key="d0">Laniger</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Laniger is a person characterized by having a temper but lacking talent for repartee, and is inwardly convinced that Mordax is a wolf at heart.&lt;SEP&gt;Laniger is a character with a temper and no talent for repartee, convinced that Mordax is a wolf at heart and affected by his own sensibilities and egoism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e2bfd1e53908897483fc69ea3230e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9127f659e1e3f554bc81f7f22a98021</data>
