    <node id="Mordax">
      <data key="d0">Mordax</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mordax is an intellectually engaged individual, ardent and public-spirited, with a tendency towards self-respect that resists admitting fault or embracing new ideas readily.&lt;SEP&gt;Mordax is a man who is highly regarded, possibly proud or assertive, and engaged in polemical rudeness and brutality, often retaliating against others with merciless actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mordax is a figure associated with persuasion of superiority, and exemplifies themes of vanity, arrogance, cruelty, and the need for moral checks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e2bfd1e53908897483fc69ea3230e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9127f659e1e3f554bc81f7f22a98021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31da8cb91afdafc694b4c1cdbd4ffa94</data>
