    <node id="Bear">
      <data key="d0">Bear</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The bear is a naturalObject, species that comforted the badger with a story of breakfast on bees' honey, symbolizing self-interest or lack of altruism.&lt;SEP&gt;The bear, named Bruin, is depicted as a friendly and helpful animal, assisting in feeding and comforting the old man.&lt;SEP&gt;A bear is a large animal that bursts into laughter and holds the woodchuck, later involved in a game of blindman's buff.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e2bfd1e53908897483fc69ea3230e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c0ae512a1dc43eac54573c59477cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a</data>
