    <node id="Duke of Wellington">
      <data key="d0">Duke of Wellington</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Duke of Wellington was a notable British figure, associated with the country's leadership and history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Duke of Wellington was a British military and political leader who supported opposition against Durham's policies and played political games to embarrass the Whig government.&lt;SEP&gt;The Duke of Wellington is associated with Durham's policy in Canada.</data>
