      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Catholics, particularly Irish Catholics, are mentioned as modest in their societal role, reflecting historical context.&lt;SEP&gt;Catholics are members of the Roman Catholic Church, enjoying full citizenship rights and religious privileges.&lt;SEP&gt;Catholics are members of the Catholic Church, mentioned as part of the groups granted full citizenship privileges in the society discussed.</data>
