      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Shakspere is regarded as a literary figure considered to be supreme in the presentation of character, mentioned as a subject of discussion regarding cultural and literary excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;Shakspere (William Shakespeare) is a renowned playwright whose works are discussed and admired by Felicia.&lt;SEP&gt;William Shakespeare, often spelled as Shakspere, is an iconic playwright whose works are mentioned in the context of burlesque adaptations.</data>
