    <node id="Spike">
      <data key="d0">Spike</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Spike is a political molecule characterized by its neat appearance, meticulousness, and a philosophical view of abstractions and progress, with interests in politics, morality, and society.&lt;SEP&gt;Spike is depicted as a character involved in managing trade and responding to legislation, representing a small-minded but public-spirited individual focused on class needs.</data>
