      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Proteus is a character who discusses revolutionary ideas about history and social origins, aiming to set the world right.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteus is named as a mythological figure, known for his changing shape.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteus, referred to in the First Book of the Fasti, is an ancient figure associated with the Carpathian old man.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15731bb06f5468be78ed2b36a5ef8f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e093e5565d1be13cdd6a32df8d728ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-442f3a60382a33a67c2d1a47639643cf</data>
