      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Circe is a mythological figure whose herds and herdmasters are metaphorically referenced as symbols of degraded appetites.&lt;SEP&gt;Circe is a mythical enchantress mentioned alongside Medea, known for her charms and magical practices in Greek mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Circe was a goddess and enchantress from Greek mythology, famed for her powers and association with the charms of Ææa.</data>
