      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Genius is the exceptional intellectual or creative power evident in the finest words and images of literary and artistic works.&lt;SEP&gt;Genius is the manifestation of exceptional intellectual or artistic ability, especially through poetic and literary words.&lt;SEP&gt;Genius refers to individuals with exceptional intellectual or creative power, sometimes viewed as disconnected from moral considerations.</data>
