    <node id="Ganymede">
      <data key="d0">Ganymede</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ganymede is a highly accomplished young man known for his precocious talents, youthful appearance, and leadership in literary and organizational endeavors, maintaining an illusion of perpetual youth.&lt;SEP&gt;Ganymede is a distinguished writer who perceives himself as young, with a sense of his surprising youthfulness strengthened by external confirmations and self-perception despite age-related external signs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82c94a2560089b784f3c586805c58cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4aa27a6c64d7fb72f336a10c4ff50667</data>
