    <node id="European Nations">
      <data key="d0">European Nations</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">European Nations refers to the collective countries of Europe, which Ganymede conducted a comparative estimate of, indicative of his scholarly activities.&lt;SEP&gt;European nations have historically used instruments like the cimbalom, cembalo, and dulcimer in their musical traditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82c94a2560089b784f3c586805c58cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95a9160a14d7266e2100e2d55ebcd715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f</data>
