    <node id="Ancestors">
      <data key="d0">Ancestors</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Ancestors are the forefathers of the English people, whose virtues and traditions are highlighted as foundational to national identity and heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Ancestors or early religious figures related to the covenants and the transmission of heritage and promises.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to the Grecian manner of dress and tradition maintained in the festival.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d6d693b5da179ac238c1380743ccaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-442f3a60382a33a67c2d1a47639643cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba43616fff0b8112616e172e23cfa8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e937ae9f431c4368aa293a51bc61c19e</data>
