    <node id="Liberty">
      <data key="d0">Liberty</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Liberty reflects Spike’s political stance of supporting free trade and political independence.&lt;SEP&gt;Liberty refers to the inherited freedom and political blessings passed down from ancestors, symbolizing national virtue and independence.&lt;SEP&gt;Liberty refers to the idea of freedom, especially individual freedom to persist in cultural or personal idiosyncrasies.</data>
