      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Pumpiter is a provincial town with a newspaper press, political divisions, and a variety of literary critics.&lt;SEP&gt;Pumpiter is a location mentioned as the place where the narrator attended an event and borrowed a book.</data>
