    <node id="Posterity">
      <data key="d0">Posterity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Posterity refers to future generations who will acquire new fuel sources and ideas.&lt;SEP&gt;Posterity refers to future generations, questioned by Spike in terms of their contributions or benefits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f42ca0e751524db1f61362471e59be14</data>
