      <data key="d0">Goddess of Wisdom</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The goddess of wisdom is a deity symbolizing knowledge, associated with activities like spinning and weaving in historical worship.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
