      <data key="d0">Spinning and Weaving</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Spinning and weaving are traditional manufacturing activities historically symbolized as the domain of the goddess of wisdom and linked to progress.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
