      <data key="d0">Cotton Manufacture</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The cotton manufacture is a business Spike succeeded in, representing his approach to order, industry, and economic progress.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42</data>
