    <node id="Trade">
      <data key="d0">Trade</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Trade is Spike’s primary occupation method, involved in manufacturing and commerce, shaping his political views.&lt;SEP&gt;Trade involves the exchange of goods and services, protected under treaties with Morocco to ensure security for merchants.&lt;SEP&gt;The trade in Mogador involves importing a variety of European-manufactured goods and exporting local products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9127f659e1e3f554bc81f7f22a98021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67661a5e143ad1775de09087e2149acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2d548d08b4129bfc47eab34719160b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86994d5a5ba62d67eaecd5aaeeb5aab4</data>
