      <data key="d0">Order</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Order refers to systematic arrangement or discipline, a trait associated with Spike’s character, exemplified by his neatness and meticulousness.&lt;SEP&gt;Order also refers to Spike's organized business and personal appearance, highlighting his disciplined nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8429a197795773b69fd79fc5921e1e</data>
