    <node id="Parliament">
      <data key="d0">Parliament</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Parliament is the political institution where Touchwood might serve if he entered public life, engaging in speeches and partisanship.&lt;SEP&gt;The Parliament of the United Kingdom debated the resolutions concerning Canadian governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Parliament is the legislative body discussed by Samuel Pepys, involved in political disputes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-022b8d49df0a9b3198a3827e7ca1f148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0359fb0e1dc5215c33545ffddcd78876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986db80f0b248cae0ba30adbca747f75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40dae678ded1ef4fdb119e4518ba93d8</data>
