    <node id="The Forest">
      <data key="d0">The Forest</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The forest symbolizes complex intellectual tasks, like entering a thick forest, representing the difficulty in beginning a pursuit of truth or ideas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a wooded area comprising trees, thorns, and brambles that conceal parts of the trail and create a perilous environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The forest is depicted as the home of animals that are preparing to leave or return, representing a natural habitat.</data>
