    <node id="The Body">
      <data key="d0">The Body</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to the human body, implied to have a distinct odour linked to race or bloodline, historically used to stereotype or discriminate.&lt;SEP&gt;The body performs essential functions like pumping blood, using lungs, and carrying waste, working constantly without conscious thought.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-32a6a44741e5c0f11276cf06e9f29dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3</data>
