      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">European culture emphasizes the importance of mental discrimination and contrasts it with mental sloth affecting society's perception and reasoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90fd9a36fae91000a3e050e11afb101c</data>
