    </node>
    <node id="Italy">
      <data key="d0">Italy</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Italy is depicted historically as a region with dilettanteism and territorial division, now transformed through the memory of its past into a nation's cultural identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Italy is one of the regions where boxing has been practiced since early times.&lt;SEP&gt;Country known for its numerous galleries and museums, previously visited by the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;Italy is a country with many galleries and museums, some of which are visited by the narrator.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90fd9a36fae91000a3e050e11afb101c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38519f656227a2cd39eb8d1b1d316bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9947d8e5a23dab49c88d36cae1db57a3</data>
