    <node id="Commercial Intercourse">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Intercourse</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Commercial intercourse is seen by Mixtus as a primary driver of cultural and religious exchange, including the spread of Christianity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608170</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Money">
      <data key="d0">Money</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Money is regarded by Mixtus as the essential means to obtain the best things in life, a view he expresses with strong emphasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Money spent on alcohol and tobacco is considered wasted and can be quantified in terms of amount, highlighting economic waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Money is shoved into police hands by individuals attempting to escape during the chaos.&lt;SEP&gt;Money is discussed as a short-term solution to financial issues, including borrowing and bills.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4ecf42e13f0e671845a3cd5496327f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5687d49ea69879edf0a3681424249921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a623d5c8d4e641231b09b42787ad809b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
