      <data key="d0">Genius and Mind</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Genius and mind are valued by Mixtus as sources of delight and are considered superior qualities to money, though he also recognizes their societal limitations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608170</data>
