    <node id="Columbus">
      <data key="d0">Columbus</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Columbus is an explorer whose reputation as a faulty adventurer is highlighted by the naming of America after Amerigo Vespucci, reflecting mistaken attribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Columbus is mentioned as the discoverer of America, referenced as part of the historical ideas in the narrative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b908a2ec6e0e79d9a9bbbe68b3e84b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8191bf61815f5a982986bba2de4926e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611969</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Amerigo">
      <data key="d0">Amerigo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Amerigo Vespucci is the explorer after whom the continent of America is named, exemplifying mistaken attribution and popular misconception.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b908a2ec6e0e79d9a9bbbe68b3e84b6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608171</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vestiges">
      <data key="d0">Vestiges</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'Vestiges' is a work whose authorship was uncertain, illustrating trust based on preconceptions and the impact of reputation on judgment.&lt;SEP&gt;The 'Vestiges' is a work whose authorship, if discovered, could spoil probabilities and cause disappointment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b908a2ec6e0e79d9a9bbbe68b3e84b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608171</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="John">
      <data key="d0">John</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">John is a person whose name appears in the context of fixed guesses about the authorship of 'Vestiges'.&lt;SEP&gt;John is a child of the narrator, whom the children are fond of and with whom they are merry.&lt;SEP&gt;John is an elderly man who displays manners reminiscent of a knight of the Round Table and guides others in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;John is a fisherman involved in rescuing women and children from the wreck of the _Brest_; he was asleep during the sinking and participated in rescue efforts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40dae678ded1ef4fdb119e4518ba93d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d33ad6077f3960deb15ae14cd3cb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a287228f598fefb3952d1a82454d23b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764615468</data>
      <data key="d6" />
