      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Magdalen refers to a place associated with the fixed guess of the 'Toucan' by Shrike.&lt;SEP&gt;Magdalen is an educational institution where Mr. Sanchy is from.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed7144a6153903011bff75ac1d5f586</data>
