    <node id="Hyaena">
      <data key="d0">Hyaena</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hyaena expresses splenetic laughter and questions whether to hush up the affair.&lt;SEP&gt;The hyaena is a large bristling and bellowing beast shot by a mameluke, described as having an immense head like a bull-dog.&lt;SEP&gt;The hyaena is a wild animal encountered during the expedition, known for its stupidity, and is shot and carried as a prize.&lt;SEP&gt;A hyaena was seen, adding to the list of wild animals encountered.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d587eba2d4e09716d8ff298c1f8fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978</data>
