    <node id="Insect">
      <data key="d0">Insect</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Insects are mentioned as possible creators of honeycomb, with particular focus on the Wasp and Musk-rat.&lt;SEP&gt;An insect, mentioned as part of the ambient sound in the Temple, symbolizing the quietness and stillness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab5a2da379766b69f7bf3153cb0f2c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667660461b3e82515e6fd43c059be5a6</data>
