    <node id="Son">
      <data key="d0">Son</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Son refers to Jesus Christ, identified as the divine figure embodying mercy and sacrifice in Christian belief.&lt;SEP&gt;The son of the Old Man, implied to be involved in criminal activities or in danger related to Wolfe.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6ec6b33bad7d855f63b027ce155c41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc7c601f1a721e64645ccdb5e20b488f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc15155697aef464caa48945b394d83</data>
