    <node id="Julius Caesar">
      <data key="d0">Julius Caesar</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Julius Caesar is a play by William Shakespeare, praised by Felicia for its effective acting potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Julius Caesar was referenced metaphorically to describe Hines's bravery.&lt;SEP&gt;Julius Caesar was a Roman leader whose temple housed the painting of Venus by Apelles.&lt;SEP&gt;Julius Caesar was a Roman military and political leader, associated with Augustus, who placed the painting of Venus in his temple.&lt;SEP&gt;Julius Caesar was a Roman leader who constructed a forum named after him, with notable imperial attributes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f81cfeed72c9cc766e8d6605bb4860f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a152136647fcdc06015572bf449dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb2899f1a356a92ddd5741e19e4f7f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6cab761408cb58a952d84a4e27dce81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924b5c93c638c81e41f6bcea25012d86</data>
