    <node id="Voltaire">
      <data key="d0">Voltaire</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Voltaire is an Enlightenment thinker included in an idealized assembly of great minds for conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;Voltaire was an Enlightenment thinker whose ideas had no shelter among Canadians during the period discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;Voltaire was a French Enlightenment thinker recognized for his lucidity but also criticized for his want of seriousness and reverence.&lt;SEP&gt;Voltaire was a French Enlightenment thinker characterized by his lucidity, opposition to absurdity, and a war upon what he considered foolish, influencing the French world and cultivated classes.</data>
