      <data key="d2">Christ was a Jewish individual, emphasizing the Jewish origins of Christianity.&lt;SEP&gt;Jewish refers to people and families adhering to Judaism, known for marriage practices and family maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Jewish families are involved in the production of _acqua ardiente_, despite legal punishments.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
