      <data key="d2">Trost emphasizes that machines are extensions of human consciousness and depend on human oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;The machine for compressing coal refuse is designed for simple, powerful, and progressive operation to produce homogeneous fuel.</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611665</data>
