      <data key="d2">Pliny's metaphor relates lions and monkeys, symbolizing a world turned upside down or absurdly juxtaposed.&lt;SEP&gt;Lions are abundant in Aghla's vicinity, reputed to be cowardly and easily frightened.&lt;SEP&gt;Lions are large carnivores that are notably absent from the route, preferring open plains over sandy or rocky terrain.</data>
