      <data key="d2">The narrator prefers embracing contradictions as a pathway to truth, exemplifying a philosophical approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Gazing is the method used by the local man to observe the town and the fishermen preparing their boats.&lt;SEP&gt;Otium cum dignitate is a Latin phrase referring to leisurely dignity, associated with the man's peaceful life.</data>
