      <data key="d2">The himation is a traditional Greek garment, representing classical Greek attire.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing conceals parts of the body and can be removed or lifted as part of intimacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing worn next to the skin can carry worn-out particles and should be aired properly to maintain hygiene and comfort.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing includes garments such as woolen under-garments, boots, and stockings that help keep the body warm.</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764612175</data>
