      <data key="d0">Bakers Wife</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The baker’s wife is a character met by Schummel at Gellert’s grave, involved in a sentimental encounter.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e7f1d14d418ffd32ee04aefb91e7331</data>
