    <node id="Ferriar">
      <data key="d0">Ferriar</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ferriar is a researcher who investigated Sterne’s borrowings and thefts of work from others, especially in England.&lt;SEP&gt;Ferriar was an English author whose essay “Gelehrte Diebstähle” was reviewed in the context of Sterne’s borrowings and criticized in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Ferriar is a person with pages 77, 78.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84307003973059440e3b98bafcdbef48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc64252e1565a88b1d7729211672d7b</data>
