    <node id="Burtons Anatomy of Melancholy">
      <data key="d0">Burtons Anatomy of Melancholy</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A literary work from which Sterne is accused of borrowing wisdom, as noted by Ferriar and Lessing.&lt;SEP&gt;A book from which Sterne is said to have borrowed wisdom, with passages marked by Lessing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84307003973059440e3b98bafcdbef48</data>
