    <node id="Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften">
      <data key="d0">Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A periodical that reviewed translations of Sterne’s works and discussed humor and Sterne’s literature.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a periodical or bibliographic source that included quotations and reviews likely related to Sterne’s influence.&lt;SEP&gt;A German academic journal that provided critique on Sterne’s early works, indicating some insipidity and affectation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a German library that reviews Sterne’s works, expressing criticism of insipidness, affected style, and questioning authenticity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a publishing entity that favored Sterne’s works and published related volumes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10af28895017a86626bcf11657f1ec8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ccff1ea6ecc4a7b158250715bcedc0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-573f9ee936a1b21e04721d34c3cc59f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eb63434ade7863dbb529206940c54f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
