    <node id="Jördens">
      <data key="d0">Jördens</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jördens was a source that provided a date (1773) associated with the publication of the third edition of Zückert's translation.&lt;SEP&gt;Jördens is a person who provided information about Bode’s proficiency and connection to translation activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Jördens is referenced in a footnote in historical-literary context, associated with a page number in a collection by Hirsching.&lt;SEP&gt;Jördens is referenced as having repeated certain footnotes and contributed to the critique and analysis of the texts.&lt;SEP&gt;Karl Heinrich Jördens authored a lexicon of German poets and prose writers from 1806 to 1811.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb6830a00197a03b02eae670e7f2e9ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dcb2da270a1bb0417354dcf23b9656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77f5d39cb0cceb82bc5a1d37faf560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-386823b9eb1b29a74db42941aa225998</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764608996</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Histing">
      <data key="d0">Histing</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Histing, specifically Hirsching's Historisch-litterarisches Handbuch, is an authoritative source cited in footnotes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb6830a00197a03b02eae670e7f2e9ec</data>
