      <data key="d0">Allg. deutsche Bibl.</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Allgemeine deutsche Bibl. is a publication that contains appendices and references to literary history and texts.&lt;SEP&gt;Allg. deutsche Bibl. is a bibliographical source that references works related to Sterne and German literary history.&lt;SEP&gt;A bibliographical resource that includes information on Sterne’s influence.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Allgemeine Deutsche Bibliothek" is a publication cited multiple times.&lt;SEP&gt;Allg. deutsche Bibl. is a bibliographic reference to German universal bibliographies that discuss various literary works.</data>
