      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The “Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften” is a publication that contained an article “Ueber die Laune,” discussing literary and cultural differences.&lt;SEP&gt;A scholarly journal that reviewed Sterne’s Sentimental Journey, including praising its sentiment and humor.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication where a review of unspecified work was published, associated with academic and literary commentary.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of sciences and arts published in Leipzig between 1765 and 1806, initially edited by Chr. Felix Weisse.</data>
