      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A newspaper that provided detailed reviews of Sterne’s works, praising the literary qualities of the Sentimental Journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Jenaische Zeitungen is a newspaper that published references to Sterne-related works in 1777.&lt;SEP&gt;A newspaper noted for publishing articles related to literary history in 1776.&lt;SEP&gt;Jenaische Zeitungen are newspapers mentioned in the context of publication reviews relating to critique or critique movement.</data>
