    <node id="Hotel">
      <data key="d0">Hotel</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The place where the poems of the “Original” are left behind.&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel was five stories tall and built of brick, with dense smoke spreading through its halls.&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel is a large building occupied with guests, affected by fire, with multiple stories and rooms.&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel is the setting for much of the social interaction, serving as a place of residence and gathering for characters.</data>
