      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tobias is a character in Wezel's novel, beginning the story "ab ovo" and related to the novel's themes of connection between childhood condition and later life.&lt;SEP&gt;Tobias’s inability to remove his hat with his right hand influences his future life.</data>
