    <node id="Tristram">
      <data key="d0">Tristram</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tristram is a character who has a calamitous nose, and his name and physical attributes are a focus of Walter Shandy's efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Tristram is referenced for his obliquity in setting up his top, illustrating character traits.&lt;SEP&gt;Tristram is a person involved in the rescue of The Dean, showing concern and taking action to assist him.</data>
