    <node id="Selmann">
      <data key="d0">Selmann</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Selmann is a character embodying Yorick and Shandy traits, satirizing obsession with “originals” and sentimentalism.&lt;SEP&gt;Selmann seeks originality and is involved in pursuits of sentimental adventures, satirized in the text.</data>
