      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Helfreich Peter Sturz was a critic and opponent of Sterne’s cult in Germany, traveled to England, and documented Sterne's influence and reputation.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturz is referenced as an individual who comments on Sterne’s moral character and prints a poem in the Deutsches Museum.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturz is a person, likely a scholar or author.</data>
