      <data key="d0">Deutsches Museum</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Deutsches Museum published a letter defending Sterne upon criticism of his influence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsches Museum published letters and poems concerning Sterne and his reputation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsches Museum is a scientific and technological museum where Sturz printed a poem in July 1776.&lt;SEP&gt;A source referenced multiple times regarding German cultural and literary history.&lt;SEP&gt;A source from 1777, cited in references related to German cultural history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsches Museum is a German museum referenced with historical dates, indicating its role in historical documentation or exhibitions.</data>
