      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Erich Schmidt was a scholar who discussed the influence of Sterne’s themes, notably regarding animal fidelity and literary treatment, in his commentary.&lt;SEP&gt;Scholar who reviewed or commented on Lessing’s works, mentioned in context of Sterne.&lt;SEP&gt;Erich Schmidt authored a work referencing Sterne, Richardson, Rousseau, and Goethe.&lt;SEP&gt;Erich Schmidt discussed Sterne’s influence in his work on Richardson, Rousseau, and Goethe.</data>
