      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Uncle Toby is a character from Sterne’s ‘Tristram Shandy,’ symbolizing a type of fidelity and character comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncle Toby is a character known for his amiable nature, contrasted with Tellheim in terms of camaraderie.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncle Toby is another figure in the mortuary scene, linked to Yorick’s Journey and Tristram Shandy.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncle Toby is a character in Sterne's works, mentioned as part of Sterne's character list and thematic references.&lt;SEP&gt;Uncle Toby is a character associated with Sterne’s "Tristram Shandy" where his story and personal application are referenced.</data>
