    <node id="Empfindsamkeit">
      <data key="d0">Empfindsamkeit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Empfindsamkeit is a theme or style that the novel Tobias Knaut satirizes, opposing Sterne’s influence.&lt;SEP&gt;A German term meaning sentimentalism, emphasized as a significant cultural and literary movement in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;A German literary or cultural concept related to sensibility.</data>
