      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hettner analyzed the epoch of fiction, emphasizing speculation as central to the characters and themes of the German novel.&lt;SEP&gt;Hettner is a literary historian mentioned in relation to Sterne's influence in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Hettner is cited as a source for letters and literary analysis involving Sterne.&lt;SEP&gt;Hettner authored a history of German literature in the 18th century, 4th edition, included in the third division of his Literaturgeschichte des achtzehnten Jahrhunderts.</data>
