      <data key="d2">Jean Paul is a German author studied in relation to Sterne’s influence, as mentioned in the context of recent literary works.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Paul is a German author connected to Sterne's influence, as studied in recent works.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Paul is a German author who accepted the work attributed to Sterne, cited as evidence of authenticity.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Paul is a literary figure referenced in relation to Sterne-inspired works.&lt;SEP&gt;A writer influenced by Sterne, whose works show traces of Sterne’s style and themes; related to the literary equipment and influence analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Paul is a prominent author associated with Sterne and Hippel in scholarly studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Paul is a noted literary figure.</data>
