      <data key="d0">Frau Kurt</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Frau Kurt is a character who embodies themes of hypocrisy and contradiction in sentimentalism, especially in her attitudes toward animals and human suffering.&lt;SEP&gt;Frau Kurt is a character who exhibits compassion for animals and demonstrates satirical behavior through her interactions with animals and her indifference to village destruction.</data>
