      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lotte is Pank’s sensible fiancée who comments on the “apes” of Yorick, “Werther,” and “Siegwart,” providing a critical perspective on sentimental characters.&lt;SEP&gt;Lotte is a woman characterized by her lack of sensibility, affecting the emotional state of Pankraz.</data>
