    <node id="Starling">
      <data key="d0">Starling</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The “Starling” in Sterne's Sentimental Journey is a passing object, potentially symbolic or parallel to other themes such as governance.&lt;SEP&gt;The starling is a bird used symbolically in the narrative to represent the desire for freedom and a parallel to the monkeys purchased by Pankraz.</data>
