      <data key="d2">A publication that announced Sterne’s death, helping Lessing determine when Sterne’s works and notices became publicly known.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication that reviewed translations of Sterne’s sermons without referencing Sterne himself.&lt;SEP&gt;A prominent Hamburg periodical cited in the references of the text.</data>
