      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A story involving Sterne’s dog, which Bode relates in his translation preface, highlighting Sterne’s personal life.&lt;SEP&gt;The dog is a creature that shares the social scene, joining in the laughter and amusement.&lt;SEP&gt;Dogs are animals whose teeth have been found with drilled holes, possibly to produce sounds.&lt;SEP&gt;The dog is a large black animal that attended the church service in Landewednack, behaving well and exemplifying decorum typical of Highland shepherds' dogs.</data>
