      <data key="d2">Sebaldus Nothanker is a literary work exemplifying the epoch of reflection and speculation in German fiction.&lt;SEP&gt;A work regarded as Sterne-like for its depiction of the Revelation of St. John as a hobby-horse.&lt;SEP&gt;Sebaldus Nothanker is a fictitious person to whom Wegener's work "Raritäten" is dedicated, symbolizing literary homage.&lt;SEP&gt;A literary figure or work discussed in scholarly literature, as analyzed by Schwinger.&lt;SEP&gt;Sebaldus Nothanker is a person listed among the references, possibly an academic or historical figure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d16d254ebf3b608d2707f3d59145e0ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939e417a7df4f7cc2019f7a0a8f2b15a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3e15f8dcb69742a9caa28ee76e24abe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-559b00cb6dc756396bfc420ba8cc5cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5306de19c5ab05feb0d4d09c44ca2fc1</data>
