      <data key="d2">Rousseau's voice called for recognition of human feelings, influencing German and broader European literary themes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rousseau is a philosopher and writer, mentioned as a friend of Kirchberger.&lt;SEP&gt;Rousseau is a philosopher and writer mentioned alongside other influential authors.&lt;SEP&gt;Rousseau is a notable philosopher and writer associated with the scholarly discussion involving Richardson and Goethe.&lt;SEP&gt;Rousseau is a scholar and philosopher involved in the discussion of literary figures.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean-Jacques Rousseau is a notable philosopher and writer.&lt;SEP&gt;Rousseau was an Enlightenment thinker whose ideas also did not influence Canadian attitudes, according to the text.</data>
