    <node id="Ireland">
      <data key="d0">Ireland</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ireland is possibly the author of "A Picturesque Tour through Holland, Brabant and part of France," based on the context, although not explicitly confirmed.&lt;SEP&gt;Ireland is an author referenced in relation to quotations and discussions of Sterne’s work.&lt;SEP&gt;Ireland is a location referenced with a page number.&lt;SEP&gt;Ireland is the homeland of the fairy-folk, mentioned as the place where the hermit lived when he was young.&lt;SEP&gt;Ireland is the origin of Yezeed's mother, the widow of an Irish sergeant.&lt;SEP&gt;Ireland is the country from which Mrs. Margarett Pen came.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-096d82a8b687771312b327300d1f1171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc64252e1565a88b1d7729211672d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23201d16810e4a370ffadc0b018cb013&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6cf13c2e9f84e3b490bbe727b69df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986db80f0b248cae0ba30adbca747f75</data>
