    <node id="British Museum">
      <data key="d0">British Museum</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The British Museum houses a collection related to Sterne and possibly the German work.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum is referenced as another collection related to musical instruments.&lt;SEP&gt;The institution housing ancient bone-flutes and artifacts from indigenous cultures, including those from Peru.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum houses ancient manuscripts and sculptures depicting historical musical instruments like the harp and _rotta_.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum holds a manuscript with an illustration of the _rotta_ from the tenth century.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum contains a manuscript depicting an Anglo-Saxon fiddle called _fithele_.</data>
