    <node id="Campe">
      <data key="d0">Campe</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Campe is referenced regarding the origin of a word related to Sterne and linguistic contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;Campe was an author and theorist who analyzed the concepts of “Empfindsamkeit” and “Empfindelei,” and proposed distinctions between different sentimental temperaments and their expressions.&lt;SEP&gt;Campe is an author who published a treatise two years prior to the referenced discussion, focusing on sentimentalism and its effects.&lt;SEP&gt;J. H. Campe is a person referenced on pages 43 and 164-166.</data>
