      <data key="d2">Pank is a character entertained at his home, associated with literary and satirical themes, and reads a satirical poem.&lt;SEP&gt;Pank wrote an ode on the death of Riepel, utilizing typographical signs like dashes and exclamation points, linked to Timme’s work in satire.</data>
