      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Riepel is a pet cat suffering neglect and ultimately dying due to human heartlessness, symbolizing themes of misplaced sympathy and cruelty.&lt;SEP&gt;Riepel is a figure commemorated in Pank's ode, associated with poetic memorials.</data>
