    <node id="The Sentimental Journey">
      <data key="d0">The Sentimental Journey</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sentimental Journey is a work by Sterne that significantly impacted German literary reception.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sentimental Journey is a work penned by Sterne, referenced as a model for imitating Sterne's manner.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sentimental Journey is a work that is often alluded to in connection with Sterne and Yorick, used to satirize and critique sentimental expression and influence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sentimental Journey is a work by Laurence Sterne, published in multiple editions with illustrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Yorick’s "Emfindsame Reise" (Sentimental Journey) is a travel narrative through France and Italy written by Sterne.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef7a5904617eb5f54e94c5ea84fd0b1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c7457182fd8c984b4b4d5b338a0a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163ef765f849b1375848fc7b21a3b35c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ecb8725d9b49ee2bda6cf5f19b07499&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96735e9671b9630d75f82998c81d327c</data>
