    <node id="London Magazine">
      <data key="d0">London Magazine</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The London Magazine published notices in 1766 and 1767 concerning a ninth volume of "Tristram Shandy," clarifying authorship issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Published Sterne’s letters, some of which are included in collected editions.</data>
