    <node id="Empfindsame Reise nach Schilda">
      <data key="d0">Empfindsame Reise nach Schilda</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The "Empfindsame Reise nach Schilda" is a humorous, satirical travel narrative with a light-hearted attitude, representing a decline of sentimentalism.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Empfindsame Reise nach Schilda" is a literary work published in Leipzig in 1793, reviewed as a humorous revision of a popular tale, characterized by wit, caricature, and satire against literary celebrities.</data>
