    <node id="Düntzer">
      <data key="d0">Düntzer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Düntzer is a scholar who studied Kaufmann and suggested his effort was to gain prominence.&lt;SEP&gt;Düntzer was a scholar who explained references to Sterne in Goethe’s letters and manuscripts.&lt;SEP&gt;Düntzer edited and published "Herder’s Briefwechsel," documenting communications with Goethe.&lt;SEP&gt;Düntzer was an author who wrote about Goethe and his works, published in Leipzig in 1889.&lt;SEP&gt;Düntzer is an editor of Goethe's Tagebücher, published in Leipzig in 1889.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9e8429a197795773b69fd79fc5921e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-003097ce0b9615e69c58849744d9a337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea440613a1c400f54c6088d2b80f02cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58d87bc060205995efa9baf4bddb1a07</data>
