    <node id="Richter">
      <data key="d0">Richter</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Richter is a publisher responsible for the 1772 edition of Tristram Shandy in Altenburg.&lt;SEP&gt;Richter is a publisher who reprinted Sterne’s "Sentimental Journey" in Germany in 1772, after initial publication delays.&lt;SEP&gt;Richter is associated with publishing Sterne's letters and fragmentary works in Altenburg, 1776.&lt;SEP&gt;Richter is a publisher or editor responsible for early editions of Sterne's works, including in Altenburg and Leipzig.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad7eb91ef19d9479c183ea94881f5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9c0013c86c9a2d0424cec3204472c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ecb8725d9b49ee2bda6cf5f19b07499&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96735e9671b9630d75f82998c81d327c</data>
