      <data key="d0">German literature</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">German literature is the literary landscape where Sterne's works, especially the Sentimental Journey, gained recognition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad7eb91ef19d9479c183ea94881f5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1ebe193334de57430520a945aa53a53</data>
