      <data key="d0">German Patriotism</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">German patriotism is expressed by the author through praise of the old days in Germany and admiration of Gellert.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dbc3db960625e360803e71c625147d14</data>
