    <node id="Winterreise">
      <data key="d0">Winterreise</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The "Winterreise" is a literary imitation influenced by Sterne, associated with Jacobi.&lt;SEP&gt;The Winterreise is a literary work inspired by Sterne, associated with sentimentalism and criticized as a product of Sterne's influence.&lt;SEP&gt;A work by Jacobi which includes “Der Taubenschlag,” discussed in the context of animal rights themes and Sterne's influence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-10af28895017a86626bcf11657f1ec8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef22672b608544a2aa4fb67fb08f6518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e48c21535b598ccc004c7edbc7f2c216</data>
