      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Johann Gottlieb Schummel is a writer and pedagog who authored “Empfindsame Reisen,” imitated Sterne’s sentimental style, and contributed to sentimentalism literature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-10af28895017a86626bcf11657f1ec8e</data>
