      <data key="d0">Schink</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Schink is an author and translator who produced German imitations and translations of Sterne's works, including "Empfindsame Reisen" and related volumes.&lt;SEP&gt;Schink is an author whose work is discussed in relation to literary reviews and influence in Germany.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef22672b608544a2aa4fb67fb08f6518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23201d16810e4a370ffadc0b018cb013</data>
