      <data key="d0">Meusel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Meusel provided an account of the first edition of Zückert's translation, dating it to 1774 and mentioning its registration.&lt;SEP&gt;Meusel is a scholar who also did not include Schink’s work among his references.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef22672b608544a2aa4fb67fb08f6518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77f5d39cb0cceb82bc5a1d37faf560f</data>
