    <node id="Johann Georg Jacobi">
      <data key="d0">Johann Georg Jacobi</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Johann Georg Jacobi was a writer and critic influenced by Sterne, who promoted sentimental values in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Johann Georg Jacobi is a figure associated with the story of Lorenzodosen and Sterne in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Johann Georg Jacobi is a German writer and imitator of Sterne, known for his sentimental and grotesque literary works influenced by Sterne's style.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef22672b608544a2aa4fb67fb08f6518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a99d58be4f096b2bbc3dd443af69754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bba52ca6db0e619b578b5cf52494e654</data>
