      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Lorenzodosen are practical objects inspired by Sterne’s teachings, used to promote virtue and temperance among Germans.&lt;SEP&gt;Lorenzodosen are a type of snuff-box associated with Sterne, discussed extensively in literature and investigations.</data>
