      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Justus Möser was a German historian and critic who condemned superficial imitation among Germans.&lt;SEP&gt;Justus Möser was a critic who condemned the German people's superficial imitation, emphasizing their tendency to imitate without depth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bf5c550c793c251f99502adc3abd77fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3445af39103910094e6f39b4e9d594d0</data>
