    <node id="German Criticism">
      <data key="d0">German Criticism</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">German critics recognized Sterne's influence and discussed the significance of British literature, especially Sterne's, in shaping German literary tastes.&lt;SEP&gt;German criticism of Sterne’s works was generally lenient and often viewed his translated works with less scrutiny, influenced by language and translation quality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bf5c550c793c251f99502adc3abd77fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ccff1ea6ecc4a7b158250715bcedc0a</data>
