      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">“Ueber die Laune” is an article by Gervinus analyzing national differences in literary development.&lt;SEP&gt;An article concerning humor, melancholia, and the influence of Sterne’s works on the development of humor.</data>
