      <data key="d0">William Lyon Mackenzie</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">William Lyon Mackenzie was the leader of the rebellion in Upper Canada, involved in correspondence with Patriotes and planning revolts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86a0a44acd086e0907bf225584c3be7a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
