    <node id="General Wool">
      <data key="d0">General Wool</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">General Wool was a U.S. military officer who disarmed Canadian refugees at the border in 1838 and fought at Queenston Heights in 1812.&lt;SEP&gt;General Wool disarmed Patriote forces on the U.S. border.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45d67b8f87397b56d105fc32a0b1f677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-392528a8e340519b1401fbf1b71aad8c</data>
