    <node id="Hindenlang">
      <data key="d0">Hindenlang</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hindenlang was a French officer who joined Nelson's expedition and later paid with his life, providing an account of the insurrection attempt.&lt;SEP&gt;Hindenlang was a rebel leader and also one of the condemned to death after the rebellion.&lt;SEP&gt;Hindenlang was a French officer condemned to death and executed during the rebellion.&lt;SEP&gt;Hindenlang led the Patriotes during the second rebellion and was executed.</data>
