    <node id="Napierville">
      <data key="d0">Napierville</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Napierville was a town in Lower Canada designated as the rebel headquarters during the insurrection attempt.&lt;SEP&gt;Napierville is a town where rebels retreated to after defeat and where Colborne entered following his advance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45d67b8f87397b56d105fc32a0b1f677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74232d6a8ea1ca9bbf02c4e6c8ef3d90</data>
