      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lacolle was a site of conflict where loyalist militia resisted the rebel forces in November 1838.&lt;SEP&gt;Lacolle is a strategic site where the rebels were defeated, leading to the loss of a six-pounder gun and other military supplies.&lt;SEP&gt;Lacolle was a site of a military defeat for rebels.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45d67b8f87397b56d105fc32a0b1f677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74232d6a8ea1ca9bbf02c4e6c8ef3d90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52a624a7e98a490d86c7ae612749e5d</data>
