    <node id="Rebellion of 1837">
      <data key="d0">Rebellion of 1837</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Rebellion of 1837 was an armed uprising against British authority in Canada, led by Patriotes advocating for independence.&lt;SEP&gt;The rebellion was an uprising in Lower and Upper Canada, significant for its impact on Canadian history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rebellion of 1837 was a significant uprising in Canada involving various factions, later viewed historically as a past event.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rebellion of 1837 was a major uprising involving French Canadians.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3e6059f7b6685e9fbba6db55d93c65ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe367bc72a82be3c2cacfc81ba72e719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52a624a7e98a490d86c7ae612749e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5baf8115ec01000bf9bea26709c3f099</data>
