    </node>
    <node id="Bureaucrats">
      <data key="d0">Bureaucrats</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bureaucrats, also known as the Chateau Clique, was a local oligarchy of mainly English-born officials holding the reins of government in Lower Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;Bureaucrats surrounded Governor Craig and possibly wished to incite disturbances to suspend the constitution of Lower Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;Bureaucrats refer to government officials involved in the political and constitutional disputes described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Bureaucrats were officials during the time of the rebellion, contrasted with the Patriotes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bureaucrats refer to government officials, notably the 'Chateau Clique.'</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3e6059f7b6685e9fbba6db55d93c65ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba0f247b33f556371c343cbd158638c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa1b94cc88676d252f09238e9d2fcd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b195a27b43ec85da2d0175fa01cef0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c71f776a39a2f6e419cd9e7dc482a99e</data>
