    <node id="Abbe Paquin">
      <data key="d0">Abbe Paquin</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Abbe Paquin was a priest who encouraged resistance against the rebellion and helped prevent its escalation.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbe Paquin was the parish priest of Saint Eustache, urging insurgents to return home and attempting to mediate.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbe Paquin opposed the rebels at St Eustache.</data>
