    <node id="Chenier">
      <data key="d0">Chenier</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Chenier was a Canadian rebel who was shot during the conflict and attempted to flee through the church's chapel window.&lt;SEP&gt;Chenier was an insurgent leader, determined to continue revolutionary actions, refusing to believe rebels had been dispersed.&lt;SEP&gt;Chenier was a rebel leader, involved in the conflict, and eventually shot during the fighting.&lt;SEP&gt;Chenier was a young physician supporting the Patriotes, who demonstrated courage and was honored with a monument in Montreal.&lt;SEP&gt;Chenier is referenced as a source or narrator providing geographic information about the river and ports.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6e90edbdd9d437566164aceb39d9b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5baf8115ec01000bf9bea26709c3f099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-349529243dbc83f8fcf9f0443bec18f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-284546e32da930f297907ef0f48339cc</data>
