    <node id="Girod">
      <data key="d0">Girod</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Girod was a rebel leader who fled the conflict, announced victory at a tavern, and ultimately took his own life by shooting himself.&lt;SEP&gt;Girod was the rebel general whose behavior was notably reprehensible; he fled the conflict and committed suicide.&lt;SEP&gt;Girod was the rebel leader who gathered about a thousand men and led the movement against the authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Girod was an insurgent figure, gathering nearly a thousand men during the rebellion.&lt;SEP&gt;Girod, an adventurer and revolutionary, led insurgent activities in St Eustache and surrounding area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6e90edbdd9d437566164aceb39d9b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5baf8115ec01000bf9bea26709c3f099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-349529243dbc83f8fcf9f0443bec18f2</data>
