      <data key="d0">Imperial government</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Imperial government was responsible for overseeing colonial administration and had control over the expenditure and revenue of Lower Canada.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba0f247b33f556371c343cbd158638c2</data>
