      <data key="d2">The village is a location where an engagement took place, fortified with a stockade and surrounded by a large brick house.&lt;SEP&gt;The village is a small community where social, religious, and leisure activities take place, characterized by a mixture of social classes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0099aaf0d6a5d5b602247be491e3fb1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c0ed9d02f18daa7a67250c12b9fff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5836d0924804112ead175776cdcd9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9947d8e5a23dab49c88d36cae1db57a3</data>
