      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Canadians are the inhabitants of Canada, with some remaining in Quebec who speak only French and possess Scottish names.&lt;SEP&gt;Canadians are the people who are involved in the political and national dynamics, including debates about French identity.</data>
