    <node id="French Revolution">
      <data key="d0">French Revolution</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The French Revolution of 1789 created political and ideological rifts, reducing France's influence and creating a loyalty gap with Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;The revolution profoundly impacted French Canadians' attitude toward France, creating a wider cultural and political gap.&lt;SEP&gt;The French Revolution influenced French-Canadian nationalism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-353f63fa013a00ee4a62ffebc8c022a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b195a27b43ec85da2d0175fa01cef0d</data>
