      <data key="d0">Trafalgar</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Trafalgar was a naval engagement where the French fleet was defeated, celebrated with a Te Deum in Quebec.&lt;SEP&gt;The battle of Trafalgar was a naval engagement that established British naval dominance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-353f63fa013a00ee4a62ffebc8c022a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba</data>
