      <data key="d2">A future bishop of the French-Canadian Church who preached the principle that events widening the gap with France should be welcomed.&lt;SEP&gt;The bishop is a high-ranking religious figure with a strong face, white hair, and interests in various topics, who oversees the study and interacts with the young man.&lt;SEP&gt;The bishop is a religious figure who shows pride in Latimer's speech and exhibits concern for Ellen's well-being.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-353f63fa013a00ee4a62ffebc8c022a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bcccdd0ccbcdeb5c91ef74533cc96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a566af9d3314e78f0ef8c8d4b57ce00</data>
