    <node id="Queen Victoria">
      <data key="d0">Queen Victoria</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Queen Victoria was the monarch during the period of the Canadian rebellion, governing the British Empire.&lt;SEP&gt;Queen Victoria was represented in the procession with devices, symbolizing her role in the Atlantic cable celebration.&lt;SEP&gt;Queen Victoria communicated with President Buchanan via telegraph, marking a historic event.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb71f32b0ab08e17e4d6cb83be9c380c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13efecfdb402b12d9a005785fb5d0e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26c30cc3102d9679f3880d6b7c95b61</data>
