    <node id="Melbourne">
      <data key="d0">Melbourne</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Melbourne was the location of the British government during the debate on Canadian affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Melbourne government was the governing authority that suspended the Lower Canada constitution and appointed Durham.&lt;SEP&gt;The Melbourne administration was the British government that sent Durham to Canada and later disallowed his ordinance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb71f32b0ab08e17e4d6cb83be9c380c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d3c806038738c5cf824708ed3cfff5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0359fb0e1dc5215c33545ffddcd78876</data>
