    <node id="Taxation">
      <data key="d0">Taxation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Taxation in Lower Canada included land taxes by the English and customs duties by the French, reflecting economic interests.&lt;SEP&gt;Taxation pertains to the system of levying taxes, which is a central issue in the conflict described.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b195a27b43ec85da2d0175fa01cef0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39e2cfb1e3f641af2dc7d617761e850</data>
