      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Daniel O'Connell was an Irish political leader who supported French Canadians and opposed Anglo-Saxon tyranny and bigotry.&lt;SEP&gt;Daniel O'Connell championed the Patriote cause.</data>
