      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jean Antoine Panet was a French-Canadian member of the assembly who was proposed as speaker, supporting the use of French.&lt;SEP&gt;Jean Antoine Panet was elected speaker of the Assembly and imprisoned.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d52a624a7e98a490d86c7ae612749e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41f4557b5a58dc496c18ce0c8f8f2c88</data>
