      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Louis Panet, brother of Jean Antoine, was involved in the debate over the language of the speaker and was a prominent French-Canadian member.&lt;SEP&gt;Louis Panet was involved in the language question.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d52a624a7e98a490d86c7ae612749e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41f4557b5a58dc496c18ce0c8f8f2c88</data>
