      <data key="d0">Lieutenant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lieutenant is a military rank held by officers involved in suppressing rebellions.&lt;SEP&gt;A military officer rank held by the individual after returning from service, indicating a promotion from private.</data>
