      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A.D. Martin, also known as Johnny Martin, was a notable member of Pioneer Hook and Ladder Company, known for his stature and role as foreman.&lt;SEP&gt;A.D. Martin was a territorial printer of Minnesota.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd4d3267de3b8b12b0a038535bf2353c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184afd23de097cea7ecadc6dfb1a7139</data>
