    <node id="First Minnesota Battery">
      <data key="d0">First Minnesota Battery</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The First Minnesota battery was a light artillery unit organized at Fort Snelling in 1861.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Minnesota battery is a light artillery unit organized at Fort Snelling in 1861, involved in the Battle of Pittsburg Landing, known for its heroic conduct and significant casualties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c</data>
