    </node>
    <node id="Grant">
      <data key="d0">Grant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Grant was a Union general whose army in the West was unable to make significant progress toward the Confederacy.&lt;SEP&gt;General Grant was a Union officer repeatedly targeted for charges, later exonerated, and regarded as successful for his campaigns.&lt;SEP&gt;General Grant commanded the Army of the Tennessee during the American Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Grant's army was a Union force involved in the Battle of Pittsburg Landing, with the battery transferred into Prentiss' division.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764609955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Prentiss">
      <data key="d0">Prentiss</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">General Prentiss commanded a division of Grant's army and was involved in the battle where the battery fought.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764609955</data>
