    </node>
    <node id="Pittsburg Landing">
      <data key="d0">Pittsburg Landing</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A major and deadly Civil War battle fought on April 6-7, 1862, compared to Waterloo, with fierce combat and significant casualties.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing was a key battle location involving the First Minnesota battery.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing was the site of the battle where the First Minnesota battery participated, with intense fighting occurring there.&lt;SEP&gt;Captain Acker's remains were found and he was buried at Pittsburg Landing after his death in battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-259cd15d2a822dcb52e2f16a8974a319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211</data>
