      <data key="d0">Gen. Buell</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Buell was a Union general whose delayed junction with Grant resulted in significant loss of life.&lt;SEP&gt;General Buell arrived on April 7 and held the battery in reserve during that day's part of the battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6</data>
