      <data key="d2">Union forces refer to the combined army units fighting for the Union, including the Second Minnesota.&lt;SEP&gt;Union forces were the troops defending their position during the battle, experiencing severe losses and retreating at times.&lt;SEP&gt;Union military forces engaged in the Battle of Pittsburg Landing defending against Confederate attack.</data>
