      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fort Donelson was a strategic military position involved in Civil War battles, notably attacked by rebels and defended by Union forces.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Donelson in Tennessee was a site of attack and surrender involving Brackett's battalion in the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Donelson was another strategic victory for Grant, contributing to his rise.</data>
