    <node id="Minnesota">
      <data key="d0">Minnesota</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Minnesota is a U.S. state that played a significant role during the Civil War era, contributing many men to the Union's efforts. It called upon approximately 600,000 men to furnish regiments for the conflict and contributed notably through units such as the Second Minnesota regiment. The state was actively involved in military and political activities, including holding an election in 1857 for delegates to a constitutional convention and experiencing early disputes related to printing and publication. 

Historically, Minnesota experienced considerable upheaval, including significant Indian warfare involving the Sioux and other tribes, which led to land forfeitures and reparations to the government. The state also witnessed social unrest, such as draft disturbances and opposition to the removal of military troops following battles. Its frontier environment fostered early newspaper operations; notably, Capt. Shelly was among the first to establish a permanent printing presence in Minnesota. Additionally, the territorial legislature was convened in an old hotel building, highlighting the nascent governance structure in the region. The state's history includes events such as staged fights and political incidents, reflecting a dynamic and often tumultuous history during its early years of statehood.&lt;SEP&gt;Minnesota is a U.S. state with nearly 100% increase in farms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20726b17616075ddbd2a847a83ea89f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76d1f3d2ebc06daa6cb0430b984dadc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184afd23de097cea7ecadc6dfb1a7139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b75c5f4f7c0385a783e34fd555b4a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40ca577fc1aab8ffff670ab327655dda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a4789d4f1f7c874d43ac8b35b4ece9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7096033ca5d17f317a3de07c28f9b0bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-253bf03f6503d8e5da2098445ef9b630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6bd508a28ba32dd03863b08ac91bfa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71098a84f862320370cd4b30b1083858</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
