    <node id="Union Forces">
      <data key="d0">Union Forces</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union Forces were the Northern armies fighting against the Confederates, engaged in various battles and campaigns during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Union forces under Generals Grant, Buell, Nelson, and Wallace fought to repel rebelling Confederate forces.&lt;SEP&gt;Union forces, numbering around 33,000 to 38,000, participated in the battle at Shiloh.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b249095455416ac52a060862c213f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c</data>
