    <node id="Confederate Forces">
      <data key="d0">Confederate Forces</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Confederate Forces were the military resources of the Confederacy during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;The Confederate Forces, led by officers like Forest and Wheeler, opposed Union operations and engaged in battles during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Confederate forces, commanded by General Albert Sidney Johnston, fought against Union troops and suffered losses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b249095455416ac52a060862c213f2</data>
