    <node id="Forest">
      <data key="d0">Forest</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Forest was a Confederate cavalry officer involved in battles and raids during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;The forest is an extensive natural area characterized by dense trees, silenced by age and disuse.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is the natural habitat where the mice and other animals live, providing space for their range and activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The forest is the setting where Bruin, Toto, and the wood-pigeon interact and where the story unfolds, emphasizing a natural outdoor environment.&lt;SEP&gt;A deep forest the princess enters after leaving the city, known for being inhabited by robbers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is the place where Eily claims to have gone to gather sticks and encountered the Grane Man.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05f87866de9e32066808684c09b0e143&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-506f129a6a5da52f9bd4973893d49e50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8ae0075c4582a8dd2392029c8ddfae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a</data>
