      <data key="d2">Pittsburgh was the place where the Sons of Malta lodge was chartered in 1858.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburgh was a strategic location where General Buell's forces arrived to reinforce Union positions and support the campaign.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburgh was a place the regiment passed through during transit.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburgh is a city that serves as a principal point on the river navigation routes between Louisville and New Orleans.</data>
