      <data key="d2">O.G. Miller is listed among territorial printers, with no additional details provided.&lt;SEP&gt;O.G. Miller was a territorial printer of Minnesota.&lt;SEP&gt;O.G. Miller was a well-known printer in St. Paul, associated with the Great Western band and church singing, and was a 33rd Degree Mason.</data>
