    <node id="Wabasha Street">
      <data key="d0">Wabasha Street</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Street in St. Paul named after Wabasha.&lt;SEP&gt;Wabasha Street is where the Mansion House was situated.&lt;SEP&gt;Wabasha Street is notable for the construction of the opera house and the location of the old theater.&lt;SEP&gt;Wabasha street is a location in St. Paul where the old opera house fronted and was eventually replaced by the Grand Block.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184afd23de097cea7ecadc6dfb1a7139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e857eaec34481e1ebe2d9949bee6999e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7096033ca5d17f317a3de07c28f9b0bc</data>
