    </node>
    <node id="Athenaeum">
      <data key="d0">Athenaeum</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Athenaeum was a venue where the Linden theatrical company was performing at the time of the fire.&lt;SEP&gt;The Athenaeum is a venue where the Linden theatrical company was playing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Athenaeum, constructed in 1859 by the German Reading Society, was an amusement hall in St. Paul featuring a stage and drop curtain.&lt;SEP&gt;The Athenaeum was a venue in Minnesota where a staged boxing match was arranged to imitate the Heenan-Sayers fight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184afd23de097cea7ecadc6dfb1a7139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3b2fb8cc8d028b5cd15ca31eb42884f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbf9f440f0bef7a0809b533af91c73a</data>
