      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Territorial refers to the Minnesota territory before it achieved statehood, marked by early printing and political figures.&lt;SEP&gt;Territorial refers to the period in Minnesota history before statehood, during which many printers and events took place.</data>
