    <node id="Pioneer Guards">
      <data key="d0">Pioneer Guards</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Pioneer Guards was the crack military company of Minnesota called out by the governor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Guards is the oldest military company in the state, equipped with Minie rifles and bayonets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Guards is a local militia or military organization that participated in civic and military events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Guards was a military organization that disbanded after the outbreak of the Civil War.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46289654522dd0ee1ffdeb77be06722d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26c30cc3102d9679f3880d6b7c95b61</data>
