    <node id="City Guards">
      <data key="d0">City Guards</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The City Guards was a military organization led by Capt. John O'Gorman that participated in the parade.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Guards was a local militia involved in maintaining order and participating in civic processions.&lt;SEP&gt;The City Guards formed part of the elaborate processions on Washington's Birthday in early times.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51a7160323c912396ad629e58d01cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26c30cc3102d9679f3880d6b7c95b61</data>
