    <node id="St. Paul Fire Department">
      <data key="d0">St. Paul Fire Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The St. Paul Fire Department had several chiefs over the years, including Wash M. Stees and Chas. H. Williams.&lt;SEP&gt;The St. Paul Fire Department is responsible for firefighting services and participated in civic events.&lt;SEP&gt;Participated in the Washington's birthday celebrations with processions and exercises.</data>
