    <node id="A.M. Carver">
      <data key="d0">A.M. Carver</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A.M. Carver was a foreman at the St. Paul Times, a talented actor, and served as a first president of the International Typographical Union.&lt;SEP&gt;A.M. Carver is listed among territorial printers, with no additional details provided.&lt;SEP&gt;A.M. Carver was one of the best job printers and amateur actors, known for his work in the printing fraternity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f51a7160323c912396ad629e58d01cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a4789d4f1f7c874d43ac8b35b4ece9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be8b49c919bf06f613da48187833e98b</data>
