      <data key="d0">Masonic Hall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Masonic Hall was on the Fourth street corner, part of the buildings erected by Charles N. Mackubin.&lt;SEP&gt;The body of Captain Acker rested at Masonic Hall in St. Paul before the funeral.</data>
