    <node id="Col. Marshall">
      <data key="d0">Col. Marshall</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Col. Marshall led a successful charge against Sioux warriors at the Battle of Wood Lake.&lt;SEP&gt;Col. Marshall commanded the force that routed Sioux warriors at Wood Lake.&lt;SEP&gt;Col. Marshall was a participant in a patriotic fair, representing the Seventh Regiment and winning a sword.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f51a7160323c912396ad629e58d01cca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1</data>
