    <node id="Douglas">
      <data key="d0">Douglas</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Douglas was a political figure supported by Little Giants and opposed by Marshall, with aspirations for presidential office.&lt;SEP&gt;Douglas is a person speculated to have a potential future role as president, characterized by his peculiar physique and political involvement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6bd508a28ba32dd03863b08ac91bfa9</data>
