    <node id="Democratic Party">
      <data key="d0">Democratic Party</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Democratic Party was a major political party involved in the 1860 election, with references to the Douglas wing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Democratic Party is a major political party in the United States, opposed to Republican ideologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6bd508a28ba32dd03863b08ac91bfa9</data>
