    <node id="Republicans">
      <data key="d0">Republicans</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Republicans made efforts to elect their candidates for governor and U.S. senator in Minnesota in 1859.&lt;SEP&gt;The Republican Party was the political group associated with Abraham Lincoln’s election victory and election night activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Republicans are a major political party in the United States, representing conservative and right-leaning policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6bd508a28ba32dd03863b08ac91bfa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46289654522dd0ee1ffdeb77be06722d</data>
