      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The German Reading Society built the Athenaeum in 1859 and contributed to cultural activities in St. Paul.&lt;SEP&gt;The German Reading Society was responsible for constructing the Athenaeum in 1859.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-436f34d0d58d1895c9ded9174e61873b</data>
