      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Blakeley was involved in performances at the Athenaeum during the Civil War era.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Blakeley appeared in performances at the Athenaeum during the Civil War period.</data>
