    <node id="Bechtner &amp; Kottman">
      <data key="d0">Bechtner &amp; Kottman</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Bechtner &amp; Kottman remodeled the former bank into the Cosmopolitan Hotel at about $20,000.&lt;SEP&gt;Bechtner &amp; Kottman leased the building after the bank moved out and remodeled it into a hotel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a3b2fb8cc8d028b5cd15ca31eb42884f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbf9f440f0bef7a0809b533af91c73a</data>
