      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">C.W. Borup constructed the Sintominie hotel, which was one of the early hotels in St. Paul that suffered from fire.&lt;SEP&gt;C.W. Borup was the builder of the Sintominie Hotel, known for its pride in lower town.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fbf9f440f0bef7a0809b533af91c73a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e857eaec34481e1ebe2d9949bee6999e</data>
