      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A.L. Larpenteur was the father of Rosa Larpenteur, the first child born of white parents in St. Paul.&lt;SEP&gt;A.L. Larpenteur owned and occupied a four-story brick building on Third street after the fire.</data>
