      <data key="d2">An area in the city where several fire companies' members gathered and participated in active fire-fighting organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Seven Corners is a location near which Daniel's House hotel was situated.&lt;SEP&gt;Seven Corners is the location of the Winslow House, which was destroyed by fire in 1862.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5fbf9f440f0bef7a0809b533af91c73a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e857eaec34481e1ebe2d9949bee6999e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd305fbce6d35b0ef2d81f49f11311ba</data>
