      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Captain Acker was a brave, able, popular, and courteous soldier who sacrificed his life in the cause of freedom during the rebellion; born in New York State in 1833, served as a soldier in multiple battles, and was highly esteemed by the citizens of St. Paul.</data>
