      <data key="d2">The fire departments and various hotels and individuals contributed to early firefighting efforts, including the disbanded Hope Engine Company and newly organized St. Paul Hose Company No. 1.&lt;SEP&gt;The bank is linked with the scandal involving Trixit, securities, and financial instability.&lt;SEP&gt;The bank is the place where the Dean's bank-notes are intended to be sent for deposit.</data>
