    <node id="Police">
      <data key="d0">Police</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Law enforcement tasked with maintaining order during fires and involved in mobilizing relief forces.&lt;SEP&gt;The police are responsible for investigating crimes such as the Burrbank murder and arresting suspects across the country.&lt;SEP&gt;The police are mentioned in connection with Gallegher's knowledge of criminal aliases and his assistance in fire and crime cases.&lt;SEP&gt;The police are mentioned as the authority figures persons who are involved in the situation, asked to stop Gallegher.&lt;SEP&gt;The police are law enforcement officers who pursue young Raegen and are involved in the river rescue.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement agency mentioned as a potential authority to intervene.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dd305fbce6d35b0ef2d81f49f11311ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4861f1f36dbc583ebdad31a4a80a0aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9adeb7b96786740ff28d105d890a682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9701c89d5a5f839dbe13d1fa16e90400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338c0bd1be2adb8d03c1f197c7477a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc7c601f1a721e64645ccdb5e20b488f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdb1784d5abfa2c6e504b83145f474b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a504f361c734f54d3814cb24dcdf2588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dc1b3bed5fc2f671459f1471fbaec93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a2a2485bcb7c681b0e3c67f960ece4</data>
