    <node id="Bailie Peyton">
      <data key="d0">Bailie Peyton</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bailie Peyton was a rebel officer, son of a prominent Union supporter, who was killed in the battle after shooting Lieut. Stout.&lt;SEP&gt;Bailie Peyton was involved in the battle, shot by the rebel lieutenant and later associated with the sword and his loyalty.&lt;SEP&gt;Bailie Peyton was a soldier in the Mexican War and later a Union officer involved in the Civil War battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
