      <data key="d0">Gen. Zollicoffer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Zollicoffer was the Confederate general who was killed during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Zollicoffer was the Confederate commander killed during this battle.&lt;SEP&gt;A prominent citizen of Nashville before the war who supported secession and was killed in battle, known for his speech to his troops.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17</data>
