      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Col. Fry was an officer who shot Zollicoffer during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;Col. Fry shot Zollicoffer during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;A colonel who interacts with a stranger and is shot in the breast during a conflict scene involving recognition and confrontation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17</data>
