    <node id="Gen. Scott">
      <data key="d0">Gen. Scott</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Scott was the American general defending Mexico City during the Mexican War.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Scott was a commanding officer associated with the Mexican War, related to Bailie Peyton.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Scott predicted the war would end soon after the Battle of Pittsburg Landing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a4789d4f1f7c874d43ac8b35b4ece9b</data>
