    <node id="Tennessee">
      <data key="d0">Tennessee</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tennessee is the state where Bailie Peyton was from and where some of the events, including the conflict, took place.&lt;SEP&gt;Tennessee yields variegated marble varieties near Knoxville.&lt;SEP&gt;Tennessee is a U.S. state with a 40% increase in farms, from 118,141 to 165,650.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71098a84f862320370cd4b30b1083858</data>
