      <data key="d0">Sword</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The sword carried by Bailie Peyton, with historic significance, was presented to him during the Mexican War.&lt;SEP&gt;The sword symbolizes violence or threat but is explicitly denied as part of the speaker’s actions, indicating peaceful intent.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25d808efd0dbadcf025072656cfeb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-540d8a1b5f98027bff4df2b8e31b99b0</data>
