    </node>
    <node id="Battle of Pittsburg Landing">
      <data key="d0">Battle of Pittsburg Landing</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Pittsburg Landing, also called the Battle of Shiloh, was a significant Civil War engagement involving intense fighting over a semi-circular battlefield near Pittsburg, Tennessee.&lt;SEP&gt;A battle in the Civil War where Gen. Grant's forces fought; it was claimed that Buell could have made a junction with Grant earlier to avoid heavy losses.&lt;SEP&gt;A major Civil War battle often misunderstood and misrepresented, involving controversies about Grant's leadership.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764610005</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
