      <data key="d0">Crump's Landing</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Crump's Landing is a point north of Pittsburg Landing, forming part of the battlefield outline.&lt;SEP&gt;Crump's Landing is a strategic river crossing point used by Union troops during the battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b249095455416ac52a060862c213f2</data>
