      <data key="d0">Society of soldiers</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The soldiers' collective fighting effort represented a fierce contest for victory or death, characterized by relentless artillery and musketry fire.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764610007</data>
