    <node id="George W. Benedict">
      <data key="d0">George W. Benedict</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">George W. Benedict is one of the known survivors among the territorial printers.&lt;SEP&gt;George W. Benedict is listed as a survivor among territorial printers.&lt;SEP&gt;George W. Benedict was a familiar old-time printer and current editor/publisher of the Sauk Rapids Sentinel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a4789d4f1f7c874d43ac8b35b4ece9b</data>
