    <node id="Wentworth">
      <data key="d0">Wentworth</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wentworth was a poet printer known as "Long Haired Wentworth," who enlisted in the First Minnesota and was dismissed for refusal to cut his hair.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42</data>
