      <data key="d0">Andrew Jackson Morgan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Andrew Jackson Morgan was brought to St. Paul by Col. Gorman, involved in printing and military service.&lt;SEP&gt;Andrew Jackson Morgan was a printer-politician brought to St. Paul and served as foreman of the Democrat newspaper, bearing a resemblance to Stephen A. Douglas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be8b49c919bf06f613da48187833e98b</data>
