    <node id="Wellington">
      <data key="d0">Wellington</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wellington's army was targeted by Napoleon in an effort to prevent a junction with Blucher during the Battle of Waterloo.&lt;SEP&gt;Wellington is mentioned in a humorous context as a historical figure referenced in a conversation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2</data>
