      <data key="d0">Beauregard</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Beauregard undertook efforts to annihilate the Army of the Tennessee under Grant.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Beauregard commanded the Confederate forces during the battle.</data>
