    <node id="Army of the Tennessee">
      <data key="d0">Army of the Tennessee</data>
      <data key="d1">army</data>
      <data key="d2">A Union army under Gen. Grant, targeted by Confederate forces at Pittsburg Landing in an attempt to destroy it.&lt;SEP&gt;The Army of the Tennessee was led by Grant and targeted for destruction by Johnston and Beauregard.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17</data>
