      <data key="d1">army</data>
      <data key="d2">A Union army under Buell, expected to reinforce at Pittsburg Landing during the battle described.&lt;SEP&gt;The Army of the Cumberland was commanded by Buell and aimed to assist Grant during the Civil War.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17</data>
