      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Fort Henry in Tennessee was a strategic location where Brackett's regiment was ordered for duty during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Henry was a strategic stronghold won by Grant's forces, boosting his popularity.</data>
