    <node id="Memphis">
      <data key="d0">Memphis</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Memphis was the headquarters of Grant's command after he was made commander of the Department of West Tennessee.&lt;SEP&gt;Memphis was an ancient city in Egypt, significant in mythology and historical geography.&lt;SEP&gt;Memphis is the city where the papers and money are to be delivered, as per John Lasco’s instructions.</data>
