    <node id="Press">
      <data key="d0">Press</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Press was a newspaper that had the exclusive field for news on July 4, 1863, and was preparing to issue an extra with detailed news.&lt;SEP&gt;The Press was a printing office that moved from Bridge Square to a new building at Third and Minnesota streets in 1869.&lt;SEP&gt;The Press is a news organization involved in receiving and dispatching news messages regarding Hade and the arrest.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Press_ is a newspaper organization involved in gathering and publishing news stories, with a managing editor overseeing operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49b770a2f437d2a1478f52b0f2747ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cf348102921436615f31eec7112c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d51ac622249ad27525a789a8bfb0f6cf</data>
