    <node id="Louisville">
      <data key="d0">Louisville</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Louisville was where the regiment was initially sent en route to Washington.&lt;SEP&gt;Louisville is a city in Kentucky that served as a principal point on the river navigation routes and where a woman went missing.&lt;SEP&gt;Louisville is a city where the Enterprise steamboat arrived in May 1816, marking a historical event.&lt;SEP&gt;Louisville is the city near the explosion site of the steamboat Red Stone.&lt;SEP&gt;Louisville is the city where Roxie and Daymon married and initially resided before moving to Chicago.&lt;SEP&gt;Louisville is a city from which Roxie Daymon left, and associated with her family history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-074a1e4bc4fa465f80f20624b8ddeb17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de2fcc61f99e91491ef81fa40580ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9445e78fa0e5990fbfc82fd7af0897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01da3252de63d3437b7317d570944a2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c</data>
