    <node id="Old Press Building">
      <data key="d0">Old Press Building</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Press building overlooking Bridge Square was a site where the narrator slept and where guns and ammunition were stored.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764610018</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Newspapers">
      <data key="d0">Newspapers</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The newspapers issued irregularly on holidays and following major events such as Christmas, New Year's, Washington's birthday, Fourth of July, and Thanksgiving.&lt;SEP&gt;The newspapers are news sources, with one publishing a report confirming the murder of Pike McGonegal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61dde207aadfc85a27cb8a00cafa88c1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764612528</data>
