    <node id="Third Regiment">
      <data key="d0">Third Regiment</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Third regiment was part of the U.S. Army mobilized during the Sioux uprising, recently paroled.&lt;SEP&gt;The Third regiment participated in the Sioux campaign, engaged in the Battle of Wood Lake.</data>
