      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The other president whose messages were transmitted through the telegraph.&lt;SEP&gt;President Buchanan was involved in the telegraphic communication with Queen Victoria, symbolizing the Atlantic cable's completion.&lt;SEP&gt;President Buchanan was represented in the procession, signifying his involvement in the telegraphic communication.</data>
