    <node id="Corinth">
      <data key="d0">Corinth</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Corinth was the strategic objective and battleground location where Union and Confederate forces clashed.&lt;SEP&gt;Corinth is a city that the rebel forces were heading toward after retreating from the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;Corinth was a Greek city where the first Lais was taken after being carried captive from Sicily, and where she gained fame for her beauty and high prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Corinth is a strategic location where Confederate troops fought heroically and engaged in street battles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-02b249095455416ac52a060862c213f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18197681a28270c1f146277731c3f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ec4f8e1bbc32532d2dfcca778eb43e1</data>
