      <data key="d0">Other Day</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Other Day refers to an event or location associated with the Sioux outbreak.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Day was an educated Native American who helped guide people to safety during the conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Day was an educated Indian who experienced a change of heart about four years before the outbreak and adopted civilized habits, expressing religious beliefs and gratitude for escape from evil.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129</data>
