      <data key="d2">The Mississippi River flows unmolested toward the ocean, vital to the city’s landscape and transportation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mississippi is a U.S. state with under 50% increase in farms, from 68,023 to 101,772.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mississippi River is a major North American river, described here as turbulent with high water levels and driftwood.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mississippi River is the setting of significant early life scenes and the narrator’s journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Mississippi is a state that Phelps defied, indicating a broader legal or governmental jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mississippi River is the waterway on which the steamer travels.</data>
