      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Roman literature encompasses ancient Roman writings, including poetry, law, and philosophical texts, as exemplified by the detailed footnotes and references in the provided text.&lt;SEP&gt;Roman literature encompasses various texts and authors from ancient Rome, including poetry, history, and philosophical writings, with references to poets like Homer, Callimachus, and Ennius.</data>
