    <node id="Augustus">
      <data key="d0">Augustus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Augustus was the first Roman emperor, associated historically with Cæsar and mythologically connected to Venus.&lt;SEP&gt;Augustus was the first Roman emperor, who commissioned the placement of the painting of Venus in the temple of Julius Caesar.&lt;SEP&gt;Augustus was a Roman leader responsible for building statues and structures, including a spot adjoining his palace.&lt;SEP&gt;Augustus was a Roman emperor who built the Forum Augustum, adorned with a temple of Mars.</data>
