    <node id="Thetis">
      <data key="d0">Thetis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Thetis is a sea goddess in mythology, known for giving birth to Achilles and associated with the waves.&lt;SEP&gt;Thetis is a mythological sea nymph, mother of Achilles, associated with divine influence over the seas and divine maternal roles.&lt;SEP&gt;Thetis, the sea goddess, was married to Peleus, the king of Phthia, as referenced in mythological context.&lt;SEP&gt;Thetis is a sea goddess who is famously married to Peleus in Greek mythology, suggesting her divine origin and association with the sea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e093e5565d1be13cdd6a32df8d728ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f54377361394a10337ee324609f05a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714b6c3790dfcbb71e477248f2e13f46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9ab58d75e0d33f2fb45c933ce510e99</data>
