      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Peleus, king of Phthia, and husband of Thetis, is associated with mythological narratives.&lt;SEP&gt;Peleus is a king of Phthia and the husband of Thetis, central to the mythological marriage story.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5e093e5565d1be13cdd6a32df8d728ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9ab58d75e0d33f2fb45c933ce510e99</data>
