    <node id="Lucifer">
      <data key="d0">Lucifer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lucifer is depicted as moving wheels beset with rime, symbolizing a mythological or allegorical figure associated with movement or celestial phenomenon.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucifer is depicted as a brilliant being in the lofty skies, associated with speed and bringing about the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucifer is described as the most brilliant star in the sky, symbolizing hope or guidance for a safe voyage.</data>
