    <node id="Atreus">
      <data key="d0">Atreus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The son of Atreus, a Greek king, who was smitten with a prophetess, representing mortality and fate.&lt;SEP&gt;Atreus is a mythological figure associated with renown derived from a war lasting ten years, symbolizing heroism and victory.&lt;SEP&gt;Atreus is referenced in the context of a hellish banquet, mythological king of Mycenae.&lt;SEP&gt;Atreus is mentioned in relation to a myth involving a revenge banquet.</data>
