    <node id="Jurisconsultus">
      <data key="d0">Jurisconsultus</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The jurisconsultus was a legal expert responsible for explaining and giving opinions on the law, similar to modern chamber counsel, also known as 'juris periti' or 'consulti', practicing law and advising clients.</data>
