      <data key="d0">Verbum Spondeo</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The verb 'spondeo' means 'to become bail' or 'security', used as a formula to undertake security obligations orally in the presence of a 'jurisconsultus'.</data>
