    <node id="Diana">
      <data key="d0">Diana</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Diana is a goddess associated with the hunt and moon, mentioned as a contrast to Venus in gift-giving.&lt;SEP&gt;Diana is a mythological goddess depicted as swift and bold, pursuing prey and associated with her ankles being painted as swift.&lt;SEP&gt;Diana is a Roman goddess associated with the moon, hunting, and chastity, depicted in statues with a method of wearing a quiver.&lt;SEP&gt;Diana is a goddess who sent sleep upon Endymion, according to mythology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6cab761408cb58a952d84a4e27dce81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a40ad400e6c46c8451bc02d5c90eeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ae32cc554dc390c60bd5c873778659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1c921bbb2e03c67dfc84088fb4c60fd</data>
