    <node id="Tithonus">
      <data key="d0">Tithonus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tithonus is an aged husband associated with the dawn goddess Aurora, linked to the passage of time and long life.&lt;SEP&gt;Tithonus is a mythological figure associated with the fairy-tale theme of eternal aging or enchantment.&lt;SEP&gt;Tithonus is a mythological figure, an eternal lover of Aurora, contrasted with Endymion in mythological stories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6cab761408cb58a952d84a4e27dce81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff2030ce7e35257099d54aca8256ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ae32cc554dc390c60bd5c873778659</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
