    <node id="Achilles">
      <data key="d0">Achilles</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Achilles is a Greek hero known for his fiery passion, especially inflamed by love for Briseis.&lt;SEP&gt;Achilles is a legendary Greek hero distinguished by his fiery passion, especially in love.&lt;SEP&gt;Achilles is depicted as inflamed by love, especially in relation to Briseis.&lt;SEP&gt;Achilles is a mythological hero, born to Thetis, and is associated with the destruction of the resource of Priam.&lt;SEP&gt;Achilles is a mythological hero associated with wounds inflicted by his spear, which played a role in the mythological cure of Telephus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ba3706ec176b6f1bdc3b92e3affac80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f54377361394a10337ee324609f05a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a704560f9aa2b54ceb8b9a6fd26a53</data>
