      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Romulus is a legendary figure, son of Ilia, associated with crime and the founding myth of Rome.&lt;SEP&gt;Romulus is a foundational figure in Roman history, associated with the early establishment of Rome.&lt;SEP&gt;Romulus is a legendary founder of Rome who is associated with a straw-thatched cottage.&lt;SEP&gt;Romulus is the legendary founder of Rome, associated with the abduction of Sabine women in myth.</data>
