    <node id="Leda">
      <data key="d0">Leda</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Leda was a mythological figure deceived under the form of a bird, symbolizing love's illusions and deceit.&lt;SEP&gt;Leda is a mythological figure described with raven hair, symbolizing beauty and classic mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Leda is associated with stars and the fruitful sea, invoked for favorable stars.&lt;SEP&gt;Leda is a mythological figure, referenced as being yoked to a sacred bird in myth.&lt;SEP&gt;Leda is mythologically associated with the Stars or constellations that are favorable to mariners.&lt;SEP&gt;Leda is associated with Jupiter transforming into a swan.</data>
