      <data key="d0">Envy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A human emotion that is personified as blaming the speaker for years of slothfulness.&lt;SEP&gt;Envy is an emotion that feeds on the living and becomes at rest after death; it is associated with blame and resentment.</data>
