    <node id="Orestes">
      <data key="d0">Orestes</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Orestes is a mythological figure, the guilty avenger of his father who dared to ask for weapons against the Goddesses, representing revenge and familial duty.&lt;SEP&gt;Orestes was a mythological figure who avenged his father's murder by slaying his mother, Clytemnestra, and her paramour, Ægistheus.</data>
