    <node id="Cassandra">
      <data key="d0">Cassandra</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cassandra is a figure who fell in the temple, her silent features pronouncing censure, symbolizing prophecy and silent judgment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cassandra was a priestess who was ravished by Ajax Oileus in the temple of Minerva, and known for her prophecies.&lt;SEP&gt;Cassandra is a figure from Greek mythology known for her prophetic madness, alluded to when describing the 'raving prophetess.'</data>
