    <node id="Minerva">
      <data key="d0">Minerva</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Minerva is a Roman goddess associated with wisdom and warfare, depicted as holding arms in a poetic allegory.&lt;SEP&gt;Chaste Minerva is a goddess associated with wisdom, purity, and justice.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerva is a Roman goddess of wisdom, crafts, and strategic warfare, addressed for her insight and guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerva was the Roman goddess of wisdom, to whom Cassandra was ravished in her temple.&lt;SEP&gt;Minerva is the Roman goddess of handicrafts and wisdom, venerated as the patroness of artisans and craftsmen.</data>
