      <data key="d0">The 'meta'</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'meta' was the turning point or turning-place in Roman chariot races, around which chariots would turn.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
