      <data key="d0">The 'præcinctio'</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'præcinctio' was the passage or space in front of the race seats, with upper and lower tiers for seating.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880</data>
