    </node>
    <node id="Scylla">
      <data key="d0">Scylla</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Scylla is a mythical sea monster that infests certain waters, representing a danger to ships.&lt;SEP&gt;Scylla is a sea monster representing danger beneath the waves.&lt;SEP&gt;Scylla is a mythological monster who robbed her father of his white hair and bears raging dogs beneath her thigh and loins.&lt;SEP&gt;Scylla is described as a mythological creature who robbed her father of his white hair and bears raging dogs beneath her thigh and loins.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-432add00f9047dd14d52a61f532cf54d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4958bc3b034dd7b59c1c0df2fab2b8d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a6fd5e17721f4573f70b6578a7f23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-442f3a60382a33a67c2d1a47639643cf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764610596</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Charybdis">
      <data key="d0">Charybdis</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Charybdis is a mythical whirlpool that haunts certain waters, symbolizing deadly maritime hazards.&lt;SEP&gt;Charybdis is a monstrous whirlpool creature embodying peril and chaos in the sea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-432add00f9047dd14d52a61f532cf54d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4958bc3b034dd7b59c1c0df2fab2b8d5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
