      <data key="d0">Terra</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Terra is personified as the earth goddess, mother of Gyges/Gyas in mythological references.&lt;SEP&gt;Terra is identified as the mother of Enceladus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2ae1d708e454e0e6bf3e72d6ca49fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbda8e1999ba84d769ed820fc5af83a3</data>
