      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Mythological figure, depicted as striking the poet with a thyrsus, symbolizing divine or mythic inspiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Lyæus refers to a deity associated with wine, often depicted as horned, symbolizing wine consumption and possibly representing Bacchus.</data>
