    <node id="Greeks">
      <data key="d0">Greeks</data>
      <data key="d1">people</data>
      <data key="d2">The Greeks are an ancient civilization known for their contributions to art, culture, and language, who called the entity [oivôxooç].&lt;SEP&gt;The Greeks were an ancient civilization influential in the development of Western culture, associated here with the manner mentioned in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Greeks used wind instruments like _aulos_, _monaulos_, and _diaulos_, and designated different types of wind instruments, contributing to musical innovations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-094a55bf6bce40e6d7aa0cbb6247afe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de69a3d99803079ed2ffea77329d6210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7feca07c634684d8111b02a41fcae1</data>
