    <node id="Charioteer">
      <data key="d0">Charioteer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The drivers of the chariots who competed in the races; sometimes divided into different factiones and distinguished by names and colors.&lt;SEP&gt;The Charioteer is the victor who descended from his car after winning the race and received a reward.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eb4eb8f1e4cf05e01dcfb95969a6bb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0dd004d7bb30cbae402f5f620fd614a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880</data>
