    <node id="Knees">
      <data key="d0">Knees</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The part of the body of spectators, especially those in the back rows, which could be hurt by pressing against others.&lt;SEP&gt;Knees are hinge-joints in human legs allowing bending and straightening.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eb4eb8f1e4cf05e01dcfb95969a6bb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264ed6563d97e4d47ca6a8f096bca255</data>
