      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Æneas is a legendary hero, connected with the Trojan War, and a descendant of Venus, symbolizing lineage and destiny.&lt;SEP&gt;Æneas is a mythological hero who writes an answer to Elissa in poetic form.&lt;SEP&gt;Æneas is a Trojan hero in myth, associated with the founding myth of Rome and involved in wars for Lavinia's hand.</data>
