      <data key="d2">Jason is a mythological hero, involved in mythic tales of vengeance and violence, linked to the story of Itys.&lt;SEP&gt;Jason is a mythological hero, mentioned as part of poetic narratives.&lt;SEP&gt;Jason is a hero in Greek mythology who led the Argonauts on a quest for the Golden Fleece, associated with mythological voyages and heroism.</data>
