    <node id="Ring">
      <data key="d0">Ring</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A ring is a piece of jewelry worn on the finger, often symbolic or ornamental.&lt;SEP&gt;The ring is a piece of jewelry used as a gift and symbol of affection, which can also serve to seal secrets or messages.&lt;SEP&gt;A ring in Roman society was a piece of jewelry that signified social status or used as a signet, often designed with gems.&lt;SEP&gt;The ring is a small specimen made from Fleming’s first gold findings, given to the girl as a token until he returns.</data>
