      <data key="d2">Nemesis is the goddess of retribution, associated with justice and revenge.&lt;SEP&gt;Nemesis is a goddess of retribution, mentioned along with Delia as characters celebrated for their charms.&lt;SEP&gt;Nemesis was the poet's former love, involved in the narrative as someone the poet forsook for Delia.</data>
