      <data key="d2">Delia is a poetic reference to a muse or poetess associated with lasting fame.&lt;SEP&gt;Delia is a character celebrated for her charms, mentioned alongside Nemesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Delia was the beloved of the poet, seen as attending the poet's obsequies and involved in expressions of love and mourning.</data>
