      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">In the context, the Gods are divine beings who influence humans and have the power to hurt or bless, with control over celestial phenomena and moral authority over mortal actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Gods are divine beings involved in the mythological and religious context of the myth.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gods are divine beings to whom gifts are fittingly offered during festivities.</data>
