      <data key="d2">The Muses are mythological figures representing artistic inspiration, referenced in poetic allegory.&lt;SEP&gt;The Muses are divine figures associated with inspiration for poetic creation which the speaker wished to oppose.&lt;SEP&gt;The Muses are divine entities inspiring poets and artists, associated with poetic legacy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Muses are deities associated with inspiration for poets and artists.</data>
