    <node id="Laodamia">
      <data key="d0">Laodamia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Laodamia is a mythological figure, associated with death and mourning in poetic storytelling.&lt;SEP&gt;Laodamia is a figure referenced in the context of classical literature, associated with an epistle addressed to Protesilaus.&lt;SEP&gt;Laodamia is a figure referenced in relation to an epistle involving Protesilaus and his wife.&lt;SEP&gt;Laodamia is referenced in mythology as experiencing a bad omen when she struck her foot.</data>
