    <node id="Macer">
      <data key="d0">Macer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Macer is a poet mentioned in poetic verses, involved in poetic themes of love and warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;Æmilius Macer was a Latin poet and naturalist, known for translating Homer’s Iliad into Latin and writing about natural history, the Trojan War, and natural subjects; he was a friend of Virgil and Ovid.</data>
