    <node id="Cæsar">
      <data key="d0">Cæsar</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cæsar is a historical figure who is associated with conquest, and his prospering arms symbolize military success and strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar (Julius Cæsar) is a Roman leader, from whom Augustus is said to be descended, symbolizing divine lineage.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar is a mischievous boy raised by sisters, known for his curiosity and imagination, who later went to live with Old Smith.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar is a cousin who grew to thirteen and was too big to whip; involved in a prank by stealing whisky and replacing it with cider.</data>
