    <node id="The Ocean">
      <data key="d0">The Ocean</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ocean is a vast body of water from which a character's mistress is coming.&lt;SEP&gt;The ocean is part of the landscape, described as a sapphire band, symbolizing vastness and natural beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;The ocean influences the weather, causing the night to speed up and cover the sky.</data>
