      <data key="d2">Memnon is referenced with a dark hue and associated with mythical or legendary figures, possibly a person or hero.&lt;SEP&gt;Memnon is a figure associated with the shades and the dawn, referenced as the parent of a daily bird.&lt;SEP&gt;Memnon is a mythical figure associated with funeral oblations; in the context, it refers to a funeral pile symbolically revisited by spirits.</data>
