    <node id="Semiramis">
      <data key="d0">Semiramis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Semiramis is a legendary queen admired for her beauty, referenced in comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;Semiramis was a legendary queen of Babylon, renowned for her beauty, talent as a ruler, and unscrupulous morals.&lt;SEP&gt;Semiramis was the wife of Ninus, king of Babylon, known for her extreme beauty and talent as a ruler, and was considered unscrupulous in her morals.&lt;SEP&gt;Semiramis was a legendary queen known for implementing the custom of mutilating joys.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d18197681a28270c1f146277731c3f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de69a3d99803079ed2ffea77329d6210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfdf9595877dab30524e561a06dbcca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a88a2ba3aaa4f2f07b382ccde92f86d</data>
