    <node id="Lais">
      <data key="d0">Lais</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lais is a beloved female figure who is the subject of admiration and described with detailed physical attributes in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Lais is celebrated for her beauty and admiration by heroes, mentioned as a comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;Lais was a famous courtesan, historically known for her beauty and influence, mentioned in poetic contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Lais was a famous courtesan of Greece, known for her extreme beauty and the high price she demanded for her favors; there were two notable women with this name.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d18197681a28270c1f146277731c3f51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de69a3d99803079ed2ffea77329d6210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd2afa94631d5184fe4ed1acaebe619&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a88a2ba3aaa4f2f07b382ccde92f86d</data>
