      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Consuls are historical Roman officials whose names denoted the year of the vintage on wine vessels.&lt;SEP&gt;Consuls are diplomatic agents representing Britain in Morocco, responsible for protecting British subjects and overseeing disputes.</data>
