      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Pollux is a figure in the heavens associated with the mythological twin stars; the narrator wishes to be between Pollux and Castor.&lt;SEP&gt;Pollux is the other twin brother in the constellations of Castor and Pollux, considered a beneficial star for navigation.</data>
