      <data key="d2">Castor is mentioned as an ancestor, a figure whose reputation can influence the speaker's merit.&lt;SEP&gt;Castor is a figure in the heavens, paired with Pollux, both representing the celestial twin stars.&lt;SEP&gt;Castor is one of the twin brothers in the constellations of Castor and Pollux, associated with favorable astronomical phenomena for mariners.</data>
