    <node id="Night">
      <data key="d0">Night</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Night is a multifaceted entity widely associated with darkness, secrecy, and the end of the day. It serves as a recurring setting element in narratives, embodying themes of concealment, mystery, and transitional periods. Night symbolizes the period of darkness that marks the conclusion of daytime hours, often representing a realm of shadows, spirits, and mystical appearances. In various contexts, it signifies concealment for intimate activities and acts as a backdrop for secrecy and separation, emphasizing privacy and intimacy.

Additionally, night is personified as a force that individuals may wish to delay or oppose, often linked with sleep and the concealment of thoughts or visions. It also functions symbolically in romantic and poetic contexts, representing desires, expectations, and the transient nature of time. The night is associated with sleep, introspection, dreams, and visions, making it a domain of subconscious experience and mystical phenomena. Overall, night encapsulates a complex interplay of darkness, mystery, secrecy, and introspection, deeply woven into narrative, symbolism, and human experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Night is a recurring time period depicted as falling over both the outdoor street scene and indoor environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Night is depicted as the predominant time of darkness in the scene.&lt;SEP&gt;Night describes the time period of the events, characterized by darkness, cold, and limited visibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ff2030ce7e35257099d54aca8256ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c65528b916ab8f0ecae0b5c8df37467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd2afa94631d5184fe4ed1acaebe619&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03db9ea051409884799c6fabae5a4d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a88a2ba3aaa4f2f07b382ccde92f86d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba43616fff0b8112616e172e23cfa8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64ce64b0a51b17a08eb9a938fb755d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bae0a02b7ee1aadc768d0246ed69ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6133dbc706b714aa574e1c7d296379a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b147dfcab79c75ec8a9092c688ad363d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3595409ddcf313d3ede9dd4bc5229e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764612535</data>
