      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Neptune is the Roman god of the sea, invoked for good omens and associated with waves and maritime power.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is the Roman god of the sea, whom the speaker addresses, highlighting a cultural and mythological element.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is a mythological god associated with the sea, who, according to myth, assumed the form of the river Enipeus and is considered the father of Pelias and Neleus.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is the Roman sea god involved in the myth with Enipeus and Tyro.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is the Roman god of the sea, associated here with Melie.</data>
