      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Plautus was an ancient Roman playwright who used the term 'conservæ' to describe obedient doors or slaves.&lt;SEP&gt;Plautus was an ancient Roman playwright, known for his comedies, mentioned here concerning inscriptions and poetic practices.</data>
