    <node id="The Horse">
      <data key="d0">The Horse</data>
      <data key="d1">animal</data>
      <data key="d2">A male equine, involved in the natural acts of mating without inducement.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is an animal used in racing that, after the race, is sent into pastures, symbolizing rest and recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is used by the characters for transportation to and from the barn.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is the animal ridden by Masterton, which crashes through crusted snow and plunges forward during the pursuit.&lt;SEP&gt;The Horse is an animal in the Dean's stable that suffers from a chill and may be treated with a Bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is a four-footed animal used by Charles to assist transporting the ladies and their luggage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30bc679e676a49c813bf82844d9cb331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62d9981c359a23239322d1ef69f6eabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55f2017ea201712ef7efcf70b6477640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893320667c086c5f7bc12fc4874ac8b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a2a56cdb0d2952e81ef8205b9a6709a</data>
