    <node id="The Mistress">
      <data key="d0">The Mistress</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The mistress is the woman who is to receive the tablets or messages from the speaker via Nape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mistress is a woman who suspects her male partner of love affairs, involved in emotional conflict and accusations.&lt;SEP&gt;The mistress is a figure representing love’s deceit, capable of beguiling and influencing the narrator's feelings through words and actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-30bc679e676a49c813bf82844d9cb331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e60239d7bab05fbce9d289bd08db986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62d9981c359a23239322d1ef69f6eabb</data>
