    <node id="Ergastulum">
      <data key="d0">Ergastulum</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The ergastulum was a type of prison for slaves, often located underground, used for punishing refractory slaves and those with uncouth habits during the Roman period.</data>
