      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Emperor Hadrian was a Roman emperor who ultimately abolished the ergastulum prisons for slaves.&lt;SEP&gt;Emperor Hadrian restored the Forum Augustum after suffering damage by fire.</data>
