    <node id="Atalanta">
      <data key="d0">Atalanta</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Atalanta is a character from Greek mythology known for her fleetness and the agility of her ankles.&lt;SEP&gt;Atalanta was a renowned mythological maiden known for her swift foot and her participation in a famous race, with two different figures sharing her name.&lt;SEP&gt;Atalanta is a mythological figure known for her beauty, and her name is referenced in relation to historical or mythological stories.</data>
