    <node id="Dipsas">
      <data key="d0">Dipsas</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dipsas is named as a procuress, known for her knowledge of magic arts and charms.&lt;SEP&gt;Dipsas is a mythical character associated with thirst, derived from the Greek verb meaning 'to thirst', and is depicted as always thirsty and capable of transformation into a creature called 'strix'.&lt;SEP&gt;Dipsas was a Greek mythological figure, her name derived from the Greek word for thirst, associated with insatiable thirst.</data>
