      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Medea is a mythical sorceress known for her charms and magical abilities, mentioned in relation to Circe.&lt;SEP&gt;Medea was a sorceress from Greek mythology, known for her magical abilities and association with the city of Ææa.</data>
