    <node id="The Tower">
      <data key="d0">The Tower</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The brazen tower is a mythological structure that enclosed Danaë, symbolizing confinement and divine myths.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tower refers to the Tower of London, where Samuel Pepys visited to speak about ammunition for ships.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tower is a historic site near the river where the narrator fell asleep while traveling.</data>
