    <node id="Dogs">
      <data key="d0">Dogs</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Dogs are animals that bark in the silent night, symbolizing vigilance and alertness.&lt;SEP&gt;Dogs barking outrageously, adding sound and chaos to the scene, emphasizing activity and disturbance amidst the environment.</data>
