      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The judge is an authority who protects the female from accusations, affected by prejudices and perception, influencing the verdicts on her character.&lt;SEP&gt;The judge is a crippled man who presides over court proceedings and assumes an erect position after the verdict.&lt;SEP&gt;A judge who has followed the life of a man, respected him for his own sake, and is contemplating visiting Henry Burgoyne's house.</data>
