    <node id="Poison">
      <data key="d0">Poison</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Poison is mentioned as something not intended for mixing, emphasizing the innocence of the authors' intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;Poison refers to substances like alcohol and tobacco that harm the body over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol is described as a poison that can be harmful and dangerous, especially in higher doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Poison refers to harmful substances like nicotine and opium that can cause injury or death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-540d8a1b5f98027bff4df2b8e31b99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b50f15854f0d7a894e3abd39a81c4ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4c8f69196485bd4b711834dcd13e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1e306f99fc132d43ccbfdb378c54ee</data>
