      <data key="d0">Beauty</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Beauty is a recurring theme, associated with charm, modesty, and the object of love and admiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Beauty refers to the physical attractiveness of the mistress that the speaker confesses to loving and which influences his feelings.</data>
