      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Milanion is a mythological figure who longed to touch Atalanta's ankles, indicating romantic or heroic pursuits.&lt;SEP&gt;Milanion, also known as Hippo-menēs, is a youth associated with the myth of Atalanta, known for conquering her in a foot race.</data>
