      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Victory is a divine figure borne with wings, symbolizing triumph and success in competitions or battles.&lt;SEP&gt;Victory represents the goddess or symbolic figure associated with success in competitions, often depicted with expanded wings.</data>
