      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Young men are referenced as testing strength via the bow, symbolizing youth and vitality.&lt;SEP&gt;Young men are tested for strength using a horn bow, symbolizing youthful vigor and martial ability.&lt;SEP&gt;The young men of the neighborhood who participate in the race for the bottle on horses.</data>
