    <node id="Fan">
      <data key="d0">Fan</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A fan, called 'flabellum' or 'tabella,' is a device used to cool the atmosphere, often waved by slaves or attendants to provide comfort or as a gesture of politeness.&lt;SEP&gt;A device used to move air by imparting motion to the gas, overcoming resistance due to inertia and friction.&lt;SEP&gt;A fan is a mechanical device with blades used to move air, with its efficiency influenced by its proportions and shape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b58bef5f729853c059776366ebdfa6e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31d0ac870e71dbc7c06985412703656b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-837e785c96036c45397f4d6d019a9eba</data>
