      <data key="d0">Raging Dogs</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Raging Dogs are mythological beasts that reside beneath Scylla's thighs and loins, representing her ferocious nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d3a6fd5e17721f4573f70b6578a7f23a</data>
