    <node id="Altar">
      <data key="d0">Altar</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The altar is a sacred or significant surface used in religious or intimate contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;An altar was a sacred table used in Roman religious rites and prayers, often representing the divine in acts of supplication.&lt;SEP&gt;An altar receives prayers and incense during the festival.</data>
