    <node id="Twilight">
      <data key="d0">Twilight</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Twilight is the time of day between day and night, symbolizing transition and ambiguity.&lt;SEP&gt;The time of day when the marketplace scene calms, and the characters reflect and converse in a peaceful dusk.&lt;SEP&gt;Twilight is the period of low light just after sunset or before sunrise, which is recommended not to read in due to poor visibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a88a2ba3aaa4f2f07b382ccde92f86d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4b2ed94cb6730b5bd6ce1da0c824c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40e9d9d6bed631bcdf0022bea513804</data>
