      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">David Widger is the author who produced and compiled the translation of Ovid's "Amores" from page images provided by the Internet Archive.&lt;SEP&gt;David Widger is the producer of the text, compiled from page images provided by the Internet Archive, with knowledge of life scenes and struggles.&lt;SEP&gt;David Widger is an author who produced a transcription of Samuel Pepys's diary, providing a detailed account of events and personal reflections.</data>
