      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">An imitative bird sent from the Indians of the East, symbolizing friendship, with a detailed description of its traits and death.&lt;SEP&gt;A bird that is happy and contented on its perch near the grandmother.&lt;SEP&gt;The parrot is an animal that stumbles and gets caught in the chaos during Bruin's accidental sit on the custard pie.&lt;SEP&gt;The parrot is an intelligent bird perching and reacting to the intruder, and participating in the scene with expressive behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;A bird that interacts with other animals, makes remarks, and is capable of ruffled feathers and smooth plumage responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The parrot is a bird involved in the courtship stories told by Toto and the grandmother.</data>
