      <data key="d3">chunk-45e00ab8b0c8791550edf531523e2880</data>
      <data key="d2">The race begins after the signal when the white line is dropped, and chariots race seven times around the course.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple races ('missus') occur in a day, each starting similarly after previous finishes.&lt;SEP&gt;Race begins when the 'carceres' are opened and the signal (e.g., a napkin) is given.</data>
