      <data key="d2">Race officials wave 'togae' and call the charioteer to signal the stop.&lt;SEP&gt;Signal describes the covert communication method used by the Chinese workers involving paper or joss sticks to relay messages.&lt;SEP&gt;A signal is a form of communication used by the coolies or the fugitive, possibly to alert others or convey messages during the pursuit.</data>
