      <data key="d2">The horse is sent to the pastures when free from racing, symbolizing rest and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Horses are used by young men to race for bottles in the event.&lt;SEP&gt;Horses are present in the stalls of the barn, among the chaos of the fight.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is Gallegher's means of transportation that he rides to escape, showing resilience and eagerness to run.&lt;SEP&gt;The Horse is an animal under Yuba Bill's command, pulling the coach and involved in the scene's tension.&lt;SEP&gt;One horse was injured to the point that it had to be killed during the attack by Arabs.&lt;SEP&gt;The horse is a domesticated animal tied by the leg, noted for its normal condition of limping and its interaction with humans during the day.</data>
