      <data key="d2">Coolies are laborers or porters carrying baskets, shuffling and shouting in the marketplace.&lt;SEP&gt;Coolies are asleep on the burnt grass, described as if they might be corpses, showing exhaustion and social context.&lt;SEP&gt;Coolies are laborers involved in unloading, dumping bundles, boxes, and heavy objects at the port, working under Captain Kneebone's orders.&lt;SEP&gt;Coolies are laborers involved in digging and construction activities outside the walls during the siege.&lt;SEP&gt;Coolies are laborers or workers assisting in carrying supplies and engaging in scene activities.</data>
