    <node id="Fang">
      <data key="d0">Fang</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Fang, the Sword-Pen, is a clever and dangerous man involved in the district's criminal or esoteric activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Fang is a character with a nickname "the Sword-Pen," perceived as a long, pale individual living near Dragon Spring, associated with potential trouble and hostility toward the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;Fang is a scholar and the plaintiff in the legal conflict involving Chok Chung, accused of orchestrating or being part of a conspiracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fang is a generalissimo expecting reinforcements, involved in military planning.</data>
