      <data key="d2">Mr. Hackh is an individual addressed and ordered to sit down, appearing in a social setting involving conversation and observation.&lt;SEP&gt;A male individual addressed by a character, possibly involved in clandestine or official activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Hackh is a character who is told that nothing is safe, implying a risky environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Hackh is an individual who questions and interacts with the preacher about the local faith community.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Hackh is a person who is greeted graciously by Mrs. Forrester and engaged in the social scene.</data>
