    <node id="Rudolph">
      <data key="d0">Rudolph</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Rudolph is a multifaceted character depicted across numerous contexts, embodying qualities such as introspection, emotional depth, and resilience. In some narratives, he is portrayed as a man on a voyage or maritime setting, navigating rivers, observing landscapes, and engaging with others in exploring cultural, spiritual, and geographical environments. His reflections often involve contemplating origins, mortality, and inner tranquility, while displaying a calm, modest demeanor. Rudolph exhibits curiosity and politeness, notably interacting with characters about cultural observations, or involving himself in clandestine research, negotiations, and covert activities, which highlight his engagement in complex social situations.

Throughout various episodes, Rudolph demonstrates emotional turmoil—experiencing distress, remorse, or internal conflict. He shows concern for others, especially in moments of suffering, danger, or chaos, such as helping the wounded or fleeing from perilous scenarios. His reactions include fear, hope, determination, and moments of introspective self-doubt. He occasionally engages in active physical roles, such as mounting a pony to reach a hospital, participating in fencing practice despite injuries, or involved in military or conflict scenes, revealing resilience and a sense of duty. His involvement in tense situations—ranging from naval confrontations to underground tunnel activities—further underscores his capacity for courage and strategic action in dangerous environments.

In social interactions, Rudolph often assumes a passive or obedient stance, following others like Heywood or the padre, and displaying qualities of patience and spiritual reflection. He perceives the weight of responsibility with a sense of lightening or hope, and frequently reflects on spiritual matters, honesty, and the search for inner peace. Despite moments of inner disquiet or suspicion, he maintains a composed exterior, observing and participating in scenes that involve danger, rivalry, or moral dilemmas. Rudolph’s character is ultimately characterized by his calmness, introspective nature, emotional sensitivity, and ability to adapt and respond to the complexities of his surroundings across various stories and settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d03004a9213b673458ba0acafe4309f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f76d58d4ab3a913092d955df41ac90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb4b986690c80d677428e9a12caf306&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389101049259102fc576c6e995467682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a49d7094c02854d26171d0a710baa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdb39b7084327904c70015ce550cbdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202e89533c336da3f2eea8f8ae060d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08520ccf9b52dbf3bddee7747c3f0808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3556fcfa716131536c6e47022294b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17752cd66181b87dbe6d4ea9fb2bff3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d338a477bdce675ba495c45901f2f4f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d49a7c7c613ebfca15907de30ca994f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfccb23dd43d27cfb79137b943a1e1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc78f4a3c3f7c6ab435cf6a4fa08544e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e25d7dbcb1a555cabb7403e803731d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe3a458e44f6e2041ed190afdf2aa9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-433a9385de00773d19f337dec628ece3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd506e2b4ab4403262e3cf611653609b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0830112ae5a46289fc2882b6e60a848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f582401a3fef19539217556b4b6345e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-056576ea60bd0b171586a0c122f845b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f2c3ab9f6fe4aa540535b1858e6332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e10ee922efbc450e8141eaec0afb8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f96b34bd53c8d7d5209e1c87e5d7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f06afe6acd299e703bd0c0fadd159c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409131abbfafd74396f07aa2c2df7b16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-352ce84475cbb0fa86ecc70e31f802e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34306d993bc2674501696f34c01cc91c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac3dbacd92a1b10ced2bf57a2033bac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0caab2edac1ff4a926f6ac7bc82713d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ada7fef83d071fd0a8e9265ecd1549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efad2dc71a14d371ba2b2fc8d92a271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2a11d0d00386af1ab3eca8d4d59492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-495c1c68ae456761e6ffabfb88b22fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feaab40fd1e6e5870b9322a9a5d595b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d909fd9c6be9d88c390751dd33c4cecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d80edbff78a673a3b603b37c60a64a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55920e580ffbe8f30568a68484ac0df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95655b5452af14c44b8141fca01f2f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bae0a02b7ee1aadc768d0246ed69ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a95861dd3ba9f9981eefca991e59eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85a79afa2951041547dfe3b8f02f3836&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95a4351613d57b076f8450fdf6a8558e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8de23f34a0e649239c33f671c88fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3b55e49144523635ef63eec5d81eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f11361a750eadd8a4749bae2438fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f133b603db1fb8ead3e54d2e177d879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df25ca25a175761aaaa6532ccedf415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb115037ebf479e3fa9826264e2a73f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3e181a56877f38400ce12e934ff548</data>
