    <node id="Dr. Chantel">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Chantel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. Chantel is a French doctor who discusses the possibility of poison or vapor as a response to the rat infestation.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Chantel is a medical professional who speaks earnestly about a health risk, showing nervous gestures.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Chantel is a character who examines fingertips, laughs malignantly, and makes a sudden gesture, depicting a tense or intense personality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9daa3871f67ca2a76be04df2501cf1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08520ccf9b52dbf3bddee7747c3f0808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8de23f34a0e649239c33f671c88fb6</data>
