    <node id="Gilly">
      <data key="d0">Gilly</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gilly is a multifaceted character appearing in various contexts and scenes, primarily depicted as a fisherman engaged in river-based activities. He is described as swarthy, wet, and glistening, often working in the river mud. In several instances, Gilly is mistaken by others, such as a young hunter or during a river scene, highlighting his recognition among different characters. Despite his occupation, Gilly is portrayed as the only gentleman among a group, suggesting a level of social distinction or respectability.

Beyond his fishing role, Gilly is involved in strategic and social discussions. He participates in inspecting mysterious situations, discussing plans to fumigate areas affected by rats or plague, and engaging in discussions related to the "War Board," which involve considerations of defense points, weapons, and military strategy. His insights reflect a pragmatic approach; he recognizes the limitations of weapons and emphasizes the importance of strategic placement of defenses. His demeanor is characterized as honest and tired, with tired eyes that reveal his weariness and sincerity. Gilly also exhibits curiosity by inquiring about concerns affecting the group.

Gilly's social interactions include associations with Mrs. Gilly and reactions during moments of distress or tumult. He protests and interacts with characters like Mrs. Forrester, showing concern during her distress, and he engages in social activities such as playfully tugging his moustache, laughing, or smiling during scenes. His mannerisms and old-fashioned behaviors lend him an air of traditionality.

In addition to his fishing and strategic roles, Gilly appears involved in underground activities, as indicated by references to being brought down into tunnels, and stands with Rudolph at the water gate contemplating the situation involving boats and the river. In narrative scenes involving chaos or danger, Gilly seems affected by the tumult, sometimes speaking impatiently or emphasizing urgent concerns. His earnings are mentioned in contexts suggesting they have been squandered on various goods, indicating economic struggles or moral commentary.

Overall, Gilly is portrayed as a complex character whose roles span from humble fisherman to strategic advisor, social participant, and observer of turmoil. His character embodies a mix of practicality, honesty, traditional manners, and social engagement, making him a nuanced figure within the narrative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d03004a9213b673458ba0acafe4309f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9daa3871f67ca2a76be04df2501cf1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8decdd14fcac24539dbd5c797ec474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-941c4d13af541f7963a27e1494bf443b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd506e2b4ab4403262e3cf611653609b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f582401a3fef19539217556b4b6345e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e10ee922efbc450e8141eaec0afb8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f96b34bd53c8d7d5209e1c87e5d7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f06afe6acd299e703bd0c0fadd159c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34306d993bc2674501696f34c01cc91c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ada7fef83d071fd0a8e9265ecd1549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feaab40fd1e6e5870b9322a9a5d595b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d80edbff78a673a3b603b37c60a64a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8de23f34a0e649239c33f671c88fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df25ca25a175761aaaa6532ccedf415</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
