      <data key="d0">The Padre</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Padre is a religious figure who questions about the whereabouts of "the Mem" and is involved in the social setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Padre is a religious figure who engages in conversations about Fang and reflects on responsibilities and future prospects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Padre is a preacher who speaks earnestly about matters of faith, engaging with a diverse audience.&lt;SEP&gt;The Padre is a figure who finds and deciphers a complex message on a painted scroll, and discusses cryptographic details with Heywood.&lt;SEP&gt;The Padre is a religious figure involved in the underground scene, associated with the grave and tunnel activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A religious figure involved in the communication and coordination of the water escape, responsible for the signal fire and signaling procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Padre is a religious figure whose wife speaks with him, indicating spiritual support during distress.</data>
