    <node id="Miss Drake">
      <data key="d0">Miss Drake</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Miss Drake is a multifaceted character depicted across various contexts, primarily characterized by her involvement in social gatherings, compassionate demeanor, and understated presence. She is often described as a woman or girl dressed in white, which may symbolize purity or a healing role, and is associated with themes of social interaction, hospitality, and quiet observation.

In social settings, Miss Drake is portrayed as engaging in conversation, listening attentively, and smiling quietly, reflecting a composed and empathetic nature. She interacts with other characters such as Rudolph and Heywood, engaging in thoughtful dialogue and expressing curiosity and concern about her surroundings, which suggests a reflective and compassionate personality. She also participates in musical scenes, singing and contributing to the cultural atmosphere of the gathering.

Miss Drake is also depicted as a caring figure, involved in tending to children and individuals in need, sometimes acting as a healer or mystical figure through her activities with medicines and her quiet, background role. Her reactions to scenes vary from amusement and distress when she asks about secrets or receives monetary gifts intended for her hospital and children, indicating her altruism and emotional depth.

Additionally, some descriptions portray her observing scenes with a detached attitude, such as from a river window, emphasizing her reflective or contemplative nature. She is seen providing emotional support by subtly interacting with other characters, demonstrating her empathetic and supportive personality. Overall, Miss Drake emerges as a compassionate, observant, and subtly active participant in her environment, embodying qualities of kindness, curiosity, and solemn engagement across different scenes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-91f76d58d4ab3a913092d955df41ac90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3556fcfa716131536c6e47022294b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-433a9385de00773d19f337dec628ece3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c0ed9d02f18daa7a67250c12b9fff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e10ee922efbc450e8141eaec0afb8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efad2dc71a14d371ba2b2fc8d92a271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f11361a750eadd8a4749bae2438fb6</data>
