    <node id="Nesbit">
      <data key="d0">Nesbit</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nesbit is a multifaceted character portrayed across various contexts. Described as a lively, wiry man with cheerful Cockney speech, he is actively engaged in social activities such as playing billiards and discussing local events, reflecting a convivial and energetic personality. In social circles, Nesbit appears as part of a group of associates, often contrasted with others who do not descend so low as to marry their native wives, suggesting a rougher, more unruly or lower-status character within that grouping. He is also depicted as a companion to Rudolph, sharing meals that are described as worse than those of others, indicating a certain camaraderie despite unfavorable circumstances.

Nesbit is involved in a variety of scenarios that highlight his versatility. He is depicted as a groom or assistant engaged in discussions about fencing, potential accidents, and military or duel-related plans, implying familiarity with combat or defense matters. Furthermore, he is portrayed as a weary individual who discusses politics, fatigue, and intentions to leave, revealing a relatively tired or resigned disposition. His lively nature extends to tumultuous moments, such as managing a crowd during a chaotic incident involving coconuts, where he displays energetic actions to control the situation.

In addition, Nesbit is characterized by his light, humorous demeanor, notably with a wounded forehead and carrying a plaster cross, which adds a humorous or jaunty aspect to his personality. He owns a revolver and participates in councils deliberating on defense, showing a sense of responsibility and readiness. His keen observational skills are evident as he comments on the captain’s luck with exclamations, and he actively contributes to social gatherings by interrupting others like Teppich, helping to create a lively, spirited atmosphere.

Overall, Nesbit is depicted as a lively, humorous, and versatile individual involved in social, military, and tumultuous scenarios, embodying a lively, roguish character with a broad range of engagement from leisure activities to serious discussions and chaotic events.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9daa3871f67ca2a76be04df2501cf1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdb39b7084327904c70015ce550cbdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3556fcfa716131536c6e47022294b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d338a477bdce675ba495c45901f2f4f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8decdd14fcac24539dbd5c797ec474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e25d7dbcb1a555cabb7403e803731d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-056576ea60bd0b171586a0c122f845b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f96b34bd53c8d7d5209e1c87e5d7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f11361a750eadd8a4749bae2438fb6</data>
