    <node id="Captain Kneebone">
      <data key="d0">Captain Kneebone</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Captain Kneebone is a multifaceted character depicted in various contexts, primarily associated with nautical and military roles. In some narratives, he is portrayed as a ship's captain actively involved in social and celebratory events, such as hosting festivities on a vessel, boasting about winnings in lotteries like the Derby Sweepstake, and wearing distinctive attire like a tunic of purest white. He demonstrates a commanding presence, engaging with followers, participating in jovial activities, and exhibiting leadership qualities aboard ships, often overseeing boat movements, setting signals, and managing crisis situations with signs of age and stress. 

Additionally, Captain Kneebone is depicted as a military officer involved in battles and strategic decision-making, providing guarded praise and strategic insights. He is responsible for overseeing river escapes, which entails observing boat movements and issuing signals to coordinate actions. In some scenes, he interacts with characters such as Heywood and Rudolph, suggesting involvement in planned outings or social encounters. His character thus embodies both leadership in maritime operations and participation in social and celebratory events, reflecting a persona that combines authority, joviality, and personal gravitas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d3556fcfa716131536c6e47022294b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce0acb7c7df540cd62c4ae48d32a1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f06afe6acd299e703bd0c0fadd159c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd990ec3d60f1ee71ebfb13a84ee7393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2a11d0d00386af1ab3eca8d4d59492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d909fd9c6be9d88c390751dd33c4cecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b83639d85d5ff658efd25e868955e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb</data>
