      <data key="d2">The Portuguese constructed a well in the courtyard, relevant to the discussion about water sources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portuguese are noted as possibly involved in transmitting musical influences or instruments to South America, though the evidence is inconclusive.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portuguese captured Saffee in 1508 and abandoned it in 1641, establishing and losing control of the city.&lt;SEP&gt;European colonial empire that built and later abandoned Anafa.&lt;SEP&gt;The Portuguese once possessed the town of Tit or Tet, indicating historical colonial influence.</data>
