    <node id="The Compradore">
      <data key="d0">The Compradore</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The compradore is a character who manages the tally-slips, umbrella, and odds in a cubby-hole, providing a hiding place for Rudolph.&lt;SEP&gt;The Compradore is an oily-faced figure who beckons with his hand and appears as a key intermediary in underground activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Compradore is an intermediary or trader involved in the scene, holding halberds and interacting with the characters during the skirmish.</data>
