      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Coolie is a laborer who swerves, stops, and tilts his shafts to the ground, indicating a gesture or action.&lt;SEP&gt;The coolie is a servant who helps Rudolph by taking the bridle, representative of local labor or service.&lt;SEP&gt;A shriveled, mask-wearing worker who brings news of riots and danger, speaking in colloquial language and involved in clandestine activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Coolie is a laborer or servant, employed for carrying supplies and involved in scene activities.</data>
