    <node id="Chok Chung">
      <data key="d0">Chok Chung</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chok Chung is a character identified as a Christian, honest, and involved in the community's religious conflicts.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is a Christian merchant involved in legal proceedings related to a death, depicted as slow and trudging.&lt;SEP&gt;A Christian merchant involved in a legal trial, targeted by authorities and possibly a victim of political or social unrest.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is a person involved in a legal case, whose situation is discussed with reluctance and evasiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is identified as a Christian, the fugitive who jumps into the river claiming "I am Jesus Christ!" and later is revealed as the drowned figure in the scene.</data>
