      <data key="d2">The Man is a character whose suffering is expressed in a broken, heavy-voiced manner, reflecting hardship and moral dilemma.&lt;SEP&gt;The man described has weather-beaten, sharp-lined face, blue eyes, and is around sixty years old. He is kind, considerate, and associated with Cornish identity.</data>
