    <node id="Girl">
      <data key="d0">Girl</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Girl" refers to various interconnected depictions of a female character across different contexts. Primarily, the girl is depicted as a central figure symbolizing hope and mercy, exemplified by her dream of swimming through a storm—a metaphor for resilience amidst turmoil. She is characterized as spirited and self-contained, displaying pride, audacity, and emotional sensitivity in her interactions. For instance, she guides other characters like Brice, criticizes plans, and reveals her own intentions related to stolen money and the desire to escape danger, indicating her resourcefulness and assertiveness. 

In addition to her actions, the girl engages in deep reflection and communication, often conveying thoughts about pride, ignorance, and wonder, reflecting a thoughtful and introspective nature. She communicates with other characters such as Rudolph and appears aware of ongoing events, suggesting an active awareness of her environment. Her appearance is described as a young woman around seventeen or eighteen years old, dressed in her mother's clothes and wearing a sunbonnet. She exhibits a straightforward and frank manner, uncomplicated by concern for adornment or superficiality. 

While she is also portrayed as a village beauty, her sense of satisfaction derives from small victories, and she is unconsciously heroic in her demeanor. Additionally, she plays a role in exchanges involving personal artifacts like a ring and a pan with Fleming, further emphasizing her involvement in meaningful interactions. Overall, the "Girl" embodies a complex blend of hope, resilience, introspection, independence, and subtle heroism, appearing as a multifaceted figure with significant influence on her surroundings and other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;A girl among oil women is described as pretty but unwashed, involved in the olive oil process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1876f424b05897dac23b01553cb7070&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4b2ed94cb6730b5bd6ce1da0c824c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ca6e973ad64937ab7bcd5ec67b32e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20eb60740e6251d1b594e68f980b1ca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1374a82b81b5bf5cc42271a4aaa04ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9acbfccf8366a087281ca4b18a20425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1556645e734e01c75f40b96c3891db6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc84603f0e7bd28396f7db8ef2147e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18f342829bd53e5ab827365876b127db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39facf182f4a5fa24e4d960518506e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
