      <data key="d0">The Black Dog</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black Dog symbolizes an omen or prophetic sign related to the timing or occurrence of destructive events, as per the cryptic message.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Dog is a mysterious or symbolic entity, known to bark early, indicating a sign of alert or impending danger.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Dog is described as thrusting his round muzzle over a torn earthwork, symbolizing menace or danger in the scene.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cfe3a458e44f6e2041ed190afdf2aa9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d99b7f78b8977afbaeb638a1b23512</data>
