    <node id="Dr. Earle">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Earle</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A male doctor or figure involved in the social setting, engaging with Rudolph and others.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Earle is a character who studies and discusses Fang, and expresses concern about potential trouble caused by Fang.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Earle is a character who expresses skepticism or cynicism about local beliefs, mentioning theft of children for magic medicine.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Earle is a character who observes, examines, and interprets a painted scroll with complex characters, ultimately identifying a Triad cipher.</data>
