    <node id="Mrs. Wu">
      <data key="d0">Mrs. Wu</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Wu is the captain of the sampan, a lively, humorous woman who interacts with Heywood and others aboard the boat.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Wu is a humorous boat-woman who operates a sampan, known for her lively personality and sharp glances.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Wu is a small, capable woman, identified as a friend and gossip, who takes command during a crisis.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Wu is a friend and gossip who actively takes command during a boat scene, tearing a man's hands away and maintaining control of the boat.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac3dbacd92a1b10ced2bf57a2033bac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85a79afa2951041547dfe3b8f02f3836</data>
