      <data key="d2">The crowd of fishermen and spectators are yelling, laughing, and engaging in chaotic celebration of the scene.&lt;SEP&gt;Fishermen are volunteers working along the coast, often risking their lives and sometimes getting intoxicated, operating in perilous winter conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fishermen are local workers preparing boats for the pilchard fishery, integral to the local economy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fishermen are individuals engaged in catching fish, depicted as preparing to start work.</data>
