      <data key="d0">Lake Valley</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lake Valley is a mining area in New Mexico described as a prospective mining center.&lt;SEP&gt;Lake Valley is a mining camp in New Mexico, historically significant for prospecting and mining excitement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00f9b572c1542009383cf9c5ae7c06e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a92b8aff8b2407fa2e62ff3ec614ae5a</data>
