    <node id="Perche District">
      <data key="d0">Perche District</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Perche district is a mining region in New Mexico that experienced a recent rush due to silver ore strikes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Perche district is a prospective silver mining region in southern New Mexico, known for recent strikes and high prospecting activity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00f9b572c1542009383cf9c5ae7c06e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a92b8aff8b2407fa2e62ff3ec614ae5a</data>
