      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The body's natural cooling mechanism via evaporation, which diminishes when skin contact is with liquids or solids that inhibit sweating.&lt;SEP&gt;Perspiration is the process of sweat coming out through the skin, helping to carry waste matter away and regulate body temperature.</data>
