    <node id="Apple">
      <data key="d0">Apple</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Apples are the raw fruit processed in the jelly factory, with certain varieties unaffected by crop failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Apples are a fruit processed in the mill; they are cleaned, ground, and pressed to produce juice and jelly.&lt;SEP&gt;Apple is a primary fruit used in jelly production; late-season, gnarled, or frozen apples are still utilized and valuable for processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A fruit from which cider is made, and whose juice undergoes fermentation to produce alcohol.&lt;SEP&gt;An apple is a fruit that changes from unripe to ripe as the sun ripens and sweetens it.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d66e0ae119d056e73d6977a3aa757057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04ccd4dad326e3c82f9a671aff50b17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7506d04f954ae2d1cb0ed256f5c0e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d170d1426917b3639e7243e4aade782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37</data>
