    <node id="North Carolina">
      <data key="d0">North Carolina</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">North Carolina has significant slate deposits in Haywood, Yancey, Mitchell, and Macon counties.&lt;SEP&gt;North Carolina's farms increased by 78%, reflecting significant agricultural growth.&lt;SEP&gt;North Carolina is a U.S. state with a 78% increase in farms since 1870.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71098a84f862320370cd4b30b1083858</data>
