    <node id="Salt Lake">
      <data key="d0">Salt Lake</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Salt Lake area is known for slate deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt Lake is a large saltwater body in Morocco, notable for its extensive area and salt deposits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc0fa20a8bb60c2f53107ccd7d2bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb3f38fdfb7168489cd1fb4adcb2515</data>
