      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Illinois saw a 26.1% increase in farms over ten years.&lt;SEP&gt;Illinois is a U.S. state considered fully settled, with a 26.1% growth in farmland over ten years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8daf6c6c70a3c63c2e7f57dbc969f7c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71098a84f862320370cd4b30b1083858</data>
