      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">New Jersey's farms increased by 12.2% since 1870.&lt;SEP&gt;New Jersey is a U.S. state used as a comparison with West Virginia’s farm increases.&lt;SEP&gt;New Jersey is a state mentioned as the place where "Jimmie the Gent" broke jail.</data>
