    <node id="Mississippi River">
      <data key="d0">Mississippi River</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mississippi River is a prominent and iconic waterway in the United States, characterized by its mighty, continuous flow, turbulent waters, and abundant driftwood. It plays a crucial role in the country's geographical, historical, and economic landscape. Near St. Louis, Missouri, the Mississippi River has been the focus of active engineering improvement projects, including the construction of mattress and jetty systems aimed at managing and enhancing the river's flow and navigability.

Historically, the Mississippi River has been central to the development of steamboat navigation, serving as a vital transportation route for communities along its banks. It has hosted early settlements of woodcutters and settlers who relied on its waters for economic activities, and its surrounding forests were extensively cleared by humans to support agricultural and developmental expansion. The river's significance extends to cultural and personal histories, as it is described as the setting where early scenes of the narrator’s manhood took place and where they conducted their journey, including the land grant associated with that narrative.

Furthermore, the Mississippi River holds strategic importance in military history; during the Civil War, it served as a key geographical landmark, and campaigns led by figures such as General Price crossed it, marking significant milestones in military movements and control over the region. In summary, the Mississippi River is a mighty, historic waterway central to various facets of American geography, development, and history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e2ab7ad03b323561e72dda983ec2d3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855ee3c61d64dd76f89504f38e2a403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8191bf61815f5a982986bba2de4926e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db12a2e534724a0be9ade4aa8ff10a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9445e78fa0e5990fbfc82fd7af0897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01da3252de63d3437b7317d570944a2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f402c259d546a1b4619eed5b798473c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d6ba5697f9f6ac8decb2198a361839d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
