      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Bunte's burette is a specialized apparatus devised for analyzing gases of blast-furnaces, providing a simpler and more efficient alternative to traditional methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Bunte's burette is a device designed for analyzing gases from blast-furnaces, offering a simple and efficient method for gas absorption and analysis.</data>
