      <data key="d0">L. Clemandot</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">L. Clemandot devised a method of treating metals involving heating and compression, called tempering by compression.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c8158e0db68586c52c3a94ca3b5a762c</data>
