      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Gutenberg is a digital library that provides free access to literary works, including the specified eBook.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Gutenberg is a digital library that distributes free eBooks, including texts like "Dandy Dick" with detailed formatting and textual annotations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35d425c96f34d0d6646ac0782575e98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b99d32a6c4077b81dac5436dc1d07de</data>
