    <node id="Coffee">
      <data key="d0">Coffee</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Coffee is a beverage that may serve as a restorative and aid in fatigue recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Coffee is a hot beverage given to sailors instead of rum, which helps them work better and feel stronger during storms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b50f15854f0d7a894e3abd39a81c4ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38509fbb14988b3d2417deb93ee40233</data>
