      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Oatmeal Gruel">
      <data key="d0">Oatmeal Gruel</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Weak oatmeal gruel, served hot or cold, is a simple restorative to help combat fatigue.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b50f15854f0d7a894e3abd39a81c4ae</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611668</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tobacco">
      <data key="d0">Tobacco</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Tobacco is a plant whose leaves are widely used to produce various recreational products, including cigarettes, cigars, and snuff. It contains nicotine, a highly poisonous substance that acts as a nerve dulling agent, providing a temporary false sense of relief from cold or fatigue. While moderate use of tobacco has been associated with a temporary reduction in fatigue, its excessive consumption is harmful and detrimental to health.

Health analyses and various descriptions highlight the significant health risks associated with tobacco use. Tobacco use can negatively impact overall health, especially affecting growing children and adolescents by impairing growth, damaging bones, and compromising development. It is also linked to specific health problems such as diseases of the throat, sores, and dental discoloration caused by its use in smoking products. Additionally, tobacco is considered highly poisonous due to its nicotine content.

Historically, tobacco has been used in different contexts, including by members of the Greely Party, though their use was not beneficial and may have contributed to weakening their health during their struggles. Overall, tobacco is recognized both as a plant product with recreational use and as a harmful substance with significant adverse health impacts, especially when used in excess.&lt;SEP&gt;Tobacco is grown locally in the Sahara villages for consumption or trade.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b50f15854f0d7a894e3abd39a81c4ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339a04378219e12fdd299ea57c43f944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4c8f69196485bd4b711834dcd13e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71a4a564b49b7f7ab5fc34553849e9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ca6e973ad64937ab7bcd5ec67b32e10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efb927db7ea2bc4669beaaff8354b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4ecf42e13f0e671845a3cd5496327f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1e306f99fc132d43ccbfdb378c54ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
