    <node id="Texas">
      <data key="d0">Texas</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Texas is a region where rattlesnakes are common and bites are a concern.&lt;SEP&gt;Texas is a U.S. state with 174,184 farms, greatly increased from 61,125 in 1870.&lt;SEP&gt;Texas is associated with Parkhurst, described as a full-blooded Texan in the scene.</data>
