      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The white ash is a tree specimen measuring 46 inches in diameter and 182 years old, one of the largest in the collection.&lt;SEP&gt;A large tree with a diameter of 46 inches and an age of about 182 years, noted for its size and age in the collection.</data>
