      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">This lecture discusses the utilization of food intake and metabolism in humans, exploring its historical and biological aspects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dcbc139ed5e07919a0f07353bbfad993</data>
