      <data key="d0">Spherical Triangle</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A spherical triangle is a three-sided figure on the surface of a sphere, used in celestial navigation to relate observed angles with geographic positions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1573d79bcfed29e4fb110ec5c56a26fb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
