    <node id="Z S P Triangle">
      <data key="d0">Z S P Triangle</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The Z S P spherical triangle involves the observer's position, the celestial pole, and Polaris, used to calculate azimuth and latitude.</data>
