      <data key="d0">Sethos</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Sethos is a historic romance written by Abbe Terrason, describing an ancient ritual involving fire and the traversal of a burning place.&lt;SEP&gt;Sethos is a legendary figure depicted in the romance "Sethos," associated with traversing a fiery, incinerating structure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59ad55bacf8e991f7ec32f1bd324e6cb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
