      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Aunt Patsy is a socialite in Chicago who discusses family, style, and social status, and visits the Daymon palace.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Patsy Perkins is a family ancestor referenced in context with Roxie Daymon's family history.</data>
