    <node id="Jim">
      <data key="d0">Jim</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jim is Aunt Patsy's nephew, a poor young man working in Chicago who is loved by Aunt Patsy.&lt;SEP&gt;Jim is a servant or worker who informs Norah about the bank run and the stolen money.&lt;SEP&gt;Jim is the brother of Chris Calton, who discusses his opinions with Miss Trotter about the romantic situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Jim is the name of the crow, kept in the hermit's cave, cautious but later reassured by the hawk's peaceful intentions.</data>
