    <node id="Suza Fairfield">
      <data key="d0">Suza Fairfield</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Suza Fairfield is an eleven-year-old girl, member of Aunt Katy's household, and the potential inheritor of Aunt Katy’s estate.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is a young girl who is attempting to escape from Aunt Katy and her pursuers, showing resourcefulness and determination during her flight.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is a young girl who inherits Katy Demitt's possessions and secrets, and is central to the storyline involving family conflicts.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is an orphan girl raised by Aunt Katy Demitt, associated with Port William, and considered a belle.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is described as the belle of Port William and a relative associated with the Carlo family lineage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e347c91e271c6caaede3cd9a43e87b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-308dc1f4e23e0e8a33feabd4ae43b18c</data>
