      <data key="d0">Angel of Observation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Angel of Observation is a figurative term describing an overseeing presence or perspective in the narrative, observing events silently.&lt;SEP&gt;The Angel of Observation is a symbolic figure that places a finger on Suza's lips, representing divine or moral insight and protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Angel of Observation is a symbolic figure or poetic representation of attentiveness to courtship and social interactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47</data>
