    <node id="Brindle Bill">
      <data key="d0">Brindle Bill</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Brindle Bill is a multifaceted character whose identity varies across different descriptions. Primarily, he is portrayed as a woodcutter renowned for his strength and boldness, serving as a leading spirit within his social community. He is associated with Shirt-Tail Bend, a locale where he is recognized not only for chopping wood but also for performing card tricks, highlighting a blend of physical prowess and entertainment.

In addition to his occupational and social roles, Brindle Bill is involved in confrontational incidents, notably engaging in a dispute with Don Carlo, in which he was accused of insulting Don Carlo and was prepared for combat. He is also depicted as a manipulative character who interacts with others such as Simon, analyzing motives and using signals like winks to suggest involvement in secret dealings.

Historical and genealogical references indicate that Brindle Bill was the father of Steve Brindle, a resident of Shirt-Tail Bend, and that he died in a state prison, suggesting a storyline involving incarceration. There is also a mention of Brindle Bill as a historical figure connected to Roxie’s family estate, from whom descendant information was obtained.

Furthermore, some descriptions imply that Brindle Bill was a swindler involved in fraudulent activities, swearing and giving testimony regarding Rose's parentage before being sentenced to a long-term prison term. This criminal aspect details a darker side of his character, contrasting with other portrayals of his local and social influence.

Overall, Brindle Bill is a complex character with multiple facets—from a community-esteemed woodcutter and performer to a confrontational and potentially criminal figure involved in deception and incarceration. The various descriptions collectively depict a layered personality embedded in social, familial, and possibly criminal narratives within his community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d6ba5697f9f6ac8decb2198a361839d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668c616fe700fcefe866c088d1613f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6f58deafd0050a97f32d1b33594ea60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c</data>
