      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tom Ditamus moved from the Cumberland mountains to Ohio, intended to return to his old home, and was involved in a plan to take Suza Fairfield away.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom Ditamus is a man who has some of the Demitt family's money and is indifferent about Suza's absence.</data>
