    <node id="Young Lady">
      <data key="d0">Young Lady</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A young woman at the camp meeting, admired by Don Carlo, who is believed to have saved his life from the wreck of the Red Stone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Young Lady is a well-bred young woman dining alone with a young man, appearing excited and fashionable.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers generally to Cissy, the daughter of Montagu Trixit, seen as a modest and innocent young woman.&lt;SEP&gt;The young Lady is the daughter born to Lady Sandwich, recent childbirth is noted.</data>
