    <node id="Sundown Hill">
      <data key="d0">Sundown Hill</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Sundown Hill is involved in the conspiracy with S. S. Simon and Brindle Bill against Don Carlo.&lt;SEP&gt;Sundown Hill is a place where a conversation was overheard, involving a reference to Susan Lascó.&lt;SEP&gt;Sundown Hill is a geographical location in Shirt-Tail Bend where conversations and events take place.&lt;SEP&gt;A place associated with Brindle Bill and the event of swindling money.&lt;SEP&gt;Sundown Hill is a geographical location associated with Steve Brindle's maternal family's history.</data>
