    <node id="Cæsar Simon">
      <data key="d0">Cæsar Simon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cæsar Simon was the father of Conway, from Tennessee, and the owner of the surname Conway bears.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar Simon is an estate owner in Arkansas, involved in a legal dispute over his will, with concerns over mental capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar Simon was a soldier involved in a conflict during the war, with mysterious references to desertion and a number on a card.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar Simon is a figure involved in interpreting secret codes and military matters, with a background as a soldier and a reflective, strategic thinker.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar Simon is a soldier and observer, reflecting on the actions of soldiers like Steve Brindle and involved in interpreting secret messages.&lt;SEP&gt;Cæsar Simon is a character who reflects on the brutality of war, fighting for land, and the decline of his family line.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1788abe5b20f786a0ee4558b6fb02743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ec4f8e1bbc32532d2dfcca778eb43e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0</data>
