    <node id="Roxie Daymon">
      <data key="d0">Roxie Daymon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Roxie Daymon, also known as Roxie Fairfield, is a historical figure connected to the family history of Simon, potentially an ancestor.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a young and beautiful woman engaged in a romantic relationship with Simon and involved in his will.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a young woman who is part of a pleasure trip, described as handsome and interesting, and is involved in a complex family history.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a woman whose death is recorded; she has a daughter, and her personal history is connected to Chicago.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a wealthy woman in Chicago, associated with the reputation of being rich and involved in social events.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a near relative involved in the legal and family matters described.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Daymon is a married woman who lives happily in a cottage after marrying a mechanic.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d217af2b17a7981ff4341de893334&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1788abe5b20f786a0ee4558b6fb02743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668c616fe700fcefe866c088d1613f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01da3252de63d3437b7317d570944a2c</data>
