    <node id="Roxie Fairfield">
      <data key="d0">Roxie Fairfield</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Roxie Fairfield is a girl who cares for her sisters, seeks help for the baby, and leaves the cabin to get assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Fairfield is the heroine of the snow storm, who received rudimentary education and ran away with her lover.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Fairfield is an alias or maiden name associated with Roxie Daymon, linked to her identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Fairfield is the full name of Roxie Daymon, an orphan girl with a complex family history and potential inheritance.</data>
