      <data key="d0">Governor Morock</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Governor Morock is a law figure who writes a will for Simon, prepares legal cases involving the estate, and interacts with cousin Cæsar.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a political authority involved in the case and decision-making process described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a political figure in Chicago who discusses legal matters and finances related to estate disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is depicted as a fashionable lawyer in Chicago, discussing estate dealings and a sum of money.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a retired political figure living off a low reputation, associated with low-cost work.</data>
