    <node id="Young Simon">
      <data key="d0">Young Simon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Young Simon is a wealthy young cotton planter who dies and leaves a large estate to Roxie Daymon.&lt;SEP&gt;Young Simon is a traveler on the Mississippi river who is curious about Roxie and possesses a significant sum of money, and is engaged to Roxie.&lt;SEP&gt;Young Simon is a person whose will Roxie Daymon may attempt to break, connected with the estate in Arkansas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-789d217af2b17a7981ff4341de893334&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1788abe5b20f786a0ee4558b6fb02743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668c616fe700fcefe866c088d1613f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313</data>
