    <node id="Aunt Katy">
      <data key="d0">Aunt Katy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Aunt Katy is a woman who cares for the children, facilitates transportation to fetch help, and gives advice and assistance to Roxie.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy is a neighbor and benefactress who makes a promise regarding her care for Suza.&lt;SEP&gt;A woman who inherited her relative's estate, had no children, and was industrious and economical.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy, who died intestate, was a woman of independent means, suspected to have a will, and associated with her estate and money.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy was an elderly woman, possessed her own money, held a life estate, and was the subject of speculation regarding her will.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy had no children, possessed her own money earned by her own hand, and held a life estate in the Demitt property.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy is an elderly woman who has previously received abuse from and is associated with Suza, and is depicted as an old witch living in Port William.</data>
