      <data key="d2">The Ohio River flows into the Mississippi and was part of the steamboat and navigation history described.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is navigated by Tom on his trip to Fort Washington.&lt;SEP&gt;Major river forming Kentucky's western boundary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is depicted as disturbed by steam navigation, symbols of change and settlement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River marks the final part of Suza's journey into her home area, providing her with relief and sanctuary.</data>
