      <data key="d2">A locality on the Mississippi River known for its early settlement, wood choppers, and boatmen.&lt;SEP&gt;Shirt-Tail Bend is a place associated with Brindle Bill, known for gambling and shadiness.&lt;SEP&gt;Shirt-Tail Bend is a town serving as the setting for various characters' activities and stories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d6ba5697f9f6ac8decb2198a361839d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9445e78fa0e5990fbfc82fd7af0897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6f58deafd0050a97f32d1b33594ea60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf</data>
