    </node>
    <node id="The Angel of Observation">
      <data key="d0">The Angel of Observation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Angel of Observation is a metaphor for insight or perception that whispers in Cæsar's mind about fighting for land stripped of ornaments.</data>
