    <node id="The Globe">
      <data key="d0">The Globe</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Globe refers to the Earth, which makes nearly two more revolutions in its orbit before the war's events are recounted.&lt;SEP&gt;The Globe is a venue where music and entertainment events are held.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8a70ed68b8ad9957789f681884b2ba</data>
