    </node>
    <node id="Rose">
      <data key="d0">Rose</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Rose is a daughter in Tom Fairfield's family, who covers her sister Susie with a blanket and rocks her in a trough.&lt;SEP&gt;Rose is a caretaker who covers Suza with a blanket and rocks her in a trough, showing concern for her well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Rose is the younger sister, soon to be fostered by Mrs. Evaline Estep.&lt;SEP&gt;A woman who negotiates with Simon to manage the business, ultimately dies from yellow fever while traveling.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611985</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="The Marriage Certificate">
      <data key="d0">The Marriage Certificate</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An old paper that verifies the marriage of Tom Fairfield and Susan Lasco, and is unfolded by Rose.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611985</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tom Fairfield">
      <data key="d0">Tom Fairfield</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tom Fairfield is a preacher seeking to improve his fortune and social standing, who experiences personal misfortunes and moves to Ohio.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom Fairfield is the father of the children, believed to be dead and under the snow, and he is associated with trouble due to drinking.&lt;SEP&gt;A character descended from a prominent Virginia family, with a restless spirit who emigrated to Kentucky and experienced early frontier life.&lt;SEP&gt;A young man who emigrated to Kentucky and experienced its frontier life.&lt;SEP&gt;A man whose marriage to Susan Lasco is documented in the certificate Rose uncovers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764611985</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
