      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Old Demitt was an estate owner who died intestate, and his relations inherited his estate.&lt;SEP&gt;An estate owner who died intestate, with his relations inheriting his estate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74</data>
