    <node id="Suza">
      <data key="d0">Suza</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Suza is a baby who is being cared for, covered with a blanket, and rocking in a trough, and she cries and shivers with cold.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza is the baby sister who wins Aunt Katy's affections and remains in her care until she leaves as a free woman.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza is an eleven-year-old girl, held captive by Tom Ditamus, and determined to escape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-308dc1f4e23e0e8a33feabd4ae43b18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f</data>
