      <data key="d0">Old Smith</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Old Smith owned a farm on the Tennessee River and employed wood cutters like Rob Roy.&lt;SEP&gt;Old Smith is a landowner on the Tennessee river who employs wood cutters, including Rob Roy, and owns a farm with a large tract of land.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01da3252de63d3437b7317d570944a2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d5b1a3d2da2bcf2bd68dce9ef1b9e2</data>
