      <data key="d0">Tom's Wife</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tom's wife is a preacher's wife who suffers from the _jerks_ during a church meeting, and later is found dead in the morning.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom's wife is a storyteller about her ancestors and hopes for family revival and inheritance.</data>
