    <node id="Detective">
      <data key="d0">Detective</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">While not explicitly named, a law enforcement officer equipped with a rifle gun was involved in the execution of Alonzo Phelps.&lt;SEP&gt;The detective is a law enforcement officer tasked with secretly arresting Hade during the fight, following Mr. Dwyer's instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The detective is involved in the arrest of Hade, identifying him as a burglar, and handling the situation.&lt;SEP&gt;A detective, implied by the bass voice of an officer, is involved in law enforcement activities, including questioning and investigation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f402c259d546a1b4619eed5b798473c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b764a3bbaaf870d7b877a3d4dd4fea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
