      <data key="d2">Simon's wife is characterized as a quiet but strong woman, involved in community affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;The burglar states he has not seen his wife for seven years.&lt;SEP&gt;The wife is a character who moved West after being separated from the burglar, taking a different name, and believes her husband is away at sea.&lt;SEP&gt;The wife of the narrator, involved in personal matters such as being told about a robbery and accompanying him to various locations.</data>
