    <node id="Heart">
      <data key="d0">Heart</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The heart is a vital organ located in the chest responsible for pumping blood.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart pumps blood carrying nutrients and oxygen to different parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart is a muscular organ in the chest responsible for pumping blood through the body's arteries and veins.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart pumps blood throughout the body, transporting food and removing waste matter.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart is a vital organ that pumps blood, increasing blood flow and heat production; in children, it beats 80-90 times per minute.</data>
