    </node>
    <node id="Room">
      <data key="d0">Room</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A room is an enclosed space where heat can be retained or lost, affecting indoor temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;The great, empty room is the setting where diamonds and pearls continually fall from Eileen's lips, symbolizing her captivity and task.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c40e9d9d6bed631bcdf0022bea513804&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b764a3bbaaf870d7b877a3d4dd4fea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6382719bf2a33d3d4896d4297865f815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-741254ee870941013c032a0acf8e5a3c</data>
