    <node id="Greely Party">
      <data key="d0">Greely Party</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Greely Party was a group of explorers who were stranded and struggled for survival in the Arctic, with some members dying from starvation and freezing.</data>
