    <node id="Snipes">
      <data key="d0">Snipes</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Snipes is a character who is a trailer working to shadow counterfeit money suspects, and he is short and patient, skilled at following targets without recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Snipes is a young boy, a trailer, who interacts with the old countryman, providing assistance and curiosity about the old man's purpose.&lt;SEP&gt;A character involved in law enforcement or investigative work, who interacts with the Old Man and shows a conflicted sense of sympathy and duty.&lt;SEP&gt;A character who assists Mr. Wolfe in managing the old man's situation, and later watches for signals from a room.</data>
