      <data key="d2">The foreman oversees the compositors and manages the printing and setting of newspaper pages.&lt;SEP&gt;A character connected with the ranch, who provides information about Colonel Starbottle's accident and motives.&lt;SEP&gt;The foreman is a character who discusses political prejudices, possible motives for a shooting, and interacts with the editor regarding local conflicts and racial prejudices.</data>
