    <node id="Hade">
      <data key="d0">Hade</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hade is implied to be a murderer whose likeness is recognized in the man with the cane, indicating a criminal background.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a criminal suspect who is targeted for arrest by police based on Gallegher’s investigation, and he is to be taken to New York on the owl train.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a criminal, specifically a murderer, targeted for arrest by the police based on reliable information.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a sporting man, present at a sporting event, and appears to be in deep anxiety and fearful of danger.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a murderer involved in a confrontation with a detective, attempting to escape and pleading for his life.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is an individual associated with the arrest Gallegher reports, possibly involved in or related to the story.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8cf348102921436615f31eec7112c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e16494586d22295a6c919157d0e2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb89e395db2f7954657670627549f945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9701c89d5a5f839dbe13d1fa16e90400</data>
