      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The newspaper serves as the medium publishing the story and news about the arrest and the boy's report.&lt;SEP&gt;The newspaper reports a murder of Pike McGonegal by Raegen, triggering Raegen's panic.&lt;SEP&gt;The Newspaper, delivered by Blore, contains news about the fire at the Swan Inn and the restoration efforts of the Minster Spire.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8cf348102921436615f31eec7112c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61dde207aadfc85a27cb8a00cafa88c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa7fe44d59dc239da3ab02f4386d15f</data>
