    <node id="Gallegher">
      <data key="d0">Gallegher</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gallegher is a multifaceted character depicted primarily as a young, intelligent, and cheerful office-boy with a notable enthusiasm for crime stories and investigative activities. He is portrayed as a keen observer and reasoning detective, often engaging in investigative and clandestine endeavors to uncover truths and apprehend suspects. Throughout various narratives, Gallegher exhibits curiosity and resourcefulness—attempting to follow suspicious individuals, devising plans to enter secret locations such as barns, and advising others during confrontations to lie down for safety or strategic purposes. He displays strong involvement in police investigations, actively participating in criminal cases, and demonstrating a clear aptitude for deduction, observation, and undercover work.

In addition to his role as an investigator, Gallegher is depicted as a connoisseur of crime, capable of assessing the terror and emotions of suspects during arrest scenes. In some stories, he is portrayed as a boy involved in nighttime escapes, showing quickness, fear, and resourcefulness while navigating dark and cold environments or fleeing from authorities. He is also represented as a young cab driver caught in a police chase, experiencing emotional distress, guilt, and tension during pursuit, as well as someone who reports critical news stories — notably about Dwyer — often persevering through challenging weather conditions like rain, and receiving support from editors. 

Overall, Gallegher embodies the archetype of a curious, intelligent youth who actively participates in detective work, law enforcement activities, and journalistic endeavors, marked by his observational skills, bravery, and persistent involvement in criminal investigations and associated situations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cbdb1784d5abfa2c6e504b83145f474b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cf348102921436615f31eec7112c69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4861f1f36dbc583ebdad31a4a80a0aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a504f361c734f54d3814cb24dcdf2588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e16494586d22295a6c919157d0e2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb89e395db2f7954657670627549f945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9701c89d5a5f839dbe13d1fa16e90400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338c0bd1be2adb8d03c1f197c7477a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6133dbc706b714aa574e1c7d296379a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
