      <data key="d2">Rags is a character who cares for a baby, struggles with his circumstances, and attempts to take care of her using limited resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is a character experiencing fear and concern for a baby in a tenement, showing compassion and anxiety about their situation.&lt;SEP&gt;A central character in the scene, involved in a confrontation and holding a baby against his breast.</data>
