    <node id="Baby">
      <data key="d0">Baby</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The baby is a mysterious child with trusting eyes, a torn dress, and soft features, who interacts gently with Raegen in a dark, oppressive environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Baby is a fragile infant suffering from apparent health issues, in critical need of aid, and is being cared for by Rags.&lt;SEP&gt;A young child lying on dirty bedding, unconscious and with dark rims around her eyes, whom He worries about and considers protecting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Baby is a sleeping child who is cared for by Raegen, symbolizing innocence and dependency.</data>
