    <node id="Sergeant">
      <data key="d0">Sergeant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sergeant is a law enforcement officer who might be contacted if Rags leaves the baby alone, indicating law enforcement presence.&lt;SEP&gt;A sergeant of the Twenty-first Precinct station-house, who is on duty, reading papers, and interacts with the young man seeking help for the baby while maintaining authority.&lt;SEP&gt;A military or police officer who is leading the scene and interacting with other characters about a person named Rags, pointing with a cigar.</data>
