    <node id="Van Bibber">
      <data key="d0">Van Bibber</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Van Bibber is a multifaceted character depicted primarily as a young, observant, and morally upright individual engaged in various social and urban settings. He is characterized by his punctilious nature, often attentively observing social scenes and commenting on manners and etiquette, reflecting a keen awareness of social dynamics. Throughout different narratives, Van Bibber displays a range of traits, including friendliness, anxiety, compassion, and moral integrity.

He actively participates in social gatherings, attempting to host guests and engaging with diverse characters, which highlights his social involvement and desire to foster connections. Van Bibber demonstrates a good-hearted disposition, often expressing dissatisfaction or dejection about certain situations, yet he remains attentive and ready to assist others, such as offering help to children riding a swan-boat or intervening in situations involving a burglar, where he exhibits bravery and moral consideration. His interactions extend to listening carefully to conversations, reflecting his attentive and intellectual nature.

As a narrator and character, Van Bibber observes city life, urban mysteries, and social events with a keen eye, offering commentary on social customs and reflecting on his surroundings. He is involved in actions such as helping organize a wedding secretly, showcasing resourcefulness and managerial skills. He also considers the media aspect of social events, contemplating sending news to newspapers about weddings. Overall, Van Bibber embodies a conscientious, observant, and morally grounded individual who actively engages with and reflects on the social and urban environments around him.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d396656b7a9adc61cd46a6601bf39f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d045712dd6297ccc766194a43dd1e1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-510759579f956294cdeeaa5d655b240a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a153cb7b9391cf379df3e7c95f4a0916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dc1b3bed5fc2f671459f1471fbaec93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9adeb7b96786740ff28d105d890a682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabf392a8dc10b75e57591c9eaef5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0066c5bf0b9556e8dbf377cb70d93bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7196deec353a5499b089c79c1d6267a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce275f5f1e049ce82f2c5c025f7d225</data>
