      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Raegen is a character who experiences fear, curiosity, and emotional responses while interacting with a mysterious baby in a tense, dark setting.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a person who is involved in a scene where they are being slapped and mocked, and who is unaware of their family members' situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a character aware of his own pride, guilt, and responsibility, experiencing remorse and internal conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is an individual attempting to escape law enforcement, hiding in a building, and contemplating his situation and surroundings.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a character involved in a chase, who later Surrenders himself, reflecting on his actions and relationship with the child.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a man who claims to have given himself up and expresses feelings of sacrifice and sacrifice for the child's well-being.</data>
