      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hefflefinger is a police officer or detective whom Gallegher contacts to assist in making an arrest during a criminal investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Detective Hefflefinger was a detective from Inspector Byrnes's staff, assisting in investigations related to burglaries and the Burrbank murder.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a character who considers in silence and agrees unconditionally with the interlocutor's terms.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a person who notices Hade and reacts to his presence.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a detective or police officer who intervenes in the fight, attempts to arrest Hade, and identifies him as a burglar.</data>
