    <node id="Don Pancho">
      <data key="d0">Don Pancho</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Don Pancho is a person running the imprenta (printing house), involved in local affairs, and connected to the girl’s story.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Pancho is implied to be an individual possibly associated with the scene, indicated by the name and context of attending and observing.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Pancho is a friend of Enriquez, whom he plans to introduce to his relatives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-983c3121bab55d6241eb5cc8fc2c7e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39facf182f4a5fa24e4d960518506e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da89bc3630f36b6cbbe16af85499c868</data>
