    <node id="Colonel Starbottle">
      <data key="d0">Colonel Starbottle</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Colonel Starbottle is a character involved in a minor physical altercation, described as a war-horse of the Democracy, with injuries from a fall.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character involved in an accident, reportedly mauled by a horse, and is being examined for injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;A character who is peppery, proud, and defensive about his riding accident, and aware of the true cause of his injury.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character involved in an accident, around which the narrative revolves, and is associated with a mysterious attack.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character who has been attacked by unknown assailants, prompting investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character associated with a past adventure potentially linked to a supernatural or mysterious event.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character who was attacked by a villain and involved in a scuffle outside a stable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5c3192b9c02efed1ebf7f051668ef4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb288cc5cdf5e2f7303baa299bb0ad65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a98afa31aca72fe4aab8a13ac827087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f0e749dd81bb72653818dcda1429c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d150a10447892f2c120d9177a582b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95e6739a3f9c1faec768c8e1da6afbee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ed4a41d002be4d709987578e79d2381</data>
