    <node id="Hiram Tarbox">
      <data key="d0">Hiram Tarbox</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hiram Tarbox is a resident who helped in removing an obstruction, and was praised in a newspaper report for his assistance during the robbery.&lt;SEP&gt;Hiram Tarbox is an old man who reacts with wonder upon reading a paragraph and is involved in a conversation about a girl and a location.&lt;SEP&gt;Hiram Tarbox is a land and timber agent who interacts with Brice, providing information and reactions.</data>
