    <node id="Mrs. Tarbox">
      <data key="d0">Mrs. Tarbox</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Tarbox is the wife of Hiram Tarbox who explains details about Miss Flora's departure and the location of the girl's home.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Tarbox is an elderly woman accompanying Mr. Tarbox, planning to send Flo to a convent school.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Tarbox is a character who interacts with Mr. Brice, suggesting social connections and involvement in community life.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Tarbox is a character who enters the scene, prompting further conversation and revealing social interactions.</data>
