      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The trail is a narrow, hidden path used by Harry to come and go, significant for clandestine travel.&lt;SEP&gt;The trail is a pathway used by Bray and others, central to their travel and mishaps during the expedition.</data>
