    <node id="The Mountain">
      <data key="d0">The Mountain</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The mountain rises on the right side of the road, forming a geographic feature integral to the route description.&lt;SEP&gt;The mountain is a significant elevated landform with sheer flanks and fissures, forming part of their route.&lt;SEP&gt;The mountain is the setting for the trail and the prospecting activities, including the ascent to the summit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c292374d14be4a74f9ce167fd44fac75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23988f8971ff678705dc6850b00e995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756f3fee704ba50d913f51c963d929b8</data>
