      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The stage road is a main route crossing the mountain, with a bridge and nearby trail used for travel and escape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stage Road is a pathway that crosses over a high bridge and runs through the geographic setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The stage road is a thoroughfare in the mining region, affected by dust and weather, used by Bray and others to travel.</data>
