      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bill is a character involved in guiding and influencing the stagecoach journey, exhibiting arbitrary authority and a rough demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;Bill is a character implied to be rough and possibly involved in conflicts or confrontations in the story context.&lt;SEP&gt;Bill, also known as Yuba Bill, is a character involved in a train robbery scenario, exhibiting toughness and leadership qualities.</data>
