      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Neworth is a character who has gone to Sacramento; his absence affects the characters' plans and emotional states, and he is connected to the scene through his relation to Eugenia.&lt;SEP&gt;Neworth is a capitalist who brings his daughter and auntie to visit the claim, leading to a delayed exploration.</data>
