      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Sacramento is mentioned as a reference point for an "organ" in a metaphor about style, possibly a city or used figuratively.&lt;SEP&gt;Sacramento is a city to which Cissy plans to go with her popper, and where the Young Man is expected to go.&lt;SEP&gt;Sacramento is the city where the capitalist had to go without completing his examination of the claim.</data>
