    <node id="Eugenia">
      <data key="d0">Eugenia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eugenia is a woman involved in a dangerous situation on a mountain trail, demonstrating panic and concern for safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a woman who shows calmness and self-possession while being in a situation of apparent danger and interacting with Bray and her relatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a woman involved in an accident related to water and the mountain spring; her condition and fate are a concern for Bray and others, and she is associated with the mountain's landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a person whose fall track was recognized by Bray and is associated with the incident at the spring.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a character involved in a humorous encounter with Bray at her garden, showing emotions of embarrassment and amusement.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is the woman who wrote the secret note, conveyed it secretly to the spring, and is associated with the measure "gill."</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e2a8b85600c9b93c41e1de4a3d4b5111&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-473583b267a80d2881e2109a61eebd23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62f7c229133b785c33c0752beee30042&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16c3d4e8746089c4d81af0b1b15cc460&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61d5043e124aeb47926ce7d455548eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c2f9673888c529900ab3645a73c1a5</data>
