    <node id="Brice">
      <data key="d0">Brice</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Brice is a multifaceted young man portrayed across various contexts and narratives. He is depicted as a nervous yet dutiful individual involved in dangerous activities such as train and stagecoach robberies, demonstrating a sense of responsibility amid perilous circumstances. As a journalist, Brice investigates and reports on criminal events, employing stratagems to shape public perception. He discusses and examines the theft of a treasure, expressing feelings of gloom and bitterness about the situation, which indicates his reflective and possibly conflicted nature.

In addition to his involvement in criminal investigations, Brice seeks romantic connections, notably aiming to meet Miss Flora. He carries a dispatch bag, emphasizing his unarmed and harmless stature, and engages in social and romantic exchanges marked by embarrassment, amusement, and remorse. His interactions often reflect respect and admiration for others, especially toward a girl he observes and interacts with, highlighting his courteous personality.

Brice also undertakes dangerous quests, navigating through wilderness and confronting obstacles, showcasing resilience and courage. His narrative activities include finding stolen treasures, collaborating with characters such as Snapshot Harry, and formulating plans to recover stolen money from robbers. He interacts with a masked assassin and demonstrates resilience amid tense situations, further emphasizing his bravery.

Throughout various interactions, Brice displays a range of emotions—from embarrassment and amusement to remorse—especially in social settings and romantic pursuits. He writes letters, seeks information about a girl and her relationships, and reflects on their circumstances, portraying him as an observant and reflective individual involved in multiple facets of adventure, investigation, and personal relationships. Overall, Brice embodies a young man characterized by courage, curiosity, social sensitivity, and a complex interplay of moral and emotional qualities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c292374d14be4a74f9ce167fd44fac75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d676579a483a55e2f4c7affcb1119b87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7ff57f304f2f9a7115f81e63308f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877fe45c6401558fe8c7151af1610858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adcbf578ddc135aad9c7e04e8b9b6a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4e0e93af7a65231c6de3fff16732002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a39ca7189334a306c9d69035b73b7c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9acbfccf8366a087281ca4b18a20425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed354bb280cbffcac2022b4b1028429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05353b2557d1d709496b03e000178076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18f342829bd53e5ab827365876b127db</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
