      <data key="d0">Mr. Calton</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Calton is a patient recovering from injury, whose interactions with nurses and staff hint at romantic interest and gratitude.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is a man who seeks advice regarding his brother's engagement and is influenced by Miss Trotter's opinions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is a visitor who is concerned about his brother's engagement and exhibits a blunt, somewhat aggressive attitude in the conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is a character who observes and comments on the emotional states of others, particularly involving Miss Trotter and her brother.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is the husband of Mrs. Calton, described as very jolly, somewhat spoiled by women, and currently away on an excursion.&lt;SEP&gt;A man who is the patient of Miss Trotter and is preparing to leave for San Francisco for medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d20169574265502212f8d8141c5d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e9467a128fbb05bbbd0b3f83043bf0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
