    </node>
    <node id="Roanoke Ledge">
      <data key="d0">Roanoke Ledge</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Roanoke Ledge is a company associated with Chris Calton, whose partners and members visit him during his recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;The Roanoke Ledge is a location described as very rich and connected to the context of Mr. Calton's stay and Frida's jewelry.&lt;SEP&gt;Roanoke Ledge is the place associated with Mr. Calton's brother, who is a convalescent man.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d62b651cba5b4535bee8d39106989519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
