      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Enriquez is a character discussing his family history, relations, and historical accounts related to land and heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Enriquez is a character who discusses superstitions and shares a superstition related to a devil and a ghostly figure, showing belief or knowledge of local legend.</data>
