    <node id="San Francisco">
      <data key="d0">San Francisco</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">San Francisco is referenced as the place where Montagu Trixit is believed to be temporarily residing.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is a city in California where the Excelsior Bank was located before suspension due to financial irregularities.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is a city mentioned as the origin of the detectives hunting Montagu Trixit.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is the city where Bray plans to seek Eugenia and where the Neworth residence is located.&lt;SEP&gt;A city in California, where Mr. Calton plans to go for medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62f7c229133b785c33c0752beee30042&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad738bff487d23177d83fb82c2acac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528da169951df090df4de0824ef7109b</data>
