    <node id="Flo">
      <data key="d0">Flo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Flo is a young girl, confident and mischievous, claiming relation to Snapshot Harry.&lt;SEP&gt;Flo is a girl whose audacity and beauty are highlighted; she interacts with her relatives and others using humor and confidence.&lt;SEP&gt;Flo is a woman who may wander out of bounds if she gets lonesome, as warned by the woman.&lt;SEP&gt;Flo is the niece of Snapshot Harry, appearing briefly during the interaction but not actively participating.&lt;SEP&gt;Flo is a young girl placed in a convent school, related to Harry Dimwood.&lt;SEP&gt;Flo is a girl, niece of Harry Dimwood, involved in a personal and romantic context with the narrator and Harry.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad7ff57f304f2f9a7115f81e63308f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adcbf578ddc135aad9c7e04e8b9b6a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7abe56fa54a521b5e22094fb8e7a464b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31bf429f0dc25fb5648441a98c5b3697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed354bb280cbffcac2022b4b1028429</data>
