    <node id="The Cliff">
      <data key="d0">The Cliff</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cliff is a sheer vertical rock face around the hollow and canyon area.&lt;SEP&gt;The cliff is a towering, fissured rock formation that the characters observe.&lt;SEP&gt;The cliff provides access to the Devil's Frying-pan and offers scenic views of the coastline and sea.&lt;SEP&gt;The cliff is a natural feature where the figures are climbing, offering a scenic view and a vantage point.</data>
