    <node id="Mexican">
      <data key="d0">Mexican</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mexican is associated with the native or Spanish-California heritage, also admired by Saltillo.&lt;SEP&gt;Indigenous people of Mexico, historically known for their use of bells called _yotl_ and their rich cultural practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Mexican pertains to Mexico and traditional instruments originating from or used there.</data>
