    <node id="Miss Trotter">
      <data key="d0">Miss Trotter</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Miss Trotter is a multifaceted character portrayed as a practical, composed, and tactful woman who often assumes roles of caregiving, observation, and social management. She is primarily depicted as working at a hotel or domestic setting where she attends to patients and manages domestic staff and guests. In her role as a nurse or caregiver, she demonstrates kindness, self-awareness, and clear-sightedness, tending to the well-being of a patient and showing a natural aptitude for mediating social and emotional interactions.

Despite her outward appearance of social distinction and noble connections—implied to be associated with nobility, a millionaire, or a statesman—she is actually described as a poor girl who was once a teacher, highlighting a background of independence and modest origins. She possesses a sense of dignity and always conducts herself with calmness and logical reasoning, establishing herself as an influential and intelligent figure within her social environment. Her influence extends to her surroundings, affecting perceptions and interactions, and she is regarded as tactful and sophisticated.

Miss Trotter’s character exhibits emotional complexity, experiencing embarrassment and anger at times, and engaging in intricate emotional exchanges with other characters. She perceives deception, feels shock and curiosity regarding Mr. Bilson’s feelings, and is involved in personal and emotional development, including caring for her brother and managing her evolving personal style. She plays an active role in social and romantic matters, acting as a confidante and mediator, and is often involved in dialogues that involve love, social engagement, and personal relationships.

Additionally, she interacts with notable characters like the baroness and provides information about others such as Mrs. Bilson and Mr. Calton. Her actions include leaving unexpectedly due to events like receiving a telegram and later visiting a foreign spa, where her aristocratic bearing and social influence remain evident. Overall, Miss Trotter is portrayed as a calm, intelligent, and socially influential woman capable of managing complex emotional and social dynamics with tact and discernment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d20169574265502212f8d8141c5d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e9467a128fbb05bbbd0b3f83043bf0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18b6fa9a2e2b728d65fdd7990b785f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ef285556657679cada764bf06d06980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d62b651cba5b4535bee8d39106989519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d2f3fca937ba86ebd935c1763ab116</data>
