    <node id="Masterton">
      <data key="d0">Masterton</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Masterton is a character involved in an investigation involving Chinese workers and secret communications, reflecting a sense of adventure and conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a passenger on the vehicle who expresses optimism about passing the storm and discusses strategies with others.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a reflective and somewhat superstitious man who is seeking to follow a fugitive, demonstrating observational skills and a sense of providence.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character observing snow and involved in a narrative about pursuit and investigation in the story.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character involved in a pursuit at high elevation, riding a horse over crusted snow, attempting to catch a fugitive.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who helps and interacts with another character, involved in a story about a rescue and personal reflection.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who interacts with the girl and is involved in a situation where he is dressed after a fall and reflects on his recovery.</data>
