    <node id="Chris">
      <data key="d0">Chris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chris is a young man who is pleading for help to win Frida's trust and love, showing affection and desperation.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a character who has a brother involved in an engagement, and he is introduced as the brother of the stranger visitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a young man who initially intends to speak with Frida alone, then changes his mind and ultimately relays a message about seeing her.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a man who experienced disappointment and unhappiness due to his unreciprocated affection and is related to the marriage news.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a male character who has recently recovered or improved physically and emotionally, and is under Miss Trotter's care.</data>
