    <node id="Yuba Bill">
      <data key="d0">Yuba Bill</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Yuba Bill is a multifaceted character primarily depicted as a coach driver and gang member involved in stagecoach robbery activities. As a coach driver, Yuba Bill skillfully guides his coach through obstacles, sometimes exhibiting irritability and haste during tense situations. Despite the stress, he is recognized for his coolness and humor, especially noted during a robbery incident where he maintains composure and reports the event to his company. 

Yuba Bill is also portrayed as a seasoned and loyal member of a gang involved in coach robberies, with a reputation for control and involvement in criminal endeavors. His character displays a rotten demeanor and has experienced being robbed twice within a short timespan, emphasizing his perilous and treacherous environment. Additionally, Yuba Bill is shown to analyze theft incidents cautiously, harbor suspicion towards Harry, and consider gang betrayal, indicating a strategic and analytical persona within the criminal circle.

Beyond his role in criminal activities, Yuba Bill appears to have social connections, including a friendship with a girl, likely within her social circle. He also plays a role in financial dealings related to his illicit activities, reporting significant recoveries such as Brice’s recovery of stolen money to his employer or gang associates. Overall, Yuba Bill combines his skills as a coach driver with deeper involvement in gang operations, exhibiting a complex personality shaped by the tensions of his criminal life and social interactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-877fe45c6401558fe8c7151af1610858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adcbf578ddc135aad9c7e04e8b9b6a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecaf8705a36ced04ac0a85e9fbe1431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a39ca7189334a306c9d69035b73b7c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31bf429f0dc25fb5648441a98c5b3697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398ac320ee8a237290740b6caa93b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05353b2557d1d709496b03e000178076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18f342829bd53e5ab827365876b127db</data>
