      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Montagu Trixit is a wealthy financier involved in the Comstock deal, described as an "Napoleon of finance" who makes large profits quickly.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is a prosperous financier known for successful speculative deals, including a recent profitable 'Comstock' deal.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is the father of Cissy Trixit, accused of stealing money from his bank and fleeing, revealing the central conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is associated with a bank scandal, fleeing the state, and being in hiding after defalcations and suspensions.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is a suspect wanted by law enforcement, known for knowing too much and possibly hiding nearby.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is a resolute-faced man who shows concern for Masterton and interacts with him about the girl and their circumstances.</data>
