    <node id="Frida">
      <data key="d0">Frida</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Frida is a young woman involved in a romantic relationship with Chris Calton and the subject of social considerations regarding marriage.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a young girl who is the subject of Chris's concern, with potential attractiveness and the possibility of doubt regarding trust and love.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a young girl characterized by her smart pink calico gown, long yellow braids, and a slight furtiveness in her behavior, often evading observation.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a woman linked to Mr. Bilson's past attentions and the revelations concerning her relationship with Chris.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a girl whom Mr. Bilson claimed not to love and who is implied to be the object of his previous interest or flirtation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d18b6fa9a2e2b728d65fdd7990b785f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ef285556657679cada764bf06d06980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52</data>
