      <data key="d0">Doctor Duchesne</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Doctor Duchesne is a medical professional who examined Mr. Bilson, interacted with Miss Trotter, and was involved in Mr. Bilson's illusion regarding his feelings.</data>
