    <node id="Fleming">
      <data key="d0">Fleming</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Fleming is an experienced prospector who attempts to find gold using pans and analyzes soil samples during prospecting.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a young man involved in a rural setting who interacts with a girl and comments on her appearance and circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a character who is involved in discovering and interpreting a secret related to gold flakes and a broken pan, displaying curiosity and loyalty.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a character engaged in gold prospecting, planning to verify his good fortune and collaborating with a girl named Katinka.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a character engaged in a search for gold, who experiences moments of humor, sorrow, and affection in the story.&lt;SEP&gt;A prospector who is attempting to find gold by excavating the bank and discovering a gold-bearing quartz fragment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-465f5ac022d97e69f2dc45fc7598aa7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c87d89cd1180b8d6a006229057edd6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1556645e734e01c75f40b96c3891db6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc84603f0e7bd28396f7db8ef2147e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f63b767c145ecd1c5412e2a9760c7ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe5e597e938a83f367d9ee15997a5a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb9da5c2b7a4ec99cfef1dba35a808b</data>
