      <data key="d0">Faulkner</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Faulkner is a partner of John Fleming involved in mining and interactions with others in the camp.&lt;SEP&gt;Faulkner is Fleming's partner who discreetly withdraws when Fleming receives a folded paper, and who conveys the conviction about Fleming borrowing a pan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-465f5ac022d97e69f2dc45fc7598aa7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb9da5c2b7a4ec99cfef1dba35a808b</data>
