    <node id="Canada City">
      <data key="d0">Canada City</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Canada City is a vibrant and historically significant town characterized by its lively main street, which features shops, saloons, offices, mills, civic processions, and a mixture of old and new civic structures. It is a small but bustling community known for its lively social activities and industrial environment. The city is also associated with wealth and importance within its setting, serving as the backdrop for various story events and legal proceedings involving families such as Cissy's.

In addition to its economic and social features, Canada City holds particular narrative significance as the setting where the story unfolds. It includes key locations such as a church, where the narrator's dream occurs, indicating its role as a place of initial appearance and personal reflection. The city is also linked to notable historical and legal scandals, including a branch bank involved in a securities scandal and a location connected to the search for Montagu Trixit.

Overall, Canada City functions as a multifaceted community, embodying industrial activity, social vibrancy, and pivotal moments within the narrative landscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad738bff487d23177d83fb82c2acac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e5a1f05827b42a336baccdd4933d843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d33f750152b448ae4f9c436cea1e2ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4445c33b34de7a646c3ea3917fa7ec89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f28d427b11836c753976864f6f1ca0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fed08294c7c286ca4d4684d894e58fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528da169951df090df4de0824ef7109b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55f2017ea201712ef7efcf70b6477640</data>
