      <data key="d2">The pan is a bread pan used by Fleming for prospecting soil samples, battered and broken but serving its purpose in gold washing.&lt;SEP&gt;The pan borrowed by Tinka is a shiny object used for a humorous or symbolic gesture.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pan is a digging tool used by Fleming and Katinka to separate gold from soil in the prospecting process.</data>
