      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fairy represents Katinka’s playful role as a good luck charm or mascot for Fleming during his gold search.&lt;SEP&gt;The fairy is a magical entity who grants wishes, with the ability to bless or ban, and is part of the story’s mythic elements.&lt;SEP&gt;The fairy is a spiritual guide who issues a warning to Eileen about a potentially regretful wish and provides her with words of caution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fairy is a mystical being who imparts wisdom to Eily about the true value of treasures and kindness.</data>
