      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Mother Brindle is a cow who comments on the character of the pasture, mentioning the "character" of the scattered plants.&lt;SEP&gt;Mother Brindle is a cow who dismisses the red cow's claims and offers practical advice, standing by the fence and talking to a neighbor's black cow.&lt;SEP&gt;Mother Brindle is a cow who dismisses the red cow's claims about the moon and advises her to calm down.</data>
