      <data key="d0">Mrs. Cow</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Cow is an animal that embodies ignorance of social matters, as contrasted with the raccoon.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Cow is a character characterized as a gentle and kind animal, offering a bell and involved in farmyard activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Cow is mentioned as a domestic animal with whom Cracker's family has some connection, possibly involving living style.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Cow is a character in a story told by the squirrel, about a cow that jumped over the moon.</data>
