    <node id="DW53">
      <data key="d0">DW53</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">DW53 is a raccoon character who feels ashamed after recalling Toto's laughter and is engaged in household chores.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is a raccoon feeling melancholy after losing a piece of squash pie, with feelings of sadness and remorse.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is a raccoon character who interacts with other animals, inquiring about mice and attending a wedding, characterized by curiosity and social engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is an astute character who observes the activities, understanding the errors, and watches the others practice their dance steps.&lt;SEP&gt;A person mentioned by Bruin, possibly a caretaker or figure of authority, who comments on manners.</data>
