    <node id="Eily">
      <data key="d0">Eily</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eily is an alternative name for Eileen, who is involved in gathering sticks and is momentarily believed to be bewitched.&lt;SEP&gt;Eily is a young girl who is referred to by others, shows courtesy, and wishes for a fairy's blessing with a wish.&lt;SEP&gt;Eily is a young girl involved in a story about stolen jewels, possessing a mischievous and innocent character, and describing her experience of gathering sticks and encountering a Grane Man.&lt;SEP&gt;Eily is a young girl who receives gifts from a fairy and learns about the value of kindness and loving heart.&lt;SEP&gt;Eily is a young Irish girl who is trying to find her powers of speech and has a shrewdness beyond her years.&lt;SEP&gt;Eily is a young woman who is associated with jewels, pearls, and diamonds, and later marries the Count of Kilmoggan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd206869da90eebb876c5d939eb3db11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-741254ee870941013c032a0acf8e5a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18e461c485518cf17be5255f813a6f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eebe7d0e7c476207c5a2e37fa90ec16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06483977a7363972851107fedf6ac233</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613385</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Honor">
      <data key="d0">Honor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Honor is a character who reacts with shock and disbelief to the story about jewels and the circumstances surrounding their theft.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613385</data>
