    <node id="Dennis Macarthy">
      <data key="d0">Dennis Macarthy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dennis Macarthy is Eileen's father who examines the shiny objects and ultimately concludes they are jewelry, not buttons.&lt;SEP&gt;Dennis Macarthy is a man who expresses anger and sorrow over his child allegedly stealing jewels, and his suspicion and concern about the case.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18e461c485518cf17be5255f813a6f1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613385</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Phelim">
      <data key="d0">Phelim</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Phelim is a young boy who reacts excitedly when shiny objects fall from Eileen's mouth and helps his father examine them.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is a character who interacts with his parents regarding the arrival of Doctor O'Shaughnessy and the situation involving the jewels.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is a young child, presumably Eileen's sibling, who shares a shared life with her at home.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is mentioned as Eileen's connection to her parents and is a figure she hopes to reunite with someday.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6382719bf2a33d3d4896d4297865f815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a96c6566abc9d6c8f4e98b738e911a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18e461c485518cf17be5255f813a6f1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613385</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Doctor O'Shaughnessy">
      <data key="d0">Doctor O'Shaughnessy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Doctor O'Shaughnessy is a character who previously claimed that fairies do not exist, providing a skeptical viewpoint.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctor O'Shaughnessy is a medical professional who examines the jewels and Eileen, diagnosing the case as possibly bewitched and discussing potential cures.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctor O'Shaughnessy is a character who is involved in a royal dream and a situation involving his daughter.&lt;SEP&gt;Doctor O'Shaughnessy is a physician summoned for an urgent medical case involving a patron who fell from a horse.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd206869da90eebb876c5d939eb3db11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eebe7d0e7c476207c5a2e37fa90ec16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06483977a7363972851107fedf6ac233</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613385</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="The Countess">
      <data key="d0">The Countess</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Countess is a noble figure whose jewels are believed to have been stolen and used by Eily, and her jewelry is central to the suspicion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2</data>
