    <node id="The Jewels">
      <data key="d0">The Jewels</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Jewels are a collection of diamonds and pearls believed to belong to the Countess, which are mysteriously involved in the story and presumed stolen.&lt;SEP&gt;The jewels are a collection of shining, valuable items including pearls and diamonds, stored on the floor, representing wealth and splendor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-741254ee870941013c032a0acf8e5a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c208d3742c721b6f2059142bc06cd9</data>
