      <data key="d0">Spidher's Web</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Spidher's Wib (web) is a metaphorical element involved in Eily’s story of rescuing the Grane Man, symbolizing danger or entrapment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2</data>
