      <data key="d2">King Sligo is a monarch who possesses riches and a kind heart, central to the story involving a useful coal.&lt;SEP&gt;King Sligo is the monarch who plans to test his court by using a black coal to simulate a theft and to identify the culprit through a hand-raising test.</data>
