    <node id="Golden Dragon">
      <data key="d0">Golden Dragon</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Golden Dragon is a colossal, ornamental idol, symbolizing sacred power, adorned with precious gems and gold scales.&lt;SEP&gt;A mythic dragon with ruby eyes and a crowned head, calling Wah-Song to wake and speaking sternly to him.&lt;SEP&gt;The Golden Dragon is a fierce, commanding creature who issues orders to Wah-Song and demands ways to save Ly-Chee.&lt;SEP&gt;The Golden Dragon is a significant creature or symbol that the priests revere, seen sitting up and knocked on by the guards.&lt;SEP&gt;Golden Dragon is referenced in the illustration caption as the source of the rhythmic exclamation "Wah-Song! Wah-Song!"</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e64bd1d5284c29e6cb96bd7c0d5fdad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379dcea462e81fbf4e3f1167499c4c9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667660461b3e82515e6fd43c059be5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc6e32918330eb85b6be8174ed5395a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c80cac977c30ca82e1b9af698fb201</data>
