      <data key="d0">Holy Dragon</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A sacred idol believed to be the divine embodiment of the dragon in the temple, central to faith and prayers.&lt;SEP&gt;A mythical, divine dragon associated with the Emperor, offering protection and involved in a dream sequence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-759c07b9e02ea8da79b447394f2f4c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379dcea462e81fbf4e3f1167499c4c9e</data>
