      <data key="d0">Celestial Majesty</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Celestial Majesty is the Emperor, ruler of the celestial realm, whose actions and presence influence the events and characters in the story.&lt;SEP&gt;The Celestial Majesty is the ruler associated with the Celestial Footstool, overseeing the divine objects and authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8f9814d06b58178385c8b7cffd803ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d</data>
