      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Celestial Shoes are gold embroidered shoes belonging to the Emperor, damaged when Ly-Chee accidentally poured water.&lt;SEP&gt;The Celestial Shoes are embroidered gold shoes worn by the Emperor, destroyed in the incident involving Ly-Chee.</data>
