    <node id="Mr. Ger-Falcon">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Ger-Falcon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Ger-Falcon is the hawk, a noble and proud bird that recounts his family history, regrets the decline of his species due to human fashion, and reflects on the high estate and its fall.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Ger-Falcon is a hawk who is distrustful, proud of his name, and admits to having tried to steal chickens when starving.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-48a12948208c13074a50572b428e264d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2d18b61665def22c8f765c51d5d1fb</data>
