    <node id="Story of the Naughty Comet">
      <data key="d0">Story of the Naughty Comet</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A fictional story Toto shares about a comet, depicting it as a busy, sentient celestial body preparing to start its journey.</data>
