    <node id="Princess">
      <data key="d0">Princess</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A beautiful, wise, and gentle princess with a peculiar restriction of making only three remarks, none of which include personal opinions or announcements.&lt;SEP&gt;A young royal female who is welcomed by the people and questioned by the king about her family.&lt;SEP&gt;The princess is a noble character who is approached by the chieftain, and she exhibits calmness and kindness amid threatening circumstances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-586a7611f02b1deff7ed6b0d6bdd65af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03560b66e85f3d2c8750033a19ea401c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-506f129a6a5da52f9bd4973893d49e50</data>
