      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Red Chief of the Rustywhanger is a band leader who is implied to be an enemy or threat, and who might become a slave if the princess accepts his proposal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-586a7611f02b1deff7ed6b0d6bdd65af</data>
