    <node id="Palace">
      <data key="d0">Palace</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The residence of the princess where she initially lives before running away.&lt;SEP&gt;The palace is a grand, shiny marble and jasper building with beautiful gardens, where the king and princess meet.&lt;SEP&gt;The palace is a prominent structure in the city, standing amidst crooked, uneven streets that are unpaved and dirty in winter, and dusty in summer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-586a7611f02b1deff7ed6b0d6bdd65af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03560b66e85f3d2c8750033a19ea401c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-203f252ae42306fa9f42171f8e2f0f23</data>
