      <data key="d0">The Internet Archive</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Internet Archive is a digital library that provided the images used for the story's production.&lt;SEP&gt;The Internet Archive is a digital library that hosts scanned images and editions of books, providing resources for text transcription and reference.&lt;SEP&gt;The Internet Archive is an organization that made the images available for the production of the digital book.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b99d32a6c4077b81dac5436dc1d07de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c680d4e3c6d389236c61c1ca4a429d6</data>
