      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comet Master is the authoritative figure overseeing the comets' activities and giving instructions for their journeys.&lt;SEP&gt;The governing authority for comets, giving orders and rules that restrict individual freedom among celestial bodies.</data>
