      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A hibernating animal that has fallen asleep for the winter, enclosed in a knitted covering by the grandmother.&lt;SEP&gt;A woodchuck is an animal entangled in a worsted net, trying to free himself and later eating dried beef.&lt;SEP&gt;Woodchuck is an animal who has visited in their own way and shown enjoyment of the visit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678eca288ef7c7d22d1d4c106619b015</data>
