      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A bird that, along with the parrot, is contented sitting on a perch near the grandmother.&lt;SEP&gt;A wood-pigeon is an animal that pulls the net to free the woodchuck and interacts in the playful scene.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd</data>
