      <data key="d2">Woodmouse is a small rodent that interacts cordially with the narrator and is sought for consultation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Woodmouse is a mouse character involved in social activities such as a wedding and conversations about mice relatives, depicted as polite and somewhat confused about recent events.&lt;SEP&gt;The woodmouse is a character observing and commenting on the dancing spectacle and the appearance of the animals.</data>
