      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Emperor of China, called Wah-Song, who falls asleep and dreams of a Golden Dragon, displaying authority and regal attributes.&lt;SEP&gt;Wah-Song is a character who is commanded by the Golden Dragon to issue orders regarding Ly-Chee's pardon and reward.&lt;SEP&gt;Wah-Song is the Celestial Emperor who remains in bed in a state of meekness after illness.</data>
