    <node id="Emperor">
      <data key="d0">Emperor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Emperor is a ruler who has condemned Ly-Chee to death and is commanded by the Golden Dragon to grant pardons and rewards.&lt;SEP&gt;The ruler exercising authority over the Berbers in Rif and Garet.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor's garden refers to a royal garden area, possibly in Mogador, visited during the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor refers to the Moorish authority and political power governing Mogador, influencing decisions about foreign Europeans.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor is a ruler to whom the Governor owes allegiance and duty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f9814d06b58178385c8b7cffd803ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd02a45e5de5d4ef105b2b38ed4ab33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c246ad7923d08e2ef2366af23b4c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c196bdb46661c725027c238489650eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36</data>
