    <node id="Castle">
      <data key="d0">Castle</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The castle refers to the hermit's home, the setting for the animals' gathering and stories.&lt;SEP&gt;The Castle on St. Michael's Mount is a historic fortress associated with legends, ownership by the family of St. Aubyn, and various historical figures.&lt;SEP&gt;Fortress ruins at Tintagel, believed to be royal or legendary strongholds such as King Arthur's castle or Terrabil.</data>
