    <node id="Juruparis">
      <data key="d0">Juruparis</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The _juruparis_ is a mysterious Indian trumpet made of wood, associated with reverence, and used for signaling in warfare, regarded as a demon.&lt;SEP&gt;Juruparis is an indigenous creature known for its use in war, where the chief blows on a wooden trumpet to signal battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7721a00da188d0f25b4e28815001633c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863ecd34d59b90a44bfad0a61b39cd89</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
