      <data key="d0">Sambuca</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The _sambuca_ is a musical instrument, less common and derived from Asia, with unknown exact construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Origin of the name "sackbut," possibly a corruption of the term "sambuca," referring to a musical instrument or related sound.&lt;SEP&gt;Sambuca is a musical instrument, often a stringed or bowed instrument.</data>
