    <node id="Tibia">
      <data key="d0">Tibia</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The _tibia_ is an ancient flute originally made from a shin bone, featuring a mouth-hole and four finger-holes, with variations in shape and construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Tibia is an ancient musical instrument, likely a flute.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d034b0ebc70d115fe140d386b94caa9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502</data>
