    <node id="Exeter Cathedral">
      <data key="d0">Exeter Cathedral</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Exeter Cathedral is notable for its fourteenth-century minstrels’ gallery with sculptures of angels playing musical instruments.&lt;SEP&gt;The site of one of the largest and most renowned peal rings in England.&lt;SEP&gt;Exeter Cathedral is a historic church with tombs, including those of Patteson and the Crusader, featuring medieval religious and architectural significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4839098cd46c452a68e1941bee57dab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001c1f1b3eee1ad8a7fbb7cf02acea78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013f67bf042c7366daa951d89bffb75e</data>
