    <node id="Nareda">
      <data key="d0">Nareda</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nareda is described as the giver of water and is also considered the ruler of clouds.&lt;SEP&gt;Nareda is a Hindu god of music and inventor of the vina, regarded as the principal national instrument of Hindustan.&lt;SEP&gt;Nareda is identified as the inventor of Hindu musical instruments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fb8822d3dfa29a3bb48da5205e0808c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f440a8129c9633e91b0a40eef56e62b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
