    <node id="Instruments">
      <data key="d0">Instruments</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Instruments refer to various musical relics and artifacts from different historical periods, exhibiting different shapes, construction, and ornamentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Various musical instruments are listed, including those of early civilizations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-210eaafae8dea701b360369916174fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ae2e9bd1b638782eb9d45c99ff65a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03c5035205433abd8b211b1d1712aea6</data>
