    <node id="Solomon">
      <data key="d0">Solomon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">King Solomon's temple is linked with Hebrew musical performances and records.&lt;SEP&gt;King Solomon is mentioned as the historical figure since the Jews of the Atlas have inhabited their land since his era.&lt;SEP&gt;Solomon is referenced in relation to the existence of a city where Jews have possessed land since his time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4996254e95ccc6b78afba2bb6b96949</data>
