      <data key="d0">South Kensington</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">South Kensington is a place where collections of ancient instruments, especially from Asiatic countries, are displayed.&lt;SEP&gt;South Kensington is a location where casts of sculptures and specimens of musical instruments are preserved.&lt;SEP&gt;South Kensington is a district in London where the _Vielle_ with monograms of Henry II is housed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001c1f1b3eee1ad8a7fbb7cf02acea78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5adf09848918f402d340b581ef777eb1</data>
