    <node id="Pipe">
      <data key="d0">Pipe</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A pipe from the stone period, made from stag’s-horn, used to produce musical tones.&lt;SEP&gt;Components of the organ, with early organs having about a dozen pipes and some large organs having three octaves.&lt;SEP&gt;Pipe refers to a variety of wind musical instruments, with specific mentions of Mexican and Peruvian pipes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242f71a68c104bb1e671b3e7c72468fa</data>
