    <node id="Ancient Egypt">
      <data key="d0">Ancient Egypt</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ancient Egypt was a civilization known for its advancements in arts, music, and sculpture, with many artifacts and representations of musical instruments preserved in monuments.&lt;SEP&gt;The country of Egypt is renowned for its depictions of musical instruments in sculptures, paintings, and tombs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409162d6c592b356035008418a8c62af</data>
