      <data key="d2">The organistrum is a historical early form of a musical instrument, similar to a harp or lute.&lt;SEP&gt;The _organistrum_ is a stringed instrument operated by a person turning a wheel, depicted in medieval music groups.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c92bbb1fd6ed4d39b3fbf9331923c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5adf09848918f402d340b581ef777eb1</data>
