      <data key="d2">The _hiuen_ is an early Chinese wind instrument made of baked clay with five finger-holes, conforming to the pentatonic scale.&lt;SEP&gt;Hiuen is a curious wind-instrument made of baked clay with five finger-holes, conforming to the pentatonic scale, constructed in an early period.</data>
