      <data key="d2">The _yu_ is a highly valued sonorous stone used to make the _king_, distinguished by its beautiful appearance, hardness, and consistent pitch.&lt;SEP&gt;Yu is the old name of the Cheng wind-instrument.&lt;SEP&gt;Yu is a Chinese stone or wind musical instrument.</data>
