    <node id="Pianoforte">
      <data key="d0">Pianoforte</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The pianoforte is a keyboard musical instrument developed as an evolution of the dulcimer and cembalo, with significant refinement and development over time.&lt;SEP&gt;The pianoforte is a musical instrument invented in the eighteenth century, influential in the development of musical effects.</data>
