      <data key="d0">Alexander the Great</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Alexander the Great was a king of Macedon, known for his military conquests and cultural influence, mentioned as a historical figure in relation to musical occurrences.&lt;SEP&gt;Ancient ruler associated with a story similar to that of Al-Farabi's musical demonstration, recorded in Dryden’s “Alexander’s Feast.”</data>
