      <data key="d0">Tezcatlepoca</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tezcatlepoca was an Aztec divinity associated with the sun and believed to be a deity honored during the religious festival where a flute was broken during a sacrifice.</data>
