    <node id="Confucius">
      <data key="d0">Confucius</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Confucius was a Chinese philosopher who, upon hearing Chinese music, was so enraptured that he did not eat for three months.&lt;SEP&gt;Confucius was a Chinese philosopher who historically referenced the _hiuen-tchung_ as a herald of heaven to proclaim divine purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-afd96cea5225608d5415480cf74f1ac5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0d3d720b9e8db10b828dd12d97de70e</data>
