      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The virginal is a keyboard instrument from the Middle Ages, associated with the development of early keyboard music.&lt;SEP&gt;The virginal is an ancient keyboard instrument, historically esteemed.&lt;SEP&gt;Virginal is a keyboard instrument from the Renaissance period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7452f67f575388f5344a993822f4062&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001c1f1b3eee1ad8a7fbb7cf02acea78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502</data>
