    <node id="Viol">
      <data key="d0">Viol</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The viol is a string instrument held between the knees, with several types differing in size and tuning, used in medieval orchestras.&lt;SEP&gt;The viol is a bowed string instrument with various sizes, used extensively in past centuries.&lt;SEP&gt;Viol is a Spanish stringed instrument, including the da gamba variant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7452f67f575388f5344a993822f4062&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5adf09848918f402d340b581ef777eb1</data>
