    <node id="Machalath">
      <data key="d0">Machalath</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Machalath is presumed to be a name of an instrument related to the lute or guitar family, though its exact nature is uncertain.&lt;SEP&gt;Machalath is thought to be a stringed or percussion musical instrument, possibly a flute, or a mode of performance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7da70d39d1688e8eb35f0af080c5cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18c204bf67b073ba131e7e3917e9d273</data>
