      <data key="d1">people</data>
      <data key="d2">The Etruscans excelled in arts and social refinement, developed similar wind instruments to the Greeks, and are credited with early development or adaptation of musical instruments such as flutes and the hydraulic organ.&lt;SEP&gt;The Etruscans are an ancient Italian civilization skilled in arts and social refinement, credited with developing and influencing wind instruments and musical arts.</data>
