      <data key="d0">Mishrokitha</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The _mishrokitha_ is a small organ with seven pipes and a mouthpiece, possibly a product of imagination reflecting European types.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18c204bf67b073ba131e7e3917e9d273</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764613932</data>
