    <node id="Young Girls">
      <data key="d0">Young Girls</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Four young girls, named after the principal goddesses, served as companions to a sacrificial figure, symbolizing attendants in a ritual.&lt;SEP&gt;The young girls are adventurous, enjoying the sea, and promise not to attempt dangerous climbs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4fea727469cc8526b5cd257ed6247a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d33ad6077f3960deb15ae14cd3cb1</data>
