    <node id="Moroccan Empire">
      <data key="d0">Moroccan Empire</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Moroccan Empire is the subject of geographical, political, and historical description in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moroccan Empire was historically ruled by the Shereefian dynasty and experienced civil wars and divisions following Yezeed's rebellion.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moroccan empire's influence and relations with European powers are discussed historically and diplomatically.&lt;SEP&gt;The Empire of Morocco can be viewed in terms of its extent and influence, including its geographic boundaries and political power.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moroccan Empire historically claimed influence over regions such as Western Sahara, Timbuctoo, and other parts of North Africa.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-680c330ee8036afcbacb673ce690b640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ee1dd105b3b5398ba93ec7c92e6dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614509</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Atlas Mountains">
      <data key="d0">Atlas Mountains</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Atlas Mountains are a mountain range forming part of Morocco's physical geography.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas chain of mountains is a significant geographical feature in Morocco, affecting climate, terrain, and local tribes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are a mountain range in Morocco with tribes inhabiting its regions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are a vast mountain chain traversing Morocco from northeast to southwest, with peaks exceeding 15,000 feet, including the highest point, Miltsin, which is comparable to the highest peaks of the Pyrenees.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f69d89c3a43b14f48ca5e3c600b7a494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ee1dd105b3b5398ba93ec7c92e6dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635</data>
