    <node id="Mequinez">
      <data key="d0">Mequinez</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mequinez is a city in Morocco noted as an imperial city.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez is a royal city in the province of Fez, situated on a hill, known for its ancient origins, fortifications, and wealth.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez is a royal city and stronghold of the Empire, serving as the seat of a kingdom with a population of around one hundred thousand inhabitants.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez is another Moroccan city, closely linked with Fez and collectively home to around one hundred thousand inhabitants.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez (Meknes) is a city known for its olives, with historical significance in Moroccan history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b31b92f9b032efc61f97bef8d8b3ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97d99746fa60d96d3fbab1f89af585c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-203f252ae42306fa9f42171f8e2f0f23</data>
