      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Sidi-Mahammedeah is a location reached during the journey, notable for its remains and proximity to locust swarms.&lt;SEP&gt;Sidi-Mahammedeah is a site with magnificent remains called Udina, reached during the journey.</data>
