      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Momakeeah is a town approximately thirty miles from Sidi-Mahammedeah, visited during the expedition.&lt;SEP&gt;Momakeeah is a town approximately thirty miles from Sidi-Mahammedeah, where the travelers continued their journey.</data>
