    <node id="Bardo">
      <data key="d0">Bardo</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bardo is a place in Tunis where the tourists paid respects to Sidi Mohammed before starting their journey.&lt;SEP&gt;A notable place in the region, known for housing many cages of the Jereed sparrows.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bardo is a location in Tunis where the travelers observed the guard mounting and listened to military music.</data>
