    <node id="Boab">
      <data key="d0">Boab</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Boab is a figure involved in a ritual with a dervish, and is associated with charms and incantations in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boab is a person, possibly a ruler or notable figure, whose wives are mentioned in the context of a narrative or cultural setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boab is a local figure with multiple wives and a role in domestic and marital law according to local customs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f946791371663ec7aa99ab19596abfd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f</data>
