      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Heelet-el-Gazlen is a campsite named after a place where a small stream and bridge are located, part of the journey's route.&lt;SEP&gt;Heelet-el-Gazlen is a place where the camp is set after a march, near a small stream with a damaged bridge.</data>
