    <node id="Saneeates-Sultan">
      <data key="d0">Saneeates-Sultan</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Saneeates-Sultan, also known as Gharset-es-Sultan, is a location situated three or four hours' ride south from Mogador, featuring a small river and a desolate landscape within Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;The Saneeates-Sultan is a valley and garden area near Mogador, with a small river called Wad-el-Kesab.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33cad941dca515ea1feb8e87a23c7dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36</data>
