      <data key="d0">Wad-el-Kesab</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Wad-el-Kesab is a small river that sometimes appears to be dry but can overflow rapidly, illustrating deceptive and unpredictable behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Wad-el-Kesab is a small river in the Saneeates-Sultan valley, crossing with difficulty due to heavy rain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33cad941dca515ea1feb8e87a23c7dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36</data>
