      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Deeabat is a village overlooking the Wad-el-Kesab river, where watch-dogs bark continuously, indicating a settlement in the area.&lt;SEP&gt;Deeabat is a village overlooking the Wad-el-Kesab river within the garden area.</data>
