      <data key="d0">Argan Tree</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Argan tree is a peaceful, patriarchal-looking tree in Morocco, believed to be planted by Okba, symbolizing infinity and shelter.</data>
