    <node id="Camels">
      <data key="d0">Camels</data>
      <data key="d1">animal</data>
      <data key="d2">Camels are used for baggage transport, brought from Tunis, and involved in camp movement.&lt;SEP&gt;Camels are livestock used for labor and transportation, controlled by overseers, with some exported to Sicily.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-983c8bccfafaa4eb3ef49034ee60c8ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232907dd57f71debadc62dcfe71c8543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06d587eba2d4e09716d8ff298c1f8fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6</data>
