    <node id="Mogador">
      <data key="d0">Mogador</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mogador, also known as Essaouira, is a historic port city situated on the Moroccan coast, renowned for its strategic and economic significance. Built by Sidi Mohammed near Fidallah, Mogador has long served as a vital hub for trade, manufacturing, and maritime activities, featuring public squares, marketplaces, and a bustling commercial quarter. Its coastal location makes it a key reference point for regional geography and historical narratives involving interactions between Europeans and Moors.

Throughout its history, Mogador has been the site of significant conflict and upheaval. Notably, it experienced a devastating bombardment that caused widespread destruction, massacres, and harm to its Jewish community. The city endured pillage, chaos, and significant damage during military conflicts, particularly during a siege or attack by French forces, resulting in many buildings being left in ruins and the city suffering extensive devastation. Despite these tumultuous events, Mogador remained a central figure in historical accounts of regional and maritime affairs, with moments where visitors, including narration figures, engaged with local authorities before departing from the city. Overall, Mogador's rich history is marked by its importance as a port, commercial center, and site of conflict and resilience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f946791371663ec7aa99ab19596abfd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd02a45e5de5d4ef105b2b38ed4ab33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33cad941dca515ea1feb8e87a23c7dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02e1fb091464c03ab00842920bc21f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c246ad7923d08e2ef2366af23b4c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4996254e95ccc6b78afba2bb6b96949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57f75296e95e08ee42b21dc84299286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2d548d08b4129bfc47eab34719160b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-203f252ae42306fa9f42171f8e2f0f23</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614528</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
