    <node id="Bey of the Camp">
      <data key="d0">Bey of the Camp</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bey of the Camp collects tribute in El-Jereed, overseeing the region's resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bey of the Camp is a governing official who administers the Jereed region, collects tribute, and holds a hereditary position.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bey of the Camp is a leader responsible for visiting with a "flying-camp" to collect tribute and oversee circuits or divisions of the Regency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96b49b26c3ab3e73c7183507f22ac2e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc0fa20a8bb60c2f53107ccd7d2bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a17fe942d5f36c4709f9e1cb2fc169d3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
