    </node>
    <node id="Signore Nunez Vaise">
      <data key="d0">Signore Nunez Vaise</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Signore Nunez Vaise is the Bey's doctor, a Tuscan Jew, who assisted and hosted the tourists during their visit.&lt;SEP&gt;Signore Nunez Vaise is the Bey's doctor, a Tuscan Jew who hosted and assisted the tourists.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96b49b26c3ab3e73c7183507f22ac2e9</data>
