    <node id="Tangier">
      <data key="d0">Tangier</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tangier is a strategic Moroccan port occupied by England and associated with various conflicts and treaties.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a city where Hemo de Graeberg served as Consul.&lt;SEP&gt;City located north-west of Tetuan, approximately two-thirds of a day's journey away.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is an important city on the Atlantic coast, passing through which one reaches other significant historical towns in Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a port city engaged in extensive trade with Gibraltar, importing and exporting various goods.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a city on the northern coast, historically significant and described in historical texts related to the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6706573dac6e75677a74dc1ef5caf318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c196bdb46661c725027c238489650eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2d548d08b4129bfc47eab34719160b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
