    </node>
    <node id="Mazagran">
      <data key="d0">Mazagran</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mazagran is a town in Morocco with disputed population estimates ranging from under 100 to 2,000.&lt;SEP&gt;Mazagran is a town located approximately fourteen miles from Azamor, with a historical stronghold and port.&lt;SEP&gt;Mazagran is a city approximately one and a half days journey from Saffee.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6706573dac6e75677a74dc1ef5caf318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-284546e32da930f297907ef0f48339cc</data>
