    <node id="Gomera">
      <data key="d0">Gomera</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Gomera (or Badis) is a city and port, possibly the ancient Parientina or Acra of Ptolemy.&lt;SEP&gt;Gomera is a city on the coast, with historical significance and fortifications.&lt;SEP&gt;The name Gomera is believed to derive from the Arab tribe Gomeres.&lt;SEP&gt;Gomera, also called Badis, is an ancient city or region in Africa or Spain, historically important and now largely abandoned, associated with serpents and hyenas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6706573dac6e75677a74dc1ef5caf318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c196bdb46661c725027c238489650eb3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
