      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Louis XIV was the reigning monarch of France, involved in diplomatic interactions with the Moroccan Sultan.&lt;SEP&gt;Louis XIV was a French monarch during whose time the city of Eazaza was commercially important.</data>
