      <data key="d0">R</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">R is referenced as the recipient of a gift of a young ostrich by Santa Maria.&lt;SEP&gt;R is a person who received animals such as jerboahs sent by the Bey.</data>
