      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jewish women, described as extremely beautiful until they become obese, with fair complexions, delicate features, and expressive eyes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a3a39ae3aa8492d1ce85349e33fe6e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57f75296e95e08ee42b21dc84299286f</data>
