      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A North African individual, depicted as relishing enormous lumps of fat, associated with regional beauty standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moor is depicted as a stout woman highly relished by others, with cultural beauty standards favoring ample body parts like the back, thighs, calves, and knees.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a3a39ae3aa8492d1ce85349e33fe6e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259</data>
