      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A stout woman described as a Moors' standard of beauty, emphasizing ample proportions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mauritanian Venus is a highly stout woman the narrator passes who is so obese she has fallen down and cannot get up.</data>
