      <data key="d0">Hosein</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hosein, also called El-Hosein-es-Sebet, is a descendant of Ali-Ben-Abou-Thaleb, died in 1680, and from whom the patronymic El-Hoseinee is derived.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b</data>
