    <node id="Mohammed">
      <data key="d0">Mohammed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mohammed is a key ancestor, considered the patriarch of many subsequent dynasties, and related to the founding of the Almohadi dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed, born in 1691, brother of Muley Meherrez, King of Tafilett, father of many children.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed, born in 1367, ancestor of the Hoseinee dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed, son of El-Hasan, was grandfather of Hosem.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed is a Shereef who led an expedition penetrating as far as Wadnoun over three centuries ago.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-680c330ee8036afcbacb673ce690b640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba</data>
