    <node id="Abdullah-el-Kamel">
      <data key="d0">Abdullah-el-Kamel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Abdullah-el-Kamel, called "The Perfect," in 752, is the father of Edris and progenitor of the Edristi dynasty in Morocco.</data>
