      <data key="d0">Mohammed (another)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A descendant named Mohammed, surnamed "The pious and just soul," who had five children, contributing to family lineages.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed, born in 1691, brother of Muley Meherrez, and father of multiple children, including Ali.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b</data>
