    <node id="Ali">
      <data key="d0">Ali</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ali, son of Yousef, died in 1527, had at least eighty male children, and is an ancestor in the Moroccan dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Ali, son of Youssef, who died in 1527, father of many children and an ancestor of the Moroccan dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Ali, son of Yousef, died in 1527, with over eighty male children.&lt;SEP&gt;Ali was a revered figure, ancestor of Edris Ben Abdalluh, and integral to the lineage of early Moroccan rulers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b31b92f9b032efc61f97bef8d8b3ec2</data>
