      <data key="d0">Muley Mahommed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Muley Mahommed, son of Mohammed, was a king of Tafilett, and ancestor of the current Hoseinee Shereefs.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Mahommed, son of Ali-es-Shereef, father of Muley Shereeff.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b</data>
