      <data key="d0">Youssef</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Youssef, son of Ali, died in 1485, retired into Arabia, and is a key ancestor in the royal genealogical lineage.&lt;SEP&gt;Youssef, son of Ali, who died in 1485, retired into Arabia, is a progenitor within the Moroccan dynasties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b</data>
