      <data key="d0">Spanish Renegade (Omar Ei-Haj)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Omar Ei-Haj was a gunner for the Moors, killed in the battle, known as a Spanish renegade.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c246ad7923d08e2ef2366af23b4c19f</data>
