    <node id="R.">
      <data key="d0">R.</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">R. is a character who shot a gazelle, cut its throat, and interacted with Arabs and other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;R. is a person who shot a gazelle, cut its throat, and interacted with Arabs and other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who is mentioned as being unwell, possibly a traveler or observer experiencing health issues due to local conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;R. is a person present at the camp, targeted by an assault during festivities.</data>
