    <node id="Tafilett">
      <data key="d0">Tafilett</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tafilett is a historically significant region and town in Morocco, situated within the southern Atlas region. It is characterized as a fortified area with walls and towers, playing an important role as a site of imperial power and trade. The region has a legacy of conquest and has historically been incorporated into the larger Moroccan kingdom through various conquests, ultimately becoming a distinct province and region within the country. 

Tafilett is inhabited primarily by Shereefs who claim royal rights, and the area has been recognized for its natural products, including extensive palm plantations and date cultivation. It functioned as an important caravan station for journeys departing from Fez toward Central Africa, serving as a key logistical point for trade routes connecting Morocco to Sahara trade networks. 

The region comprises a group of fortified villages and towns, once an independent kingdom, now integrated into the Moroccan state but retaining cultural and political significance. It is located on the southeastern side of the Atlas mountains, outside the direct influence of the central government, and has historically been a hub for local governance and cultural identity. Some descriptions also identify Tafilett as a town accessible via roads from Aghmat, emphasizing its connectivity within Morocco’s trade and transportation networks. Overall, Tafilett encompasses both a strategic and cultural landmark in Morocco, notable for its fortified structures, trade importance, natural resources, and historical independence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6dcfd21521e87c975db82bce68bfa5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a17fe942d5f36c4709f9e1cb2fc169d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb3f38fdfb7168489cd1fb4adcb2515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11883b983a6b12419bdd608231cd321f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-680c330ee8036afcbacb673ce690b640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67512ea13edfd2cab9973f3ae5f8c75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ee1dd105b3b5398ba93ec7c92e6dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45af3d0999432adf74bdb708ed276f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78c973a4a4c99e07c3571a6d29d1779d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-203f252ae42306fa9f42171f8e2f0f23</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614566</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
