      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Jackson is an individual who described the magnificent palm plantations and forests in the Jereed region during a tour.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Jackson is a tenant of Samuel Pepys who is met at Graveley.</data>
