    <node id="Palms">
      <data key="d0">Palms</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Palms are dioecious trees, with male and female plants, used for fruit, building, baskets, ropes, and vestments, and hold cultural significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Palms are vital trees in the Sahara, often spared during conflict to preserve resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a17fe942d5f36c4709f9e1cb2fc169d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc0fa20a8bb60c2f53107ccd7d2bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c</data>
