      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Nitre is a mineral found in the water used for irrigation, affecting the quality and growth conditions of palms.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitre is obtained from a salt-like substance on the ground, tasted as salty and resembling rime of a frosty morning.</data>
