      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Timbuctoo (Timbuktu) is a historical city in the Sahara, mentioned as part of the region historically claimed by Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Timbuctoo is an important trade city that received salt exported from Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Timbuctoo is a significant destination for caravans departing from Fez heading toward Central Africa.</data>
