      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Grapes of a cubit's length are produced by a species of vine in the region, highlighting local viticulture.&lt;SEP&gt;Grapes in Tagodast are large, similar to hen's eggs, and part of the local trade.</data>
