      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Aghmat is a ruined city, formerly a prosperous capital, now a small village at the foot of Mount Atlas.&lt;SEP&gt;Aghmat is a town located at the foot of Mount Atlas, near a river of the same name, and was the first capital of the Marabout dynasty.</data>
