    <node id="Mount Atlas">
      <data key="d0">Mount Atlas</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Mount Atlas is a major mountain in Morocco, near Aghmat.&lt;SEP&gt;Mount Atlas is a prominent mountain range in Morocco, near which Aghmat is situated.&lt;SEP&gt;Mount Atlas is a significant mountain in North Africa, giving its name to the "Systeme Atlantique" and associated with various geographical features.&lt;SEP&gt;Mount Atlas is a mountain considered by ancient descriptions to be the back of the world or the cultivated parts of the globe, associated with the sun at noon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11883b983a6b12419bdd608231cd321f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67512ea13edfd2cab9973f3ae5f8c75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d805a74697d9faea388c9f6f2958a4</data>
