      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A person who described the method of storing dates in poles and jars, and praised the palatable nature of date syrup.&lt;SEP&gt;Sir Grenville Temple remarks about the temperature and fish in the springs of Ghasa and Toser.</data>
