      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shereef is a title used by a sovereign of Morocco, related to claims and authority over regions such as Western Sahara and oases.&lt;SEP&gt;The Shereef is the Commandant of the caravan, whose influence determines the duration of the journey.</data>
