    <node id="Wadnoun">
      <data key="d0">Wadnoun</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Wadnoun is a region in the Sahara that was reached by the expedition of Mohammed, indicating historical Moroccan influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Wadnoun is mentioned as a nominating region that nominally acknowledges the Sultan.&lt;SEP&gt;Wadnoun is a nearby location two days east of Akka on a plain.&lt;SEP&gt;Wadnoun is a geographic location mentioned in connection with Moroccan history.</data>
