    <node id="Ghadames">
      <data key="d0">Ghadames</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ghadames is a town in the Sahara where local people claimed the oases had no official Moroccan control.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghadames is a city along the caravan route from Fez to Mecca and Alexandria, involved in trade and pilgrimage routes.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghadames is a destination mentioned for future travel by Santa Maria, and is known for its historical significance.</data>
