      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sultan of Morocco is the political and religious leader of the empire, with varying degrees of control over different regions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moroccan Sultan is a ruler whose authority in some regions is purely nominal and based on tradition.&lt;SEP&gt;The ruler of Morocco who faced resistance from Abd-el-Kader and Berber tribes.</data>
