      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maroquine Court is referenced in anecdotes, with interactions involving the Sultan and officials.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maroquine Court is a royal court in Morocco where anecdotes about royal figures were related.</data>
