    <node id="Arabian Conquerors">
      <data key="d0">Arabian Conquerors</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The Arabian conquerors of Africa, associated with the Saracens, founded the early Moroccan dynasties.&lt;SEP&gt;Arabian conquerors, including Arab warriors from various provinces like Yemen, invaded North Africa, Spain, and neighboring regions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
