      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Yousel-Ben-Tashfin was a king who founded Morocco around 1072 or 1073 and established its early prosperity.&lt;SEP&gt;Founder of Morocco in 1072/1073, associated with the wealth and early prosperity of the city.</data>
