    <node id="Mosque">
      <data key="d0">Mosque</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The principal mosque in Tesegdelt is renowned for being one of the finest in the empire.&lt;SEP&gt;A mosque is a Muslim place of worship present in each village in the Sahara district.&lt;SEP&gt;A mosque is a religious structure present in each village of the Sahara.&lt;SEP&gt;The mosque is described with its square form, similar to the Kaaba, and is significant in Islamic architecture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67512ea13edfd2cab9973f3ae5f8c75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd702921e8d3a990c6c7e84369cba36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978</data>
