      <data key="d2">Sous is a region in Morocco, named among the key places in the kingdom, with historical and cultural significance.&lt;SEP&gt;The province of Sous is near the city of Tagawost and the river Sous.&lt;SEP&gt;Sous is a region described in historical context, known for its terrain and historical significance.</data>
