    <node id="Hare">
      <data key="d0">Hare</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The hare is an animal caught by the hawk, described as vain and retreating, with swift movement.&lt;SEP&gt;A hare is seen scurrying among the salt heaps and bushes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-712990bb2ebe5d62b532d770bfe4b95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e87160352b07ec76435ae0e7abc28b28</data>
