      <data key="d0">Mauritania</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mauritania is a region in North Africa from which Arab invaders, called Moors, came during their early invasions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mauritania is a historically rich and fertile region with ancient cities, producing vines and other crops, described by Strabo as abundant and well-watered.&lt;SEP&gt;Mauritania is a region known for its general fertility, rivers, lakes, and diverse natural resources, with a small desert area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac59a77b85c004bd29ffff6b594c7f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614608</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Yemen">
      <data key="d0">Yemen</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Yemen is a province of Arabia that is the origin of Arab warriors who invaded North Africa during early Islamic expansions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614608</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Arab Warriors">
      <data key="d0">Arab Warriors</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Arab warriors, originating from various parts of Arabia, participated in invasions of North Africa, Spain, and other regions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614608</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Senegal">
      <data key="d0">Senegal</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Senegal is a country in West Africa where Moors, descended from Arab and Berber peoples, reside.&lt;SEP&gt;Senegal is a country in West Africa associated with the Moorish population; it is mentioned in the context of Moors in Senegal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614608</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Towns and Cities">
      <data key="d0">Towns and Cities</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Various towns and coastal cities in North Africa and Spain, such as Algiers and others, were founded or influenced by Arab and Moorish peoples.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614608</data>
