    <node id="Hobara">
      <data key="d0">Hobara</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Hobara is a bird, larger than a small hen-turkey, with white feathers and black wings, caught by hawks.&lt;SEP&gt;Hobara is a bird, comparable to a little bustard, characterized by its size, coloration, and flight stratagems, regarded as entertaining to observe.</data>
