    <node id="Hares">
      <data key="d0">Hares</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Hares are wild animals seen during the journey, difficult to catch due to the ground conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hares are seen crossing paths or flying over during the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Hares are animals caught using dogs, frequently found along the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Hares are small animals caught in traps, driven by dogs and hawks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e87160352b07ec76435ae0e7abc28b28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978</data>
