      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Gazelles are swift antelopes seen feeding on the extensive plain.&lt;SEP&gt;Gazelles are swift antelope animals that can be surprised or chased.&lt;SEP&gt;Gazelles are observed and occasionally caught during the journey.</data>
