      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Goths inhabited Ceuta at an early period before it was conquered by Arab forces, contributing to its historical population.&lt;SEP&gt;The Goths, inhabitants of Ceuta before Arab conquest, part of the Gothic peoples.</data>
