      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the Ben-Hamed family, invaded Spain, and was proclaimed King of Cordova.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed Edris, a member of the Ben-Hamed family, invaded Spain and became the proclaimed King of Cordova around A.D. 1000.</data>
