      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sheikh Tahib is a local figure subjected to corporal punishment, known for collecting tribute and defying authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Sheikh Tahib is a tribal leader whose gardens, sold for 15,000 piastres, are noted.</data>
