      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sheikh Ali is an Arab tribe member, a renowned deer-stalker accompanying the group exploring the rocky terrain.&lt;SEP&gt;Sheikh Ali is a member of the Arab tribe Hammama, known for hunting deer and shooting loteds.</data>
