      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Jerboahs are small animals similar to guinea pigs or rats, with variations depending on location in Tunisia.&lt;SEP&gt;Jerboahs are small animals similar to rats found near Tunis, occupying an eminence and regarded as the lesser animal or Jerd species.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f</data>
