      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Guinea-pigs are described as similar to some local jerboahs in appearance and texture.&lt;SEP&gt;A guinea-pig is described as sandy-colored, very soft and fine, similar to a young hare, and characterized by its small size and appearance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f</data>
