      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bey of Tunis is a regional authority involved in engagements with Christians regarding abolition, representing a division within Muslim leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bey of Tunis is a governing authority who appears to have conceded sovereignty over the jerboahs' eminence.</data>
