    <node id="Sand">
      <data key="d0">Sand</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Sand forms an endless ocean of desert beyond Toser's forest, appearing like water.&lt;SEP&gt;Sand is collected by the Old Man for gardening purposes, significant to his livelihood.</data>
