    <node id="Legend">
      <data key="d0">Legend</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Legends of the haunted Argan forests emphasize the universality and permanence of human superstitions and hopes.&lt;SEP&gt;Legends like that of Cormoran and historical stories link to the cultural lore surrounding St. Michael's Mount.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-84c94d80ebde4b68648f96bb92f8d0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acdfa773f8af706f91ebb20b7581863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0ed1717208ea935e1a0b9a0b5345925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064</data>
