      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Amayeegh is a variety of the Berber population located in the mountains of Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Amayeegh is a term thought to mean "great," used to distinguish tribes as a form of social or national identification.</data>
