    <node id="Arab Family of Ben-Hamed">
      <data key="d0">Arab Family of Ben-Hamed</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ben-Hamed family was a powerful Arab dynasty that conquered Ceuta, and one of its members, Mohammed Edris, invaded Spain and was proclaimed King of Cordova.</data>
