    <node id="Portugal">
      <data key="d0">Portugal</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Portugal conquered Ceuta on August 21, 1415, marking its first occupation in Africa, before passing control to Spain.&lt;SEP&gt;Portugal is a country for which preparations are being made by the Lord of Sandwich.&lt;SEP&gt;Portugal is where Captain Isham is heading on voyage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63be821a7049668cd27a886c0bcf0d2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80d293af5e7df136bc3f73cb98ae3fad</data>
