      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ovad Omm-Erbergh is a route on which the village Meshru Khaluf is located, near the ford of Meshra Khaluf.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovad Omm-Erbergh is a river on which Meshru Khaluf is located, serving as a route for trade and travel.</data>
