      <data key="d0">Enchanted Forest</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33cad941dca515ea1feb8e87a23c7dfb</data>
      <data key="d2">The Argan forests are believed to have been haunted by enchantresses and jinns until a holy man from the desert broke the spell by inscribing the sacred name of the Deity on cork bark tied to the trees, freeing them from enchantment.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
