      <data key="d3">chunk-33cad941dca515ea1feb8e87a23c7dfb</data>
      <data key="d2">A holy man from the desert broke the spell of enchantments on the Argan forests by tying cork bark inscribed with the sacred name of the Deity.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1764614644</data>
