      <data key="d0">The Deanery</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Deanery is a location associated with the characters' dinner and social activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is a residence associated with the Dean, involved in social and domestic scenes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the residence where most characters interact and where various events take place.&lt;SEP&gt;A place involved in the social or official activities discussed by characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the setting for the scene, a place where the characters are gathered and concerned about the brother.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the residence associated with The Dean, involved in the story's plot around the mixture and deception.</data>
