    <node id="Dean">
      <data key="d0">Dean</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dean appears as a central character, involved in conducting a dinner and managing household affairs, expressing concern over bills and financial matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dean is a character who shows concern for his stable's horse and considers administering medication to prevent a chill, reflecting his veterinary interest and moral sense.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dean is a character experiencing distress, feeling threatened by financial and social issues within the Deanery, and involved in gambling related to horse racing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dean, specifically the Very Reverend Augustin Jedd, is a character involved in the investigation, missing from his usual location and associated with the scene.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dean is involved in actions of deception, characterized by his attempt to conceal his involvement in the mixture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-893320667c086c5f7bc12fc4874ac8b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d690635b31230e7613331edb68d7205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e596e9ce7637f90613b8207baadae53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f4fbe7f763ab4a0c366e0536ed6f49e</data>
