    <node id="Noah Topping">
      <data key="d0">Noah Topping</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Noah Topping is a character in "Dandy Dick" who is a rural constable, central to the comedic plot.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a countryman and police constable, characterized by his dense appearance, vindictive demeanor, and authority over Hannah.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a police officer and the main character who enforces law, displays pride, and interacts with other characters within the police station scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is Hannah's husband, with whom she shares eight weeks of married life and a long-standing relationship of love.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a character who reports a rescue and traces a man back to the Deanery, associated with domestic disputes and investigation.</data>
