    <node id="Dandy">
      <data key="d0">Dandy</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Dandy is a horse involved in a fire incident, with efforts made to save and care for him.&lt;SEP&gt;Dandy is a horse that is fed at the stable, with concern about its tail and pride affecting its behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Dandy is a dog that George intends to sit with in the stable during the thunderstorm.&lt;SEP&gt;Dandy is a horse that appears in a dream sequence, notable for losing its tail and being sold to a circus.&lt;SEP&gt;A horse involved in the scene, attacked by a villain.&lt;SEP&gt;Dandy appears to be a character involved in the situation at the Deanery Stables, with motives and actions related to the plot concerning Georgiana and Sir Tristram.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7fbd76b6f2049550600c7b5f2e214524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee051bd08ba32e2c7f5e0938dbbc6c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bf94783f183c51cfeb7911ef8186ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe1560cf60e9d4a7338b3d121ff45e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d4b6446a1278be5194702894654c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1005fe668029a3498fae762b9e2347d2</data>
