    <node id="George Tidd">
      <data key="d0">George Tidd</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">George Tidd is Georgiana's racing name, associated with her competitive racing career, and her colors were crimson and black diamonds.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual associated with horse stable activities, remembered for his involvement with Dandy Dick.&lt;SEP&gt;George Tidd is a character, referred to with pride and assertiveness, involved in the efforts related to the horse and fire.&lt;SEP&gt;George Tidd is a character referred to in context with the sale of Dandy and a supposed relationship with Georgiana.&lt;SEP&gt;George Tidd is a person known among old friends, recognized with joy during a moment in the story, involved in social interaction.</data>
