      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tarver is a character who shows signs of nervous strain, discusses health and emotional state, and interacts regarding event arrangements.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a character who expresses excitement about his voice and performs with a leather music roll, experiencing despair over forgotten music.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a person who is eager to see the Dean and is excited, showing a nervous or anticipatory attitude.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a character who appears outside and later inside, involved in the investigation and scene setting.</data>
