      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hatcham is a character responsible for running the horse to try to warm him after the fire incident.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a groom who reports on horse feeding and discusses suspicions about fire and a horse’s tail, involved in a scene at the stables.&lt;SEP&gt;A stable worker involved in delivering medicine and assisting in fire-related events at the Swan Inn.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a person who assists in the rescue by carrying The Dean and then running out to cheer from afar.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character who reports on the arrival of the chemist's analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character who reports the arrival of an analysis to Sir Tristram.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character involved in the investigation, confirming the identity of the person found.</data>
