    <node id="Major Tarver">
      <data key="d0">Major Tarver</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Major Tarver is an officer who visits the household, characterized by his excitement and depression, and shows interest in the household affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character with a nervous disposition, suffering from depression and health issues, involved in planning the evening events.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character involved in a proposal for a fancy dress masked ball and in paying for dresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A character referenced as possibly having neuralgia and involved in the domestic scene.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character experiencing indigestion after dinner, depicted as pale and haggard, with a humorous attitude towards his condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character who appears weak and in critical condition, loved Sheba, and is involved in a medical and romantic subplot.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is sitting in the conservatory with Salome.</data>
