      <data key="d2">Darbey is a character associated with military background who interacts with others about arrangements and expresses a sense of burden.&lt;SEP&gt;Darbey is another character involved in the social interactions with a military background, feeling burdened by responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A character who attempted to make a witty remark during the dinner scene.&lt;SEP&gt;Darbey is a character who brings a violin and engages in conversations with other characters, possibly with a role related to music or socializing.&lt;SEP&gt;Darbey is a character who is involved in the scene, possibly an associate of Sheba, and is approached by Gorgiana with concern.&lt;SEP&gt;Darbey is a person who is involved in a dialogue with Sheba about friendship and time to ponder over personal questions.</data>
