    <node id="Gus">
      <data key="d0">Gus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gus is a character (possibly the Dean) involved in financial matters and staying in the old nursery.&lt;SEP&gt;Gus is a nickname for the Dean, described as a small, short, thin man with black hair and a squint, involved in the scene as a character suspected or identified.&lt;SEP&gt;Gus is mentioned as the person responsible for rolling out the flying dogcart to facilitate the escape of Dandy.&lt;SEP&gt;Gus is a character who discusses family, financial matters, and control, and his name is used in domestic and family context.&lt;SEP&gt;Gus appears in the scene discussing family happiness and control over life and possessions.</data>
