    <node id="Salome">
      <data key="d0">Salome</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Salome is a multifaceted character appearing in various contexts that depict her as a young woman deeply engaged in her family and social environment. She demonstrates a trusting demeanor toward others and exhibits concern for her family members, notably caring for her father and expressing happiness at his return. Her interactions with her sister Sheba often involve discussions about household matters, financial issues, and social arrangements, highlighting her involvement in domestic scenes and her desire for material security, including expressions of longing for money.

Throughout these depictions, Salome shows signs of emotional distress related to her financial situation, expressing grief and worry about bills and debts. She is attentive to the health and well-being of others, such as her father and Major Tarver, with whom she interacts concerning his health and household plans like sneaking out or secret arrangements. Her concern extends to her family’s future, as seen when she displays gloominess or frustration about a father’s return or other external stressors.

In addition to her domestic and familial roles, Salome is portrayed as a character with subtle reproach and moments of anger, particularly in scenes of frustration where she expresses a desire for revenge or involves herself in schemes with her sister Sheba. She is also involved in various scenes that suggest she participates both outside and inside the household environment, including interactions in the conservatory and moments observing family discussions about the Dean. 

Furthermore, Salome is depicted as a young girl involved in social and sometimes secret plans, communicating with others about sneaking out and engaging in conversations that reveal her emotional range, from trembling excitement to gloominess. She is also associated with a well-seasoned animal, probably a horse, indicating her connection to rural or farm life. Overall, Salome is characterized as a caring, emotionally expressive, and socially active young woman who navigates complex familial and social dynamics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f87fddca66673ee08a52eb11ebbc03dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbd76b6f2049550600c7b5f2e214524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa7fe44d59dc239da3ab02f4386d15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d690635b31230e7613331edb68d7205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd7991bf11c9a900752c7c353a0990c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3c3f1e54f2cd94a7ba1914df2ac61e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b0199cb2086a0bf36a1dde1fbe62d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39786c205992e5e0d95dca55454814f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af1eb7dd19180841d20fad29810d6539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea62626f9134cd6522f82d474b2c357b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c9d5647c1407e2585c351081e7eb47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59edcbf702bf09e6c7842114ee9fee90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2c82e11dcce129d5615a4deb4b0724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3037df50481adaea6024d7ae1774bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4d7bb5676e6bc4c87b3981f6f0ae16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51763246a424f17d012c8a8c92b9dd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bebed720934a7d07e65bb3901bf810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bf94783f183c51cfeb7911ef8186ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797a0e01fc6bbbd28cfe260a566d2a5c</data>
