      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Samuel Pepys was a prominent diarist whose personal account reflects 17th-century English naval and political life.&lt;SEP&gt;Samuel Pepys was a historical figure, a diarist known for documenting his life and events in 17th-century England.&lt;SEP&gt;Samuel Pepys is a diarist documenting daily events and personal reflections during the 17th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Samuel Pepys is a diarist who records daily events, meetings, social interactions, and official observations in August 1661.&lt;SEP&gt;Samuel Pepys is a diarist who documents daily activities, social interactions, and personal reflections in 1661.&lt;SEP&gt;Samuel Pepys was a naval administrator and diarist whose detailed diary provides insights into 17th-century English social, political, and personal life.</data>
