    <node id="Lizard Town">
      <data key="d0">Lizard Town</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A town visited during the tour, part of the travel itinerary.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a settlement in Cornwall, associated with the parish of Landewednack, and is characterized by its ancient church and seafaring community.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a place mentioned as a location where groups of young people wander through, characterized by quiet paths and scenic views.</data>
