    <node id="The Lizard">
      <data key="d0">The Lizard</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lizard is a geographical point considered an ideal sightseer destination, possibly better than Land's End, and is a focal point for lodging inquiries.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a prominent headland in Cornwall illustrated in the book, noted for its lighthouse and scenic views.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a scenic coastal area in Cornwall known for its natural beauty and beaches.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a geographic region in Cornwall, significant as a travel destination and scenic area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a region in Cornwall characterized by moorland, community life, and traditional local customs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a coastal area in Cornwall known for its scenic beauty, archaeological sites, and coastal activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b147dfcab79c75ec8a9092c688ad363d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe99e4059d4a83bdd69b8d710ad9ca66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c680d4e3c6d389236c61c1ca4a429d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de865f683f08a0b7587135564fd925d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7f8bd62dafa63c78ea529b3f1857b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9744909492c02bf3c9b5f954e5e18588</data>
