    <node id="Churchyard">
      <data key="d0">Churchyard</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The churchyard in Landewednack is noted for its neatness, grave markers of seafaring men and wrecked sailors, and graves from the 17th century plague victims.&lt;SEP&gt;The churchyard is a quiet outdoor area illuminated by moonlight, serving as a setting in the scene.</data>
