    <node id="Lizard Lights">
      <data key="d0">Lizard Lights</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lizard Lights is a large, dazzling white building near the coast, serving as a lighthouse or navigational aid.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard Lights are bright navigational signals along the coast, visible at sea, especially at night, with the ability to be seen from distances of twenty to thirty miles.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Lights are a phenomenon depicting lights seen in the night, associated with the Lizard area, glowing in the darkness.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Lights are described as far-gleaming lights seen in the distance, creating a familiar and beautiful sight at night.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard Lights are natural or archaeological light phenomena observed in the Lizard area, intended to be investigated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard Lights are a scientific experiment involving large lighting apparatus and fog-horns, representing an early attempt to harness natural forces for safety and navigation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b147dfcab79c75ec8a9092c688ad363d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1cd94b8b0a4c57576d20936affb7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-954cde81659c45a63d9688ff1660cf5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32469f057cd19090b7cd1fecfc96b839&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfcfaae8c46b24eac1b42d9fe626fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9744909492c02bf3c9b5f954e5e18588</data>
