      <data key="d2">Ygrayne is a character in Arthurian legend, wife of King Gerlois and connected with the legend of King Arthur and the castles.&lt;SEP&gt;Ygrayne is portrayed as hapless within the context of Arthurian legend.&lt;SEP&gt;Ygrayne is a legendary figure, wife of Gorlois, connected to King Arthur's mythos.&lt;SEP&gt;Ygrayne is the wife of the duke of Cornwall, lover of Uther Pendragon, and mother of King Arthur.</data>
