    <node id="Old Gentleman">
      <data key="d0">Old Gentleman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The old gentleman is a protector of his daughters, speaking prudently about their safety and observing their behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;An elderly man who discusses managing affairs, recommending prudence and courage, and shares a pleasant memory on Kynance Sands.</data>
