      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cornwall">
      <data key="d0">Cornwall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Cornwall is a prominent geographical and cultural region located in the southwest of England, renowned for its stunning and rugged coastlines, picturesque villages, and ancient landscapes that evoke a sense of enduring history and mythic significance. The region's diverse scenery includes notable sites such as Lizard Point, Kynance Sands, and various sea caves, contributing to its reputation as a scenic coastal destination. Cornwall's landscapes are characterized by rural areas, traditional fishing and farming communities, and historic towns like Penzance, Redruth, Camborne, and St. Ives, which have historically been centers of mining and regional development.

Historically and culturally, Cornwall is notable for its mythology, legendary associations, and regional heritage, which are intertwined with the Arthurian mythos and local folklore. The region maintains a respectful, sober-minded, and religiously diverse community, reflecting its longstanding cultural traditions. Its environment is also known for stormy weather and dramatic natural phenomena, further enhancing its mythic and adventurous reputation.

In literature and narratives set in Cornwall, the region serves as a setting for reflection, solitude, and exploration of its scenic landscapes and historic sites. Cornwall's coastal scenery, beaches, and sea caves make it a favored locale for travel narratives and stories emphasizing its scenic beauty and cultural richness. Overall, Cornwall embodies a blend of natural beauty, historical depth, cultural heritage, and mythic symbolism, making it a unique and storied region in England.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f5c806b84743a90dfbb4163c33c2229a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66d2ddcb0f1123cca7b29268a9a9c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a4525b14048f3353d702b98f67ccda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3595409ddcf313d3ede9dd4bc5229e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88bb0742ed8d4804fc66811c924845ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87bd881119189a688bfde0ea81ce77c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c680d4e3c6d389236c61c1ca4a429d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad935363bd1f002bacc611b031c99cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b244aae51773bf1f2438d4305c91ceec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9567484ec2e94de37ab803e0df4f01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013f67bf042c7366daa951d89bffb75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f749ef842a6b7afcee9121c9350e439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412525aa2850ddcda626495405c2c4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be86d35f5dd3c806476e4e7c02d004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d970d400c7e2e3d42bc4de363f798b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b07f91a63f12116362cc5c772cacd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7f8bd62dafa63c78ea529b3f1857b1</data>
