    <node id="Excalibur">
      <data key="d0">Excalibur</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Excalibur is the legendary sword of King Arthur, said to have been thrown into Dozmare Pool.&lt;SEP&gt;Excalibur is the legendary sword of King Arthur, symbolizing heroism and legend, depicted in the story as being thrown into a pool.&lt;SEP&gt;Excalibur is the legendary sword associated with King Arthur, symbolizing his kingship and often depicted as a mystical weapon.&lt;SEP&gt;Excalibur is the legendary sword given to King Arthur, which he was instructed to throw into the sea before his departure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64b7ad3d05ef11eb080f1a8e10aa6ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de865f683f08a0b7587135564fd925d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064</data>
