    <node id="Tregeagle">
      <data key="d0">Tregeagle</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tregeagle is a legendary figure associated with Cornish folklore, depicted as a grim mad-demon.&lt;SEP&gt;Tregeagle is a mythical or spectral figure from Cornish tradition, associated with a grim mad-demon who enacts a punishment by emptying Dozmare Pool.&lt;SEP&gt;Tregeagle is referenced as a legendary demon associated with Cornwall, symbolizing chaos or malevolent forces during storms.&lt;SEP&gt;Tregeagle is a mythical Cornwall demon associated with the "meeting of the waters" at Loe Pool.&lt;SEP&gt;Tregeagle is regarded as a demon of Cornwall who, according to legend, sold his soul to the devil and was drowned in Dozmare Pool.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64b7ad3d05ef11eb080f1a8e10aa6ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0ed1717208ea935e1a0b9a0b5345925&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de865f683f08a0b7587135564fd925d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7588957ea7d271bfdda9ca4a517733ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064</data>
