    <node id="Penzance">
      <data key="d0">Penzance</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Penzance is a nearby town favored for its elegance compared to Marazion.&lt;SEP&gt;Penzance is a lovely coastal town characterized by its scenic views, gardens, and surrounding countryside.&lt;SEP&gt;Penzance is a nearby town noted for its gardens, scenic drives, and as a point of passage to the coast and Land's End.&lt;SEP&gt;Penzance is a town in Cornwall characterized by rich vegetation and peaceful roads, located on the southwestern coast of England.&lt;SEP&gt;Penzance is a coastal town in Cornwall, used as a reference point in the travel narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Penzance is a town on the road from which travelers expect to return to Falmouth.</data>
