      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">St. Rumon was an Irish bishop who settled in Cornwall, establishing a cell and oratory, and is commemorated by the villages of Ruan Major and Ruan Minor.&lt;SEP&gt;A saint associated with the ancient church in Ruan Minor, possibly inhabiting the site or related to its history.</data>
