    <node id="Lizard">
      <data key="d0">Lizard</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lizard is a prominent geographic entity in Cornwall, primarily recognized as a coastal region and headland that holds significant scenic, geological, and cultural importance. It is known for its serpentine geology and picturesque coastline featuring sea caves, cliffs, and scenic views, making it a popular destination for excursions and viewing sunsets. The region's landscape is characterized by its green mounds, dense fogs, and notable proximity to the sea, contributing to its distinctive environment.

Situated within Cornwall, The Lizard encompasses several related features, including a town, a peninsula, and a broader regional area. The town of The Lizard is known for its white-painted houses, local shops, and coastal charm, serving as a point of interest for visitors. The broader region also bears cultural significance, associated with local legends, maritime history, and the burial of sailors in green mounds, reflecting its historical and folkloric importance. As a peninsula, The Lizard has a rich maritime heritage and is considered a destination for exploring sea caves, cliffs, and natural beauty, making it a notable excursion spot.

Additionally, The Lizard is recognized for its variable climate, especially its tendency for dense fogs, and it is associated with longevity and community events in local villages. Overall, The Lizard constitutes a diverse and scenic region in Cornwall, celebrated for its natural formations, cultural history, and scenic coastline that attract visitors seeking both geological marvels and cultural experiences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b2a4525b14048f3353d702b98f67ccda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5836d0924804112ead175776cdcd9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d3595409ddcf313d3ede9dd4bc5229e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88bb0742ed8d4804fc66811c924845ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de865f683f08a0b7587135564fd925d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9567484ec2e94de37ab803e0df4f01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f749ef842a6b7afcee9121c9350e439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27ea591b9bece4549c4c0df1e1172759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9947d8e5a23dab49c88d36cae1db57a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe99e4059d4a83bdd69b8d710ad9ca66</data>
