    <node id="Trevena">
      <data key="d0">Trevena</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Trevena is a small village near the Delabole Quarries, characterized by simple, home-like surroundings and a narrow street with two inns and an old post-office.&lt;SEP&gt;Trevena is a geographical location featuring twin ruins, a stream, and a rocky hollow where the narrative takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;A rocky hollow near Tintagel where stream waters descend into the sea.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40a925861c89aa50e0fdf703fdaf56f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be86d35f5dd3c806476e4e7c02d004</data>
