    </node>
    <node id="King Uther Pendragon">
      <data key="d0">King Uther Pendragon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">King Uther Pendragon is a legendary king involved in the legend of King Arthur, known for marrying Ygrayne and for the legend of the castles.&lt;SEP&gt;King Uther Pendragon is a legendary king associated with King Arthur's mythic origins and the region of Tintagel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b07f91a63f12116362cc5c772cacd1e</data>
