      <data key="d0">Iseult</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Iseult of Ireland is a character involved in the Arthurian love story, who later marries another Iseult of Brittany after her initial love affair.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d</data>
