      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Iseult of Brittany is the second Iseult, who marries Sir Tristram after his return from Tintagel and lives peacefully until his death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d</data>
