      <data key="d0">Sir Bragswaine</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sir Bragswaine is a character in Arthurian legend, known as Iseult of Brittany's lover, who gave her a love-potion and later married her after Sir Tristram's death.</data>
