    <node id="Cornish Language">
      <data key="d0">Cornish Language</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cornish language was historically spoken in Cornwall but was completely replaced by English in the region, with the last sermon in Cornish given in 1678.</data>
