    <node id="Church of Landewednack">
      <data key="d0">Church of Landewednack</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The church of Landewednack is a historic structure noted for Norman architecture, a hagioscope, and its well-preserved state, serving as the southernmost church in England.</data>
