    <node id="Harvest Festival">
      <data key="d0">Harvest Festival</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The harvest festival is an upcoming religious event associated with the church in Landewednack and preparations such as singing rehearsals.&lt;SEP&gt;The harvest festival at Landewednack involving tea in the rectory garden and a thanksgiving service.</data>
