    <edge source="Blood" target="Lungs">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The lungs remove waste matter from the blood during breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;The lungs purify the blood by removing waste gases during respiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Lungs exchange impurities in blood for oxygen, crucial for maintaining blood purity.&lt;SEP&gt;The lungs oxygenate blood, making it bright and pure to sustain the body's needs.</data>
      <data key="d9">blood circulation,gas exchange,oxygenation,purification,respiration</data>
