    </edge>
    <edge source="Blood" target="Heart">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Blood circulates through the heart, and the heart's action determines the flow rate and health.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart pumps blood to deliver nutrients and remove waste from body tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;The heart pumps blood, increasing blood flow and heat, especially in children.</data>
      <data key="d9">blood flow,circulation,pumping,pumps</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-9ec816dcf44e2fe3a4afba7c6692bba3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40e9d9d6bed631bcdf0022bea513804</data>
