    <edge source="Narrator" target="London">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The narrator currently lives in London, where they reflect and observe.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator journeys from Brampton to London, passing through Huntingdon and Baldwick.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator travels to London and finds all well at home and at his father's.</data>
