    <edge source="Hinze" target="Tulpian">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Hinze's keen interest in listening to Tulpian's ideas demonstrates a superficial or habitual admiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze listens to Tulpian's opinions and is eager to hear him dilate on his crotchets, showing interest.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze is implied to have a desired appointment with Tulpian and seeks his influence on various matters.</data>
