    <edge source="Hinze" target="Felicia">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Hinze interacts with Felicia in a manner exemplifying excessive deference and polite social behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Felicia engages Hinze in polite conversation about arts, literature, and culture, with Hinze responding with admiration and curiosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze is impressed by Felicia’s revelations about literature and art, recapitulating her insights with compliments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze questions Felicia about her opinion on art, culture, and literature, demonstrating reverent curiosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze has a clear and unambiguous regard for Felicia, with no hidden motives.</data>
      <data key="d9">admiration,adulation,dialogue,inquiry,politeness,regard,social interaction,straightforwardness</data>
