    <edge source="Roman Edict" target="Jewish People">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Jewish people, exemplified by the Zealots, defied the Roman edict, showing resistance to imperial authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Jewish resistance was directed against Roman decrees viewed as degradation.</data>
