    </edge>
    <edge source="Caligula" target="Jewish People">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Jewish Zealots opposed the introduction of Caligula's deified statue into their temple, reflecting their rejection of emperor worship.&lt;SEP&gt;The conflict over Caligula's deified statue illustrates Jewish resistance to Roman religious impositions.</data>
