    <edge source="Germany" target="Sterne">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Sterne's works significantly influenced German literature and cultural relations.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne's reputation grew gradually in Germany, leading to the translation of his works and the establishment of the Sterne cult.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne's influence on German literature and critics’ perspectives are discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication of Sterne’s Sentimental Journey established his influence on literary impulses and emotional expression in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne’s influence in Germany was significant but gradually waned, despite his recognition as a prophet.</data>
