    <edge source="Bruin" target="Toto">
      <data key="d7">13.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Bruin and Toto is characterized by a close, friendly, and cooperative bond, encompassing various aspects of daily life and shared activities. Bruin assists Toto with household chores such as house cleaning and yard-related tasks, often working together in domestic routines and engaging in discussions about animals, including topics like the origins of a breastpin and the concept of tails among animals. Their companionship extends to social activities, with both participating in dinner preparation and playing, as well as engaging in bedtime routines within the same household.

In addition to domestic cooperation, Bruin and Toto share a love for dancing, with Toto giving instructions on how Bruin should jump and change feet during dance practice. Although Bruin sometimes struggles to follow these directions, their joint participation highlights their mutual support and friendship. Toto also plans collective efforts, such as supporting Bruin during an adventure to assist a hermit, demonstrating their collaborative spirit.

Their relationship includes moments of concern and care, exemplified by Bruin discussing making frog-dumplings as a surprise for Toto, and Toto’s reaction to choking on the food, reflecting genuine concern. Toto displays loyalty and compassion by caring closely for Bruin and feeling remorse about past actions, seeking reconciliation and emphasizing themes of friendship and forgiveness. Moreover, Bruin shows caring behavior by advising respectability and sharing thoughtful gestures, further strengthening their bond. Overall, Bruin and Toto’s relationship is characterized by teamwork, emotional support, and the joy of shared experiences, illustrating a deep and multifaceted companionship.</data>
      <data key="d9">apology,assistance,caregiving,companionship,conversation,cooperation,dance,dancing,family,friendship,household,household activity,instruction,loyalty,partner,reaction,relationship,support,tails</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac5ac6267351fae8bc7baf5c96a3714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e64bd1d5284c29e6cb96bd7c0d5fdad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd1416667b27714cea22c448d2c7894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a69e187e3b23aa9bc91e07518123699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89037da3a2e5920f7e8990667d3b252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5e6743d54bfa5b3f1b9509aacd347e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60d4926e5d4ac6ded55aa7e91fca4c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2d18b61665def22c8f765c51d5d1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0</data>
