    <edge source="Sterne" target="German Literature">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Sterne's works, especially "Tristram Shandy," played a prominent role in the development and appreciation of German literature in the 18th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne's style and motifs had a significant impact on German writers, especially Wieland during the late 18th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne’s narrative style and eccentricities influenced German literature, especially in the late 18th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Sterne’s influence in Germany was significant but gradually diminished over time.</data>
