    <edge source="Yorick" target="Bode">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Bode contributed to the growth of interest in Yorick and Sterne’s works through his translations and literary activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Bode manages and adapts the character Yorick within Sterne’s stories for moral considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Yorick, a persona of Sterne, significantly influenced Bode’s translation style.&lt;SEP&gt;Bode is believed to be the translator of Sterne’s letters, possibly the same as the author of the letters attributed to Yorick.&lt;SEP&gt;Bode is identified as the translator or contributor in the collection of Yorick’s letters.</data>
      <data key="d9">contributor,editor,influence,literary influence,narrative,person,translator</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-3b57f8b57daf11b165b8852ab7e62eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1e05292b4f8b6c927109d49c554c0d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931aa8f5a62ee9ae96e93069b67b84fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fbde9bbb344a0f01988992d64609d89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9616c39c6806c71b17146575a3dbfb</data>
