      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Andreas Geo. Fr. von Rabenau adapted the old tale "Das lustige und lächerliche Lalenburg" into a humorous, caricatured narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Rabenau’s "Empfindsame Reise nach Schilda" is a humorous, caricatured revision of an old popular tale, emphasizing wit and joke.</data>
