      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">French Canadians in Lower Canada engaged in political conflicts with English Canadians over taxation and influence.&lt;SEP&gt;French Canadians, as represented by Papineau and the Patriotes, sought independence and self-governance from British authority.</data>
