    <edge source="French Canadians" target="Loyalty">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">French Canadians demonstrated their loyalty to the British Crown through their participation in defending the city in 1775 and their collective actions supporting the empire.&lt;SEP&gt;French Canadians expressed their loyalty by assisting in the defense of the city during conflicts, asserting their attachment to their sovereign.</data>
