    <edge source="Local Time" target="Difference">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The local solar time is derived from the sun’s crossing point and corrected with the equation of time, then compared to clock time to find the difference, which is used to compute longitude in degrees.</data>
