      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Alcohol" target="Nerves">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Alcohol dulls nerves and affects brain function, leading to poor coordination and judgment.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol injures nerves, impairing their ability to send messages properly.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of alcohol confuses the nerves, impairing senses like sight and hearing.</data>
      <data key="d9">confuse,damage,impairment</data>
