    </edge>
    <edge source="Muscles" target="Nerves">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Nerves transmit messages to muscles to facilitate movement and reflex actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Muscles of breathing are moved by nerves, enabling the process of respiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Nerves send messages to muscles to control their activity, ensuring proper bodily functions.</data>
      <data key="d9">connection,control</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1925755a5c65f004018f45749c7912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2b65dd2ccf6640dc6d501c52589484</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1764612198</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Skin" target="Rubber Boots">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Wearing rubber boots all day can block perspiration, causing discomfort and health issues.</data>
