    </edge>
    <edge source="Brain" target="Nerves">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Nerves connect the brain with the rest of the body, forming a communication network for controlling movement and sensation.&lt;SEP&gt;Nerves connect the brain to the body, transmitting messages that regulate sensation and movement.&lt;SEP&gt;The brain controls bodily functions and receives messages via nerves.</data>
      <data key="d9">connect,connection,control</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-20452cd28a7a0227706cdf094ea3c581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a2b65dd2ccf6640dc6d501c52589484</data>
