    <edge source="Salome" target="Sheba">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation Salome, Sheba describes a close and multifaceted sibling relationship between two sisters named Salome and Sheba. These two individuals are depicted as sharing a strong familial bond, engaging in a variety of family-related and personal interactions. They frequently discuss their plans and feelings, indicating open communication and mutual support. Their interactions include planning joint activities, such as asking their father for money, and coordinating efforts to sneak out of the house through a window, reflecting their cooperation and shared objectives.

Salome and Sheba are also portrayed as emotionally supportive siblings who discuss their worries about family expenses and their hopes, such as their excitement over their father's return. They participate together in domestic activities like playing the piano and talking, emphasizing their close daily connection. Additionally, the sisters share a common interest in gambling, specifically betting on a figure or event called Dandy Dick, where their involvement signifies shared pursuits and camaraderie.

Throughout various scenarios, Salome and Sheba are observed observing and commenting on their environment, often in a collaborative manner, highlighting their joint engagement and attentiveness to their surroundings. Overall, the relationship between Salome and Sheba is characterized by close sibling ties, mutual support, shared activities, and collaborative planning, illustrating a cohesive and supportive sisterly bond.</data>
      <data key="d9">collaboration,companionship,familial relation,familial relationship,family,planning,scene,sibling,sisterhood,sisters,support</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-5d690635b31230e7613331edb68d7205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd7991bf11c9a900752c7c353a0990c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bf94783f183c51cfeb7911ef8186ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39786c205992e5e0d95dca55454814f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea62626f9134cd6522f82d474b2c357b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2c82e11dcce129d5615a4deb4b0724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bebed720934a7d07e65bb3901bf810</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
